he public from the body and how to\ngain access to those services;\n(h) a description of any arrangement or provision for a person by consultation, making\nrepresentations or otherwise, to participate in or influence—\n(i) the formulation of policy; or\n(ii) the exercise of the powers or performance of duties, by the body;\n(i) a description of all remedies available in respect of an act or a failure to act by the body; and\n(j) such other information as may be prescribed.\n(2) A public body shall update and publish its manual at least once in every two years.\n(3) Each manual shall be made available as prescribed.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 3','3d6fb4002603a83bb1aec5db0ce459a91948a1baa69d5b014974edd95bcda666','Access to Information Act #U2014 Chapter 95','General','[-0.07588012,0.14445347,-0.05172141,-0.031127512,-0.055837773,0.007468939,0.023775088,-0.009961814,-0.039132055,0.07894863,-3.2303602E-4,0.031799685,0.02445295,-0.03867112,0.04054103,-0.08456321,0.01019782,-0.008596725,-0.10786119,0.0644278,0.089944646,0.09985957,0.057278194,0.028787354,-0.12066772,-0.045837257,-0.06085857,-0.081338115,0.024255864,-0.042318683,0.035706908,-0.0057888385,0.010357496,0.05357392,-0.029956618,0.057858758,0.016919067,-0.02328356,-0.0407136,0.013647164,0.008367828,-0.040826917,-0.06315207,-0.0030175336,0.092244096,0.06782184,0.01989962,0.04536771,-0.09913545,-0.014846893,-0.08607978,-0.03215709,0.008691337,0.06126835,0.0039923345,-0.07300049,-0.02006892,-0.05994744,-0.060706437,-0.02729199,0.026293706,-0.00917766,-0.06422339,0.0035096726,0.022704802,-0.069884166,0.056488875,0.028176744,-0.015158594,0.007811388,-0.041041568,-0.05112339,0.0015580263,0.069317594,-0.022784345,-0.07619301,-0.0054225004,8.289265E-4,-0.009863848,-0.05931944,-0.01213384,0.049063485,0.095706105,-0.03079633,-0.049396116,-0.061608832,-0.0024480722,-0.009690172,0.024934808,-0.033492282,0.027106456,-0.040563177,0.11786882,-0.018305197,-0.039687924,-0.026309455,0.039461598,-0.0337