 section shall be a fee representing the\nactual cost of retrieval and reproduction of the information.\n(3) The Minister may prescribe in the regulations for the contravention of any of the regulations, a\npenalty not exceeding two hundred and forty currency points or imprisonment for a period not\nexceeding three years or both.\n48. Power of Minister to amend Schedule\nThe Minister may, by statutory instrument with the approval of Cabinet, amend the Schedule.\nSchedule\nCurrency point\nOne currency point is equivalent to twenty thousand Uganda Shillings.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 18','3d6fb4002603a83bb1aec5db0ce459a91948a1baa69d5b014974edd95bcda666','Access to Information Act #U2014 Chapter 95','General','[-0.03735984,0.055576723,-0.019510105,-0.040399242,-0.01128515,0.03879325,0.06486464,-0.0010769725,0.015954986,0.08880847,0.04134398,-0.04162845,0.03226363,-0.053554595,-0.053349614,-0.05386885,-0.0010214491,-0.017377345,-0.099423595,0.0737555,0.1485092,0.06084184,0.043835875,0.015091428,-0.014033819,-0.032693826,-0.08008477,-0.04786701,0.039476804,-0.08551168,0.0121988775,0.048184603,0.016398191,0.016109787,0.0054477733,-0.029150013,0.036191918,0.02617846,0.020512689,-0.024813153,0.018864011,-0.021036727,-0.020351078,-0.030951988,0.0457367,0.0790495,0.042063948,0.026413562,-0.09328726,0.055496234,-0.089342475,-0.0063528935,0.018870896,0.027546762,-0.07950642,-0.08957984,-0.007752234,-0.03868463,-0.028771352,0.045431104,-0.08220551,0.02652299,-0.081563786,0.0055633695,-0.027149886,-0.038439505,-0.009532758,-0.04275397,0.008768113,0.009317624,0.039569795,-0.016897256,-0.016735647,-0.0010186294,-0.033224903,-0.025285726,0.019339096,0.085164644,0.015443791,-0.06117972,0.034621883,0.05312442,0.08502235,-0.042253256,0.011560151,-0.08942187,-0.048830267,0.0038166647,0.078753,-0.049747415,0.0934899,-0.040045615,0.038713645,0.038339578,0.08153321,-0.022805125,0.057375204,-0.037182882,0.020547144,0.015903974,-0.0022844612,-0.008644695,-0.08485