ay be appointed for the commencement of different provisions.\n(3) The Minister shall in any case ensure that the whole of this Act comes into force within the current\nfinancial year.\n2. Application\n(1) This Act applies to all information and records of Government ministries, departments, local\ngovernments, statutory corporations and bodies, commissions and other Government organs and\nagencies, unless specifically exempted by this Act.\n(2) This Act does not apply to—\n(a) Cabinet records and those of its committees;\n(b) records of court proceedings before the conclusion of the case.\n(3) Nothing in this Act detracts from the provisions of any other written law giving a right of access to\nthe record of a publ','3d6fb4002603a83bb1aec5db0ce459a91948a1baa69d5b014974edd95bcda666','Access to Information Act — Chapter 95','General','[-0.017391613,0.043911245,0.011353843,-0.0332875,-0.030507162,-0.009637381,0.024120178,-0.041834388,-0.024506291,0.09102499,-0.007367268,0.06888645,-0.02585589,-0.06919006,0.011940605,-0.027514193,-0.011527827,-0.06789322,-0.06940004,0.06016346,0.13318312,0.09317815,0.016278515,-0.020115055,-0.0017605884,-0.014369313,-0.07561486,-0.051165156,0.043836575,-0.07985542,0.036925092,0.034720216,0.031281617,0.04199153,-0.034375176,-0.048186082,0.044847254,0.03410916,0.033928033,-0.030647961,0.02644799,-0.08056376,-0.014681706,-0.058658727,0.025661228,0.09202177,0.051417775,-0.005301345,-0.06714754,0.039818354,-0.12025223,-0.024523983,0.03186886,-0.012008828,-0.057380814,-0.034648243,-0.018606883,-0.05075449,-0.009981034,0.029175807,-0.042209007,0.017145807,-0.05899819,4.5169337E-4,-0.026800327,-0.027265774,0.07159377,-0.064043425,-0.00818288,-0.019265812,0.021510089,-0.034764163,0.0052357265,-0.010117655,-0.0155688105,-0.01386872,0.03212568,0.07555598,0.01964089,-0.084380895,0.023360465,0.08848324,0.080402866,-0.03471612,0.0072550713,-0.047234345,-0.04406382,0.049118,0.06919829,-0.07293351,0.02268041,-0.07709259,0.048977014,0.09624707,0.072785