if that person complies with\nall the requirements in this Act relating to a request for access to that information or record; and\naccess to that information or record is not prohibited by this Part.\n(2) A request made under subsection (1) may be for information or records containing personal\ninformation relating to the person requesting the information.\n25. Cabinet minutes and those of its Committees\n(1) Subject to subsection (2), Cabinet minutes shall n','3d6fb4002603a83bb1aec5db0ce459a91948a1baa69d5b014974edd95bcda666','Access to Information Act — Chapter 95','General','[-0.06958634,0.09863162,0.012816317,-0.059402406,0.004205878,-0.003374737,0.07528327,-0.044567898,-0.0012653181,0.038996924,0.050957516,0.04126995,0.006247558,-0.09404436,0.007368794,-0.0067283385,0.02008621,-0.039050177,-0.08685764,0.088003986,0.09585864,0.06764403,0.010086553,0.009829238,-0.022086281,-0.0223495,-0.04977177,-0.014539969,0.09743346,-0.04583769,0.047130868,0.037644472,-0.01720483,0.028775925,-0.0036249205,-0.06463198,-0.006301927,0.009350293,-0.024925966,-0.010412943,-0.0057706493,-0.032825395,-0.009841046,-0.05189006,0.052713275,0.08017192,0.0149926655,-0.006351769,-0.07803931,0.014447849,-0.097668506,-0.03545355,0.018055271,0.033235393,-0.048616204,-0.07176696,-0.0047358354,-0.042811625,-0.07782663,0.037531126,-0.039878134,-0.032478448,-0.013455155,0.029142963,-0.06372548,-0.009505968,0.030711949,-0.024344778,0.032781452,-1.8435242E-4,0.055808123,-0.0029001639,-0.029766932,0.008699107,0.012627384,-0.036488585,-2.6868586E-4,-0.017069928,0.0484295,-0.063140795,0.03731418,0.05482254,0.0412936,-0.046814438,-0.0631061,-0.07634991,-0.020811597,-0.0014003346,0.06606999,-0.027982363,0.05435482,-0.07366736,0.012193309,0.07148843,0.08548358,-0.08091054,0.057891652,-0.051581305,-0.012414858,0.016594378,-0.04709898,0.017557958,-0.07527951,0.019658476,0.025935985,-0.05291554,0.05626496,-0.032972544,0.034778543,0.052712336,-0.0202885,0.0031735976,-0.062578365,-0.036066,0.014525394,-0.0394