ration that has occurred, including,\nbut not limited to, minutes of a meeting, for the purpose of assisting to take a decision\nin the exercise of a power or performance of a duty conferred or imposed by law; or\n(b) if the disclosure of the record','3d6fb4002603a83bb1aec5db0ce459a91948a1baa69d5b014974edd95bcda666','Access to Information Act — Chapter 95','General','[-0.059034914,0.03948462,-0.025721347,-0.047545385,-0.036476236,-0.03479157,0.07167409,-0.02094473,0.017355032,0.08230982,-0.003485174,0.00482327,0.028081939,-0.010690005,-0.015984658,-0.008476007,0.005715363,-0.0551819,-0.08276718,0.06806813,0.12929416,0.072738595,0.050183006,0.009475899,-0.049691103,-0.03621551,-0.051476505,-0.055534303,0.0058526564,-0.03910867,0.017505456,0.05830755,0.017774394,0.05418421,-0.03768744,0.057571467,0.060881723,0.017212804,0.03621155,-0.05333283,0.004893331,-0.07685119,0.024644546,-0.09571028,-0.005701989,0.046313122,0.055297166,0.011390799,-0.102125034,0.007732965,-0.0472349,-0.0096182665,-0.011736611,0.11441023,-0.005306556,-0.042113062,-0.0186282,-0.066240385,-0.009999719,0.066036545,-0.029637534,0.011556379,-0.043662243,0.039196137,-0.02784043,-0.056375273,0.0424285,-0.016399376,-0.03245883,-0.01563031,0.06794132,-0.038742978,0.011829576,0.01078254,0.0120255975,-0.05437643,0.05341265,0.008324064,0.049069785,-0.12136594,0.09944026,0.14354286,0.106607884,-0.0013398579,0.005746739,-0.05271878,-0.047725234,-0.02235162,0.10536375,-0.029518368,-0.037604444,-0.10460372,0.08251229,0.060315583,0.045014262,-0.06279486,0.08082827,-0.024629261,0.011091727,0.06871783,0.003603322,-0.019489113,-0.093365796,-0.03816044,-0.08517735,-0.016482215,0.025033358,-0.03379004,-0.020995734,0.08787104,-0.089035,-8.6933677E-4,-0.106224895,-0.050255958,0.01829289,-0.033312924,-0.03843717,0.058984824,0.028549932,-0.03724184,-0.035416193,-0.020289896,0.0252368,-0.069681235,-0.057438705,-0.03128747,-0.034451135,-2.1901434E-33,-0.013413885,0.0072994316,-0.096830726,0.03553842,-0.055924185,0.04912194