evidence of wrongdoing or a serious threat to health, safety or the environment.\n(2) For purposes of subsection (1), wrongdoing includes the commission of a criminal offence,\nfailure to comply with a legal obligation, a miscarriage of justice, corruption or dishonesty, or\nmaladministration regarding a public body.\n45. Protection of officers\nA public officer, information officer or other person acting on the directions of such a person is not subject\nto any civil or criminal liability for any act done or omitted to be done in good faith in the exercise or\nperformance of any power or duty under this Act.\n46. Offences\nA person who with intent to deny a right of access under this Act-\n(a) destroys, damages or alters a record;\n(b) conceals a record; or\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 17','3d6fb4002603a83bb1aec5db0ce459a91948a1baa69d5b014974edd95bcda666','Access to Information Act — Chapter 95','General','[-0.021120077,0.1072403,-0.06788401,0.014903067,0.0446906,0.04112231,0.05169659,-0.065165594,-0.048826743,0.10485089,0.0799056,-0.059356123,0.04386601,-0.040076666,-0.04972458,-0.07979653,0.024582144,0.03442526,-0.07441919,0.08071215,0.0058645345,0.08002866,0.02603596,0.042243496,-0.14676592,-0.03495807,0.013063864,-0.041498486,-0.028595364,-0.024663461,-0.012477492,-0.047998227,0.033141054,0.04160701,-0.04086978,0.026711687,0.04642003,-0.016091224,0.037521485,-0.008781462,0.014012644,-0.05687154,-0.01862253,-0.025399122,-0.0041677007,0.004308479,0.08793146,-0.0152641805,-0.050156165,-0.098955,-0.070200264,0.04339795,-0.014736293,0.03924589,-0.067124926,-0.09982936,-0.02023201,0.014284479,-0.031425424,0.019111184,0.08037197,7.4973813E-4,0.015512178,0.003992474,0.017331017,0.008322862,-0.036646623,-0.0035050835,0.058671366,0.070090756,0.0321129,-0.09346363,-0.016416417,-0.04793743,-0.023865558,-0.0016071732,0.0055379383,-0.004547568,0.015144711,-0.07663077,0.08270368,0.017939053,0.013790673,-0.021717135,0.024171786,-0.036990084,-0.0090376