ion;\n“care order” means a care order made under Part V of this Act and includes an interim care order;\n“chief magistrate’s court” means a magistrate’s court presided over by a chief magistrate;\n“competent authority” means an official or body or other person authorised expressly or impliedly by\nany enactment or otherwise to perform the act in question;\n“custodian” means a','03732deb83b98470b631759d9be07356e74356f15c0d8a836fd4bd15382d0c0a','Children Act','General','[-0.07459186,0.058890577,0.012969761,-0.0062619043,-0.038769525,-0.0080617145,-0.012553654,0.0010744914,-0.043061875,0.13646711,0.075812764,-0.030929008,-0.0097484235,-0.00414886,0.07464842,0.004189845,0.0012818899,-0.0598577,-0.055787914,0.0015470771,0.12530456,0.10271442,0.068026535,-0.0016457612,-0.010917228,0.06456349,-0.029759388,-0.058569532,0.018559737,-0.02154723,0.094400726,0.013390229,0.05649583,-0.012779797,-0.010018416,0.03855415,0.08555129,0.0073717637,0.0064407797,-0.041258283,0.08726475,-0.06416121,-0.02060382,-0.13303299,0.021156218,0.0062146215,0.0033410678,-0.07771709,-0.032065213,6.260461E-4,-0.035398092,-0.026196968,0.029741965,0.05938883,-0.036398295,-0.032497946,-0.029513074,-0.06615309,0.09376777,-0.017915167,0.036109515,0.04777694,-0.10749513,-0.004352068,-0.015947863,-0.1305186,0.034899004,-0.060504332,0.0369054,0.006176167,0.018568307,1.1467825E-4,0.07457453,0.05804077,-0.030984236,0.014717896,0.045045674,0.01906476,0.053133607,-0.12626527,-0.032913394,0.04219799,0.11058198,-0.05815504,0.0022211566,0.00803591,-0.013514228,-0.021969877,0.021654097,-0.036049385,0.070276454,0.0014483441,0.088662915,0.06409753,0.05069878,-0.09756892,0.01746985,-0.051744148,-0.034881003,0.040218983,-0.0030114308,-0.014395688,0.013328087,0.04410479,-0.033131894,-0.03638169,0.058419254,0.030558674,-0.038473815,0.030260902,-0.100848354,-0.034878228,-0.031873357,0.0038413377,-0.02704556,-0.043837566,0.034845136,-0.04948155,0.0023245665,-0.025811274,-0.01650825,0.022573207,-0.018691277,-0.10174091,-3.63