ourt in every district, and any other\nlower government unit designated by the Chief Justice by notice in the Gazette.\n(2) A magistrate not below the grade of magistrate grade II shall be assigned to preside over the family\nand children court.\n14. Jurisdiction of family and children court\n(1) A family and children court shall have power to hear and determine —\n(a) criminal charges against a child subject to sections 93 and 94; and\n(b) applications relating to child care and protection.\n(2) The court shall also exercise any other jurisdiction conferred on it by this or any other written law.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 4','03732deb83b98470b631759d9be07356e74356f15c0d8a836fd4bd15382d0c0a','Children Act','General','[-0.054231405,0.06850515,-0.027104853,-0.080664225,-0.01827181,0.0047027557,0.0049976087,0.036241923,0.024337238,0.058474828,0.11738689,-0.06983476,0.020957086,-0.009663068,0.06879697,0.059872463,0.09423699,0.034725007,-0.028054392,0.0050010094,0.08017011,0.019343123,0.037550926,-0.030094078,-0.06455922,0.056201555,-0.024205785,-0.0134357335,0.020314148,-0.0707616,0.05261875,-0.05571347,0.06725779,0.0048087016,-0.0073546544,0.062855035,0.046627928,-0.041047327,-0.0012689313,-0.036960665,0.007449929,0.048432175,0.05239742,-0.07341045,0.05976799,0.022602603,-0.0531658,-0.017107712,-0.051349606,-0.037667826,-0.0012974679,-0.04358127,0.008877606,0.1153092,-0.08214365,0.033752672,-0.0074346904,-0.023871724,-0.02876816,0.021213118,-0.050355725,0.030655628,-0.08451878,-0.021470254,-0.085049205,-0.025335047,0.08606657,-0.035480585,0.030215876,-0.041174296,0.0012204826,0.021580448,0.01774567,0.0672252,-0.10313418,0.08074732,-0.020635273,0.06701378,-0.019166151,-0.0908442,-0.058052473,0.007515891,0.0016633106,-0.11031837,-0.02249477,-0.010400004,-0.004555201,-0.03366474,0.021708988,0.057581056,0.09488236,-0.056618392,0.04192998,0.028782966,0.05333323,-0.013895385,-0.0014978173,-0.08474609,-0.03922496,0.03459907,0.044364285,0.015946021