ove a child from a situation where he or she is suffering or likely to suffer significant harm;\nand\n(b) to assist the child and those with whom he or she was living or wishes to live to examine the\ncircumstances that have led to the making of the order and to take steps to resolve or ameliorate\nthe problem so as to ensure the child’s return to the community.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 7','03732deb83b98470b631759d9be07356e74356f15c0d8a836fd4bd15382d0c0a','Children Act','General','[-0.026631158,0.13466814,0.033308107,0.046780888,0.041003264,0.05025895,0.01155077,-0.0253948,0.020835705,0.109238535,0.08604417,0.032648183,-0.013833217,-3.3632125E-4,-0.02092603,-0.018210327,0.0672239,-0.08022982,-0.10552985,0.087844275,0.080526516,0.055541568,0.0016612536,1.6445907E-4,-0.06869175,0.0374196,-0.017755048,0.0023026508,0.09116147,-0.007278359,0.07706823,-0.009506453,0.015660994,0.020449487,-0.060427047,0.057355933,0.033078916,-0.03032601,-0.021796012,-0.04740881,0.074749,0.037060365,0.033101995,-0.074659444,0.051919162,-0.015868174,0.010570787,-0.038058616,-0.014166504,-0.09191127,-0.038379967,0.008188579,-0.07480305,0.1316402,-0.09235615,0.011690572,0.062408756,-0.13541709,-0.050185118,-0.023804847,-0.006998844,0.022566501,-0.036497794,0.005844532,-0.004625701,-0.09523408,0.06272959,-0.061957262,0.03715586,0.067806475,0.0045191497,-0.07080353,0.055431474,0.07913783,0.015156731,0.05308299,0.01910876,-0.061249353,-0.007303161,-0.0942702,0.0365827,0.06892041,0.08644195,0.027189417,-0.04575798,-0.018545568,-0.0010805811,-0.10744731,0.064098395,4.9738225E-4,0.036529187,-0.021204624,0.12983674,-0.0027475923,0.036570277,-0.090117894,0.028006425,-0.050015964,-0.08423378,0.021240883,-0.009001721,-0.028831499,-0.046355586,0.04193391,-0.009122068,-0.053887036,-0.115474954,-0.06806711,-0.06135681,0.028620742,-0.113701425,0.019290201,-0.04384637,-0.06725728,-0.014171661,0.025624437,0.0090930965,-0.03482168,0.009231471,-0.0740919,-0.028807933,-0.023967788,-