 in this Part\nreferred to as a “foster parent”.\n(2) An application to foster a child shall be made to the district probation and social welfare officer,\nexcept that a relative of a child without a parent or guardian may foster the child without first\napplying to the district probation and social welfare officer, and this Part shall not apply to him or\nher.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 10','03732deb83b98470b631759d9be07356e74356f15c0d8a836fd4bd15382d0c0a','Children Act','General','[-0.06043887,0.106579594,-0.016182251,0.0075053833,-0.016109033,0.020526875,-0.020527871,0.0041874787,-0.027870417,0.018893404,0.06934843,8.9010206E-4,0.02623147,-0.023956124,-0.011635552,-0.060324386,0.06500912,-0.06533542,0.0045535327,0.03026394,0.08055635,-0.035781857,0.039952327,-0.037062753,0.030138887,0.053401507,-0.044517398,-0.03306387,0.08546156,0.043895278,0.03848192,-0.02132812,0.037695173,-0.009054312,0.003988272,0.034931973,0.03674963,0.04629206,-0.0080419015,-0.012320661,0.06484529,0.013088426,0.022688469,0.017103644,0.023806874,-0.008221691,-0.02169725,-0.03723017,-0.066731766,-0.10962472,-0.09550416,-0.028289214,0.0059318617,0.15875058,-0.07775172,0.017750505,0.04291805,-0.08502123,-0.08245615,0.008745605,-0.053025138,0.032499768,0.025607256,-0.025715511,0.0049475296,-0.01972761,-0.020741055,-0.0534537,0.12505955,-0.026886372,0.011710557,0.039911315,0.06847877,0.034904987,-0.015017709,0.05068813,0.0065837963,-0.0018603378,0.049260534,-0.09413111,-0.0024987888,-0.0100814495,0.005436283,-0.03828445,-0.116322204,0.0059500732,0.032204915,-0.06773367,-0.05843552,0.031326078,0.10339165,-0.054380126,-0.025674652,-0.036954816,0.115273364,-0.042520784,0.029520588,-0.055157553,-0.031196702,-0.01215648,0.018169103,0.0016395297,0.010512626,0.065493695,-0.053115297,-0.04333932,-0.07622175,-0.05478026,-0.039105672,0.027685868,-0.037541606,0.02052795,0.031962585,0.0062613543,-0.023089992,0.023478026,0.04384931,0.022275066,0.051600013,-0.018490039,-0.009434638