oney shall be due and payable to the custodian.\n(2) The court may also order that the money shall be paid into court and then paid to the applicant or\ncustodian in a manner and subject to any condition as the court may direct.\n80. Appointment of custodian\n(1) Whenever a maintenance order is made against the father or mother, a court may, at the time of\nmaking the order or from time to time thereafter, on being satisfied that th','03732deb83b98470b631759d9be07356e74356f15c0d8a836fd4bd15382d0c0a','Children Act','General','[-0.10728261,0.096071236,0.064618096,-0.035916194,-0.021265209,-0.014621152,0.03631887,-0.012531583,-0.003284149,0.055263463,0.0575577,0.02323986,0.020747192,-0.060943622,-0.03831713,0.018236302,0.09968449,0.030247357,-0.12653214,0.022663327,0.021421444,-0.005197818,-0.02116641,0.02077963,-3.5403753E-4,0.06241017,-0.013867572,7.079107E-4,0.06157232,0.0065579736,-0.021370014,-0.029341444,-0.007940978,0.0195067,-0.0520798,0.05428966,0.030575976,-0.06520727,-0.02793976,0.025532207,-0.009174799,0.0647215,0.008879903,-0.035859488,-0.013261619,-0.02101087,0.0072275554,-0.012022688,-0.006594885,-0.023559786,-0.012160439,-0.012702185,0.029598825,0.13693468,-0.062806085,0.012414757,0.11014626,-0.08693655,-0.06959157,0.024360312,1.3335643E-5,0.04302804,-0.036814786,-0.01657201,0.032555867,-0.06886129,0.068692304,-0.0686539,0.043768194,0.06818405,-0.016467785,0.008567512,-0.047925632,0.03863371,-0.07746513,0.047715582,0.03383373,-0.02802612,-0.037765034,-0.15562898,-0.01271105,0.045727886,0.08143742,0.0034895688,0.030092582,-0.07383558,-0.046580207,0.0049679647,0.1330998,0.07210924,0.06124103,-0.016099649,0.05962869,-0.052574493,0.020509291,-0.019753609,0.022597875,-0.004957644,-0.039452124,-0.014809256,0.019589879,0.02015087,0.03614444,-0.0021902672,0.050592195,0.0020140074,-0.06498119,-0.013403066,-0.061090212,0.020500438,-0.04109773,-0.010050266,0.02796419,-0.020765008,-0.019210838,0.0579852,-0.04092697,0.039114993,0.033732228,-0.09822365,0.089753635,0.