re concerning children\nshall be dealt with by the village local council court where the child resides or where the cause of\naction arises.\n(2) A village local council court shall, in addition to any jurisdiction conferred on it by the Local\nCouncil Courts Act, 2006, have criminal jurisdiction to try a child for any of the following offences\n—\n(a) affray, under section 79 of the Penal Code Act;\n(b) an offence against section 167 with the exception of paragraph (b) of the Penal Code Act;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 23','03732deb83b98470b631759d9be07356e74356f15c0d8a836fd4bd15382d0c0a','Children Act','General','[-0.015006205,-0.019256886,-0.043004032,-0.009628348,0.04108729,0.02808428,0.02614268,-0.053415027,-0.06438424,0.06554857,0.14525785,-0.014906071,-0.029983135,0.0061263116,0.076580845,0.030413587,0.054319073,0.030695604,0.04627283,-0.005889236,0.056179155,0.050609026,0.03517443,-0.0029544197,-0.04577775,0.00217053,-0.014488279,0.03820673,-0.014046925,0.00513242,0.026561186,0.006290114,-0.03950129,-0.059318665,0.020699626,0.114510395,0.06850122,-0.015344088,0.0049301037,-0.033954944,-0.019131038,0.041753333,-0.0045809867,-0.043528702,0.058769323,-0.045106668,-0.07398225,-0.034031928,-0.025530651,-0.10099187,-0.005907888,-0.015140601,-0.0019358994,0.15531062,-0.01105724,-7.4798946E-4,0.008879492,-0.02234476,0.049045227,-0.004125373,-0.02601381,0.08011286,-0.04751211,-0.038055804,0.046843696,-0.07845992,-0.015734147,-0.06419717,0.11296909,0.027065169,0.063980125,-0.053439517,-0.009336294,0.032075405,-0.1104273,-0.025019139,-0.014866966,0.019034708,0.06550549,-0.050065473,0.004000086,0.035689466,0.04736596,-0.06580569,-0.02243326,-0.040249716,-0.0294466,-0.026841283,0.09381313,0.046758216,0.09852029,0.038269743,0.031427495,-0.013058893,0.044205233,-0.1044687,-0.02300906,-0.011278245,-0.049747184,0.034529936,-0.01355367,-0.011038526,-0.018583026,0.033334285,0.027127543,-0.026373925,0.0063762963,0.009166805,-0.01760759,0.063314945,-0.