t\nA child jointly charged with a person over eighteen years of age may be tried in a magistrate’s court.\n104. Children in the High Court\n(1) A child shall be tried in the High Court for an offence with which the child is jointly charged with a\nperson over eighteen years of age and for which only the High Court has jurisdiction.\n(2) Where a child is tried jointly with an adult in the High Court, the child shall be remitted to the\nfamily and children court for an appropriate order to be made if the offence is proved against the\nchild.\n(3) In any proceedings before the High Court in which a child i','03732deb83b98470b631759d9be07356e74356f15c0d8a836fd4bd15382d0c0a','Children Act','General','[-0.07855577,0.11967952,-0.018286973,-0.027102133,-0.020929746,0.026046367,0.03621726,-0.016812827,0.024155984,0.058945734,0.14457242,-0.008167445,0.064982496,-0.0372322,-0.039104328,0.020085374,0.053937636,0.0021339592,-0.06269077,5.555772E-4,0.09767769,0.062770195,0.033294868,0.013448201,0.0045952094,0.05363073,-0.025416926,-0.03393205,-0.021048583,-0.030402107,0.07124629,-5.396684E-4,0.019319259,-0.014639424,-0.016108915,-0.006399121,0.08802007,0.0068596327,0.043002117,-0.06183539,0.037695173,-0.0079285465,-0.04055443,-0.11231942,0.047271397,-0.025223346,0.025851192,0.029656617,-0.021691496,-0.02066815,-0.08971625,-0.09962618,0.031607848,0.084409244,-0.072921306,-0.06289888,-0.059165996,-0.024321413,0.0059862393,0.02758241,-0.0760698,0.037216667,-0.06947145,-0.0146595845,-0.012804676,-0.07153436,0.012475328,-0.043722983,0.025739823,0.051665064,0.079965964,0.03611636,0.06074625,0.047098894,-0.08321544,0.02436998,0.02167966,-0.008569919,0.03543052,-0.12320078,-0.019603232,-8.809907E-4,0.1261234,-0.11540148,-0.017958961,-0.039353885,-0.011460627,-0.0145061705,0.037534267,-0.05766406,0.036431927,-0.04911862,0.090999484,0.06431521,0.056602906,-0.087826714,-0.0010978485,-0.04333766,-0.015574315,0.0040360973,-0.0107504595,0.05137332,-0.003900348,0.052801527,0.0556207,-0.04175071