 contents of any computer;\nand\n(b) has the requisite intent and the requisite knowledge at the time when he or she does the act,\ncommits an offence.\n(2) For the purposes of subsection (1)(b) the requisite intent is an intent to cause a modification of the\ncontents of any computer and by doing so—\n(a) to impair the operation of any computer;\n(b) to prevent or hinder access to any program or data held in any computer; or\n(c) to impair the operation of any such program or the reliability of any such data.\n(3) The intent under subsection (1)(b)','0a02353af824e926ae6ad3bd87afed1f9ff6ccca737f32f1749528f00059cb85','Computer Misuse Act #U2014 Chapter 96','General','[-0.040349234,0.028295454,-0.024940189,-0.065577194,0.0054409658,0.01869001,0.08800342,-0.030651571,0.0023707158,0.048486795,0.126451,-0.04560473,0.090936616,-0.011615733,-0.005815397,-0.09117518,-0.023640208,-0.076549694,-0.07092304,0.08861972,0.10440972,-0.042902555,-0.03504516,0.02640622,-0.03291302,-0.013655178,-0.017798735,-0.05523281,-0.012049081,-0.047297027,0.01574018,0.018397778,0.010073583,0.07465828,-0.027161853,-0.019218616,0.07154679,0.012925603,0.028336184,-0.055407908,0.026629789,-0.019246668,0.020953132,-0.064657494,0.039682534,-0.026278326,0.005411311,-0.009443238,-0.09714555,0.007548405,-0.046116307,-0.0033100909,0.036793057,0.09892503,-0.08058017,-0.08911469,0.009779497,0.032858793,0.027238589,0.011389333,0.002927636,0.030532464,-0.04670661,-0.011658129,0.019055527,-0.070604436,0.013086484,-0.056154873,0.0063752504,0.0711255,0.04302356,-0.12513372,-0.061049018,0.0032239323,-0.040786974,-0.013477943,-0.013511854,0.052554335,-2.9849116E-4,-0.11313829,0.028214881,0.078522965,0.09643788,-0.046208836,0.035687484,-0.087454624,-0.048092693,0.037090074,0.10233728,-0.06785299,0.04750232,-0.0038355931,0.12982272,0.0022628938,0.06385095,-0.048441708,0.023946173,-0.032998577,0.04636519,0.04879549,-0.0037299122,0.037266087,-0.07257557,6.4918876E-4,0.05851683,-0.018180287,0.037243273,0.027454501,-0.