ny person who willfully and repeatedly uses electronic communication to disturb or attempts to disturb\nthe peace, quiet or right of privacy of any person with no purpose of legitimate communication whether\nor not a conversation ensues commits a misdemeanor and is liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding\ntwenty four currency points or imprisonment not exceeding one year or both.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 8','0a02353af824e926ae6ad3bd87afed1f9ff6ccca737f32f1749528f00059cb85','Computer Misuse Act #U2014 Chapter 96','General','[-0.027512964,0.07863627,-0.04719949,-0.090485334,0.025731882,0.03701598,0.080968715,-0.03748332,0.04363826,0.039105434,0.0675066,-0.062992826,0.09302298,0.04172505,0.007505256,-0.048548847,0.046523314,-0.06960734,-0.05964653,0.03579973,0.078161374,0.03275985,0.007153655,0.008297298,-0.10419754,-0.027951749,-0.0010522251,-0.054825705,-0.06905551,0.03616219,-0.043171007,0.013556217,0.0010555453,0.072264425,-0.05750733,-0.10394154,0.03336435,0.037580907,0.026668495,-0.07303654,0.01576446,-0.06641307,0.024940778,-0.06242888,0.0073955595,0.009646432,0.041111905,0.07924507,-0.08499747,-0.08966333,0.007731174,0.069850385,0.02241312,0.10229466,-0.036382567,-0.1255868,0.0070677013,0.027356107,0.04091808,0.049282756,0.04150708,-0.014829257,-0.0015798463,0.04573735,0.011086561,-0.06279611,-0.025322566,0.046280764,-0.012273971,0.14535727,0.051368788,-0.07448057,-0.051696815,0.080547765,0.059793793,0.04620658,-0.0051225997,0.012845167,0.0050001913,-0.059658345,-0.010644101,0.004522078,0.030898547,-0.02534826,0.0019318719,-0.045720898,-0.033155136,0.04493098,0.092224956,-0.035266794,0.05052655,-0.007517723,0.07554869,0.027103797,-0.03377226,-0.09095626,-0.022303334,-0.06176046,-0.06806329,0.049557365,-0.026221517,-0.041492343,-0.04150944,-0.03227079,0.024336819,0.035839885,-0.0066193854,0.030979767,-0.028946755,0.008219672,-0.09059703,-0.008845465,-0.05345165,-0.0231548,0.07654114,0.024968447,-0.011166454,0.015993536,0.094455