y any mechanical or electronic device, the request shall be deemed\nto require the person to produce or give access to it in a form in which it can be taken away and in\nwhich it is visible and legible.\nPart III – Computer misuse offences\n12. Unauthorised access\n(1) A person who intentionally accesses or intercepts any program or data without authority or\npermiss','0a02353af824e926ae6ad3bd87afed1f9ff6ccca737f32f1749528f00059cb85','Computer Misuse Act — Chapter 96','General','[-0.074028194,0.07282283,0.009407917,-0.062933855,0.0034473108,-0.0054058866,0.027365377,-0.07389386,0.070205815,0.0829123,0.08168905,0.10745951,0.065505646,-0.052611537,-0.04057502,-0.064244576,0.023367003,-0.05519037,-0.09459338,0.03299369,0.07136826,-0.0080665415,-0.041608013,0.0065105353,-0.05501426,0.0065499856,-0.048092477,-0.05516397,0.024576068,-0.06958854,0.02875848,0.030017197,0.029985394,0.099198766,-0.031237442,-0.016164914,0.057663467,-0.05830582,0.008659727,-0.01740784,0.019442312,-0.041726954,-0.029866537,-0.058489777,0.010480194,0.0386609,0.052498553,0.03491506,-0.09560414,-0.0018151066,-0.1145476,-0.017455349,-0.021400493,0.12607877,-0.08126815,-0.07267655,0.04389719,-0.018510781,-0.027658684,0.08444285,0.009258663,0.024427451,-0.058623817,0.006834886,0.033615213,-0.012484165,0.08481859,-0.011582919,0.021844482,0.043641172,0.04603012,-0.048272207,-0.059046138,0.059316922,-0.07816523,-0.02186663,-0.017820466,-0.035300236,-0.012864874,-0.09089996,0.050923303,0.05423633,0.047603264,9.405473E-4,-0.021365743,-0.06846779,-0.01933491,-0.016862208,0.047726355,-0.08469739,-0.013507679,-0.04665713,0.079857364,0.036889,0.0779746,-0.054603267,0.08316411,-0.008416118,0.073620364,0.011259428,0.0018331443,0.04319121,-0.053576585,-0.021008162,0.0056327707,-0.08296167,-0.025605632,0.0067395936,9.5845736E-4,0.080809355,-0.03244374,0.047163323,-0.08750646,-0.016057808,0.062108956,0.008145936,-0.06536662,0.11714763,-0.031458814,-0.026012246,-0.037322756,0.031718194,0.023179933,-0.052588183,-0.0