 woman to be searched, the search shall be made by another woman with\nstrict regard to decency.\n9. Power to seize offensive weapons\nA police officer or other person making any arrest may take from the person arrested any offensive\nweapons which the person arrested has about his or her person, and shall deliver all weapons so taken to\nthe court or officer before which or whom the police officer or person making the arrest is required by law\nto produce the person arrested.\n10. Arrest without warrant\nA police officer may, without an order from a magistrate and without a warrant, arrest—\n(a) any person w','78f0a6c3863b9e84011a87177aff28bb2df1e080e88773c5f12b550ce73afb7f','Criminal Procedure Code Act','General','[-0.079050295,0.076799765,0.0025577063,-0.024594596,0.020137403,0.001396686,0.07387903,-0.058983237,-0.021413011,0.064609736,0.10730973,0.020160435,0.0032287824,-0.045113344,0.0033013192,-0.050446816,0.031264473,-0.027324954,-0.036443405,0.08260927,0.06478903,-9.6269953E-4,0.037642516,-0.04980879,-0.114003114,0.047303006,-0.0359658,-0.06512233,0.0647254,-0.020693852,0.04052038,0.047834016,0.029654915,0.09695956,-0.005887409,0.008451901,0.04927663,-0.03768375,0.080854036,-0.051529277,-0.0228367,-0.06786362,-6.028528E-4,-0.06669771,0.021956475,0.018352037,0.03831836,0.024794122,-0.035647176,-0.11351172,-0.031189555,-0.015847752,-0.044596154,0.048362494,-0.048157264,-0.092043325,0.024622865,-0.07240018,0.0641452,-0.024142537,0.051251274,0.064068325,-0.040261306,-0.010265248,0.022508973,-0.08335878,-9.5874065E-4,-0.037008222,0.039393548,0.049629264,0.09020885,-0.0023336215,-0.022720799,0.099522054,-0.002117447,-0.017090818,0.06532069,-0.09686068,-0.016959896,-0.058871,-0.041662805,0.04011318,0.06542135,0.009705749,0.0048913765,-0.043914538,-0.0701157,-3.0616292E-4,0.0939979,-0.081340864,0.036665723,-0.01930486,-0.023922354,-0.033585407,0.047535717,-0.045560226,-0.030188158,0.033679314,0.018014826,0.00893636,0.03198071,0.047461472,-0.005186702,-0.00625737,0.0