any offence\nfor which under any law provision is made for arrest without warrant;\n(b) any person who commits a breach of the peace in the presence of the police officer;\n(c) any person who obstructs a police officer while in the execution of his or her duty, or who has\nescaped or attempts to escape from lawful custody;\n(d) any person whom the police officer suspects upon reasonable grounds of being a deserter from the\nUganda Peoples’ Defence Forces;\n(e) any person whom the police officer finds in any highway, yard or other place during the night and\nwhom he or she suspects, upon reasonable grounds, of having committed or about to commit a\nfelony;\n(f) any person whom a police officer suspects upon reasonable grounds of having been concerned in\nany act committed at any place out of Uganda which, if committed in Uganda, would have been\npunishable as an offence, and for which that person is, under the provisions of any written law,\nliable to be apprehended and detained in Uganda;\n(g) any person having in his or her possession without lawful excuse any implement of housebreaking\nand the burden of proving that he or she was in lawful possession of the implement shall lie on that\nperson;\n(h) any person for whom the police officer has reasonable cause to believe a warrant of arrest has been\nissued; or\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 3','78f0a6c3863b9e84011a87177aff28bb2df1e080e88773c5f12b550ce73afb7f','Criminal Procedure Code Act','General','[-0.07243499,0.057396896,-0.013573586,-0.03499113,0.022415567,0.027063766,0.027173521,-0.055104166,-0.0028233752,0.11471072,0.14718656,-0.036120284,0.023758592,-0.088445425,0.04490471,-0.08678604,0.021606777,-0.08465438,-0.097044684,0.04240011,0.057913255,0.005136915,0.08808738,-0.009627956,-0.084423766,0.0024397648,-0.0016915861,-0.055852387,0.059998203,-0.003159941,0.024418728,0.0070087845,0.063203916,0.029659845,-0.06929245,0.018090315,0.10678217,0.013167135,0.027610986,-0.03699011,0.046677586