 order the release of the appellant if he or she is in custody; and\n(b) if it is inconvenient for the judge or any of the judges who heard the appeal to deliver the\njudgment, the judgment may be read in open court by another judge or by the registrar at the\ntime and place appointed or fixed.\n(2) In this section, “judge” referred to in subsection (1)(b) includes a magistrate.\n39. Appellate court to make orders conformable with judgment\nWhen a case is decided on appeal by the appellate court, it shall thereupon make such orders as are\nconformable to the judgment or order and shall if necessary cause the record of the lower court to be\namended in accordance with that judgment or order.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 10','78f0a6c3863b9e84011a87177aff28bb2df1e080e88773c5f12b550ce73afb7f','Criminal Procedure Code Act','General','[-0.0024863016,0.08107305,-0.017354323,-0.060013775,0.02556261,-0.016415533,0.1245045,0.03349744,0.07123818,0.033989657,0.061133265,-0.026295587,-0.021119414,-0.04070345,-0.053966355,0.0386494,0.055014536,0.045845363,-0.03616507,0.033616077,0.07357559,0.08606296,-0.027210174,0.028247654,-0.004015233,-0.03330589,-0.072752595,-0.0069986857,0.03743025,-0.033905294,0.06325091,-0.011187578,-0.060182065,-0.06459817,0.0076735076,0.06632543,0.0033475328,-0.008309766,-0.0351011,-0.0274557,0.053503226,0.047334965,0.0033536723,-0.02821537,0.020903945,0.003405661,-0.019356158,-0.013618753,-0.079223834,0.0487479,-0.028770559,-0.0778021,-0.009005985,0.087500714,-0.081073195,0.058679953,0.05011816,0.0044343113,-0.043172166,0.013103365,-0.070955366,0.0068157455,-0.09839687,0.01639226,0.0027529055,-0.030986574,0.08297722,-0.028807579,0.021681031,-0.019347582,0.0653543,0.019089589,0.025950432,-0.05151565,-0.09273271,0.04977671,0.04015595,0.019812163,-0.041273396,-0.018697038,0.019602405,-0.043279234,0.035631366,-0.12943272,-0.007931379,-0.030290037,0.015336456,-0.006351961,0.07524847,0.06309548,0.10954855,-0.042241175,-0.018817712,0.