ssary —\n(i) for the prevention, detection, investigation, prosecution or punishment of an offence\nor breach of law;\n(ii) for the enforcement of a law which imposes a pecuniary penalty;\n(iii) for the enforcement of legislation which concerns public revenue collection;\n(iv) for the conduct of proceedings before any court or tribunal that have commenced or\nare reasonably contemplated; or\n(v) for the protection of national security;\n(f) compliance would prejudice a lawful purpose for the collection; or\n(g) it is not reasonably practicable to obtain the consent of the data subject.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 5','afc68cfbce40552b7071ff18a27c0852a29fccb80387833930d548111a91c055','Data Protection and Privacy Act, 2019','General','[-0.056651298,0.11794349,-0.13003138,-0.032285776,0.032024603,0.005508741,0.0076452633,-0.026381465,0.03078057,0.09630514,0.042096566,-0.008587133,0.06326002,-0.0493856,-0.022420317,-0.03411301,0.03737647,-0.062033407,-0.058351457,0.047957156,0.03129348,0.042152673,0.06789835,8.48196E-4,-0.07622698,0.049070057,-0.015641797,-0.03271698,0.036024157,-0.03664198,0.030568773,0.023861533,0.0051644277,0.0819698,0.0015896509,-0.10318102,0.007843259,-0.005504272,0.0010022132,-0.002172266,0.04083661,-0.036413945,-0.046963755,-0.008862295,-0.02919262,0.07838201,0.047164783,0.038439836,-0.10065935,0.014447494,-0.045970224,0.01533856,-0.038956266,0.08158673,-0.034464713,-0.08558504,-0.027690284,-0.050349273,0.020929646,0.028202184,-0.01606874,-0.032827325,-0.10693964,0.021767952,0.032640867,-0.051839516,0.016810233,0.06119263,-0.022588316,0.00961423,0.061459105,-0.037685372,-0.03292816,-0.002377149,0.025159454,-0.015868312,-0.03102592,6.8608276E-4,-0.0054107592,-0.13236114,0.02636851,0.040513232,0.100822076,-0.010069086,-0.043299697,-0.078971356,0.026136344,-0.010711013,0.05457635,-0.05007997,0.028528718,-0.0033114378,0.09632219,0.07401039,0.009355337,-0.026291166,0.0021612458,-0.028920911,0.072964564,0.014293883,-0.00983976