be for that specific purpose.\n(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), a person who processes personal data under this section shall\ntake into account —\n(a) the relationship between the purpose of the intended further processing and the purpose for\nwhich the data was collected;\n(b) the nature of the data concerned;\n(c) the manner in which the data has been collected;\n(d) the consequences that the further processing is likely to have for the data subject; and\n(e) the contractual rights and obligations between the data','afc68cfbce40552b7071ff18a27c0852a29fccb80387833930d548111a91c055','Data Protection and Privacy Act, 2019','General','[-0.10687572,0.07700854,1.9637079E-4,-0.035063863,-0.045230042,5.477916E-4,0.08880373,-0.031919885,0.03137014,0.08330162,0.08263555,0.02821144,0.06266588,-0.10468118,-0.043783568,-0.006573823,0.021512443,0.001789959,-0.081205055,0.050873604,0.04692236,0.059372894,-0.012552733,0.039537612,-0.06657333,0.0071925344,0.0147133265,-0.056270313,0.0010619737,-0.06252483,0.038130626,-0.005851562,0.049391527,0.05416231,-0.03671623,-0.049988836,0.0031298029,-0.013960668,-0.025656693,-0.02617859,-0.01124789,-0.060570773,-0.068226,-0.068513565,0.011200502,0.076304756,0.022358458,-0.0027579726,-0.09986155,0.03574145,-0.025004862,-0.015656443,-0.0150668705,0.082242705,-0.015059188,-0.07402598,-0.013606648,-0.001639024,-0.007928707,0.1016442,0.013445637,-0.0024186783,-0.08597289,0.008880061,0.04159027,-0.03671656,0.015528096,-0.025634907,0.053361308,0.0052019786,0.016954584,-0.012344849,-0.043140404,0.044739116,-0.022508683,-0.03956176,-0.060101073,-0.028548535,0.021473289,-0.04295083,0.011750089,0.06952268,0.050304234,-0.034629792,-0.0031808233,-0.07516405,-0.020150071,0.02854554,0.0278268,-0.06606373,0.07162263,-0.023257583,0.06546582,0.082176566,-0.04342438,-0.039237417,0.017596565,-0.025052205,0.040929377,-0.008113503,-0.0069928723,0.045276042,-0.09067642,0.062332064,0.019385552,-0.027901305,0.0071447664,0.03752272,-0.0477446,0.071484245,-0.