\nindividual concerned.\n(7) The data controller may make the communication under subsection (6) by omitting or deleting the\nname or other identifying particulars of the other individual.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 10','afc68cfbce40552b7071ff18a27c0852a29fccb80387833930d548111a91c055','Data Protection and Privacy Act, 2019','General','[-0.08862298,0.068818055,-0.02621767,-0.029974485,0.0015516046,-0.002618964,0.08895295,-0.05257611,0.07845498,-0.0064407047,0.058384348,0.005858944,0.08685952,-0.059654467,-0.029661374,0.02173909,0.09289921,-0.0053208843,-0.097000286,0.02094853,0.063732974,0.028792057,-0.052572686,0.056605943,-0.07026492,0.012722814,0.036042087,0.0067568775,-0.0060636164,-0.012095743,0.021359505,-0.016991993,0.012731145,0.02538655,-0.028767869,-0.0699666,0.0010052185,1.6573038E-4,-0.016291471,0.013742592,-0.05089305,-0.0042770985,-0.07119639,0.03209234,1.4175774E-4,0.057235997,0.03089315,-0.0064103017,-0.09272674,0.016957726,-0.04302986,0.0052004224,-0.014647341,0.107910536,-0.038665626,-0.08088893,-0.013222942,-0.025429903,0.020888673,0.1367957,-0.049868636,-0.03520105,-0.001761158,-0.025370661,0.080374435,-0.023404168,-0.022831582,-0.042652242,0.04991445,0.019409612,0.055107493,0.009443444,-0.049652644,0.053917274,-0.010149089,-0.036412112,-0.09542452,-0.00965036,0.030447137,-0.12635608,0.01850482,0.108659916,0.010607323,-0.047138568,-0.04627972,-0.071687475,-0.02477688,0.011616987,-0.025651786,-0.053131294,0.048222233,-0.06262436,0.049203206,0.016522028,0.025871793,-0.029325958,-0.019869791,-0.07210328,0.01636584,-0.018122738,-0.08275819,0.078962915,-0.059272714,0.06247183,-0.026778638,-0.080311716,-0.021128587,0.015429178,-0.030167425,0.07089559,-0.013353755,0.032484546,-0.09014063,1.1575198E-4,0.009997861,-0.046690375,0.0040921555,0.070764676,-0.0737735,-0.03404231,-0.063087896,-0.051499125,0.036108896,0.04165519,0.046958145,-0.04218533,-0.07865512,3.760155E-33,0.014634288,0.038295474,-0.049514163,0.041267935,0.0065833