 a family and children court may hear and determine a matter\nof domestic violence under this Act, whether or not it involves a child.\n(2) For the avoidance of doubt, a family and children court may issue an interim protection order or a\nprotection order in the same manner as a magistrates court.\n(3) In hearing matters of domestic violence, the family and children court shall apply the procedure\nprescribed by the Family and Children Court Rules, subject to the necessary modifications.\n(4) For the avoidance of','b17700fc18c3a4cdd7966c6c3465a4fbbbc3cbb0fcc9e73f02e19d29c93ec2f6','Domestic Violence Act','General','[-0.09672527,0.0819848,0.054545857,-0.04520857,-0.0071221865,0.04753029,-0.04220914,-0.0389675,-0.0056286403,0.07519403,0.11229143,-0.015269057,0.040182684,-0.068379104,0.007036684,-0.04206058,0.039471436,0.008507377,-0.06380136,0.0645655,0.06644944,0.08208654,3.2525338E-4,0.008801265,-0.026377229,0.025623731,-0.08767356,0.004425118,0.039779436,-0.05997312,0.037710518,-0.024251308,0.017865572,0.022091575,-0.0099849105,0.009360977,0.039123382,-0.0196549,0.040124282,-0.08068127,0.055570677,-0.08248718,0.023660496,-0.10412434,0.0012796418,0.042819846,0.018671097,0.036077704,-0.049304377,-0.06336215,-0.063351445,-0.046246395,-0.021304717,0.10527963,-0.02281422,-0.08788725,0.055292003,0.010106923,-4.63855E-4,0.031799123,-0.007984596,0.084957846,-0.08248558,0.008460986,0.0252718,-0.081383176,0.04198184,0.004848212,0.030557442,0.11181717,0.10563962,-0.022803074,-0.0031505704,0.0263061,-0.06885053,0.027022228,-0.021134019,-0.014526163,0.023611335,-0.07715895,-0.009321773,0.015250067,0.08634197,-0.02392592,0.03002419,-0.120668456,-0.0180943,-0.0030457473,0.039430942,-0.021466328,0.087486655,-0.028387496,0.11725583,0.0035995943,0.0783153,-0.068449765,0.052198853,0.041985713,-0.017857864,0.040063884,0.001299261,-0.06828447,-0.07414711,-0.021959445,0.05511354,-0.046368297,0.027175087,-0.051822465,-0.055075157,0.0038810591,-0.03565953,0.014072564,-0.046893273,-0.04094