29 13:09:07.632097','Section 1. Amendment of Employment Act, Cap. 226','Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026.pdf',2,'Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026.pdf','d099d76469b0c805983f133a72851d166b3fbf1dfd02167cb35d1ad65b45d0de','',30),(354,3,'Act 10 Employment (Amendment) Act 2026\nTHE EMPLOYMENT (AMENDMENT) ACT, 2026\nAn Act to amend the Employment Act, Cap. 226 to introduce Part\nIVA on recruitment of persons for employment abroad; to provide\nfor breastfeeding and child care facilities; to provide for severance\nallowances; to provide for dismissal and termination of contracts\nof employment; to introduce Part IXA on employment of migrant\nworkers and for related matters.\nDate of Assent: 29th April, 2026\nDate of Commencement: 5th June, 2026\nBE IT ENACTED by Parliament as follows:\n1. Amendment of Employment Act, Cap. 226\nThe Employment Act, in this Act referred to as the “principal Act”, is\namended in section 2—\n(a) by inserting immediately before the definition of “affiliated\nunion”, the following—\n““adjudication” means a form of dispute settlement in\nwhich a labour officer considers the evidence and\narguments of both parties to a labour dispute upon\nwhich the labour officer makes a decision;”;','7af1c1a171fe0c9473e785c48afcb866ecdaae3659ca1a3e1fb93b4c26dd0116','Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026','General','[-0.08058602,-0.026551664,0.07939195,-0.042509582,0.007853528,0.117101714,-0.034326293,-0.03455513,-0.08382013,-0.011752973,0.02610126,0.053277716,-0.11162965,0.015663926,0.03284621,-0.009692152,-0.041632973,0.03578156,-0.0026446653,-0.0073765037,0.109925315,0.073785104,-0.09957373,0.002115555,0.031149533,-0.04894802,0.028441777,-0.025035568,0.0228393,0.019599546,-0.032062907,0.057354383,-0.015696563,0.044653736,0.02013111,-0.02208696,0.06250765,-0.034393862,0.049525563,-0.07456756,0.047042497,-0.06716179,-0.010702003,-0.022937883,0.06360971,0.046267718,0.036329012,-0.04499376,-0.09307816,0.032587614,0.045064062,-0.0059290263,0.04210996,0.064599164,-0.0434605