0.022769712,-0.038728837]','','2026-08-29 13:09:07.632097','Section 1. Amendment of Employment Act, Cap. 226','Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026.pdf',3,'Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026.pdf','d099d76469b0c805983f133a72851d166b3fbf1dfd02167cb35d1ad65b45d0de','',30),(355,4,'Act 10 Employment (Amendment) Act 2026\n(b) by substituting for the definition of “Commissioner”, the\nfollowing—\n““Commissioner” means the Commissioner for labour in\nthe Ministry responsible for labour;”;\n(c) by substituting for the definition of “disability”, the\nfollowing—\n““disability” has the meaning assigned to it under the\nPersons with Disabilities Act;”;\n(d) by substituting for the definition of “dismissal from\nemployment”, the following—\n““dismissal from employment” means the discharge of an\nemployee from employment at the initiative of his or\nher employer on any of the grounds provided under\nsection 64A;”;\n(e) by inserting immediately after the definition of “dismissal\nfrom employment”, the following—\n““domestic work” means work performed in or for a\nhousehold or households;\n“domestic worker” means a person engaged in domestic\nwork within an employment relationship but excludes\na person who does domestic work occasionally and\nnot on an occupational basis;”;\n(f) by inserting immediately after the definition of “forced\nand compulsory labour”, the following—\n““foreign recruitment agency” means a legal entity\nregistered under the laws of a country other than','7af1c1a171fe0c9473e785c48afcb866ecdaae3659ca1a3e1fb93b4c26dd0116','Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026','General','[-0.07434038,0.0060175164,-0.011620948,0.005858789,-0.007840926,0.097511806,0.025563776,-0.0052772034,-0.044259522,-0.078517154,0.081965916,0.01069881,-0.0230823,0.059999246,0.028922275,-0.010490595,-0.016235424,0.062967435,0.009327088,0.035730936,0.08123612,0.083693825,-0.13957407,0.025438389,0.031702295,-0.05357973,-0.0059312647,0.0027626033,0.02920931,0.06237473,-0.029949564,0.048325513,-0.02400653,0.