or offensive work environment;\n(b) “intimidate” means physical or verbal abuse, or\nbehaviour directed at isolating or humiliating an\nindividual or a group of individuals or at preventing\nan individual or a group of individuals from engaging\nin work activities and includes—','7af1c1a171fe0c9473e785c48afcb866ecdaae3659ca1a3e1fb93b4c26dd0116','Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026','General','[-0.060269874,0.047162827,0.015425598,-0.018901434,0.027429683,0.044877112,-0.023253877,-0.07157856,-0.06364232,0.0067296512,0.10079805,0.060784727,-0.05050013,-0.011292039,0.049555082,0.020653922,0.06624588,0.040044103,-0.04061779,0.03532956,0.18938445,0.077367365,-0.026257776,0.029117312,-0.042950578,-0.041441806,0.035357192,0.04171079,0.013232342,-0.0042776717,-0.07525238,-0.0057975817,0.014828342,0.06603809,0.05400436,-0.0014527414,0.106240265,0.0039769956,0.06513894,-0.05897748,0.006664907,-0.04420539,0.03699291,0.01033419,-0.04494419,-0.00786218,0.046327278,-0.052641336,-0.0017745161,-0.06304592,0.034728646,0.0077236993,0.019509995,0.11801938,-0.044745155,-0.09417741,-0.0031932695,-0.080281354,0.045062985,0.08032952,0.06934118,-0.0336606,0.022472959,0.03629441,0.0032181623,-0.08299643,-0.05620891,-0.023371093,-0.021616494,0.04773026,-0.038115438,-0.028256925,-0.0690808,0.008242885,0.004404925,0.0022201145,-0.077373676,0.018764075,0.067611255,-0.068900466,0.030274842,-0.013885222,0.002489108,-0.015824255,-0.044459354,-0.079228394,0.013401301,0.00755096,0.07381613,0.04143092,0.051016532,-0.044384986,0.023841178,-0.038800523,0.0058820248,-0.037597615,-0.0777743,-0.032662753,0.03735725,0.018085351,0.017854871,0.022011451,-0.04715256,0.017625732,-0.008184745,-0.07238751,-0.047899872,2.483569E-4,-0.132113,-0.012784309,-0.014175019,0.01828508,-0.03319547,-0.08076042,0.006325662,0.054511707,0.03372149,-0.021692421,-0.039544344,-0.043926053,0.023508081,0.026716162,0.033851374,0.05955217,-0.022486372,-0.11281723,-0.059323788,-5.1551153E-34,-0.0068789776,0.0021394,-0.033445474,7.827147