the period of service stipulated in the\ncontract of employment;\n(b) upon the termination of the contract of employment by\nreason of the inability of the employee to perform the\ncontract;\n(c) upon the termination of the contract of employment by\nagreement between the parties;\n(d) upon the termination of the contract of employment by a\ncompetent court; or\n(e) upon the death of the employee.','7af1c1a171fe0c9473e785c48afcb866ecdaae3659ca1a3e1fb93b4c26dd0116','Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026','General','[-0.12327609,-0.0034102583,0.012758975,-0.020849138,-0.0071250345,0.15348028,0.031943303,-0.05280745,-0.057038788,-0.03425095,0.12731777,0.07312242,0.024878876,0.019645335,0.0075274846,-0.026283441,-0.010945708,0.0817441,-0.025352497,-0.054656815,0.039024346,0.017538711,-0.10743079,0.05721514,0.050066546,-0.09721388,0.0049634636,-0.009598033,0.0055986876,0.007057122,-0.0072332756,0.04203401,-0.07225935,0.013620918,0.039665308,0.0765307,-0.00222743,-0.03978857,0.014582526,-0.031286176,-0.0021322337,-0.03061611,-0.0166231,-0.023120927,0.052705206,0.005252477,-0.0041007837,0.022877831,-0.09527867,0.05923813,-0.01217451,-0.0108358,0.010438028,0.06996368,-0.059223082,-0.016117198,0.025998529,-0.0343089,-0.02252476,-0.017021727,-0.0408873,0.0068623982,-0.06308039,-0.0071089994,-0.063201234,-0.044404604,0.013408291,-0.08179294,0.07090642,-0.010654157,-0.07802827,-0.053207353,-0.09269328,0.0383128,-0.02019554,0.044151902,-0.005147,0.10070027,0.003655704,-0.061446488,0.06362909,-0.013430378,0.021516232,-0.074464984,-0.048158042,-0.06672457,-0.005042482,-7.5049856E-4,0.04609575,0.017036712,0.07306799,-0.046884302,0.04920997,-0.014355786,-0.004356678,-0.04862615,0.024790473,0.050981794,0.050801225,0.04402835,0.008106039,-0.03349613,-0.035131652,0.05339317,-0.07990382,-0.024061458,0.027481163,-0.023032086,0.005754562,0.022799801,-0.028365605,0.021970963,-0.018344052,-0.022046896,0.021898676,0.12252681,-0.039894577,0.058583103,-0.03550363,-0.05858741,-0.030298231,0.08315661