 been dismissed.\n(7) The labour officer shall have power to order payment of\nthe sum specified in subsection (5) in addition to making an order\nin respect of any other award or decision reached in respect of the\ndismissal.','7af1c1a171fe0c9473e785c48afcb866ecdaae3659ca1a3e1fb93b4c26dd0116','Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026','General','[-0.053691797,0.10602636,0.10979845,-0.01592633,0.02529021,0.081268996,0.048182268,-0.016066592,0.012549056,0.003219326,0.07230786,0.009674283,-0.07236724,0.0036122007,-0.023895703,0.008316743,0.055663906,0.044869147,-0.023739627,0.030293353,0.10572469,-0.025828559,-0.103160165,0.042530447,-0.00241773,-0.014843736,0.023754371,-0.0035272366,0.0015534945,-0.007406736,-0.029739885,0.06431863,0.05473262,0.008111698,-0.008770995,-0.01281742,0.05094247,-0.018117135,-8.359612E-4,-0.017225547,0.007473895,0.008658706,0.019120842,0.049733017,-0.0075250394,-0.02934644,0.002046854,-0.03812141,-0.047188114,0.023221627,0.029101966,-0.017382815,0.029713467,0.07735869,-0.0478788,-0.0701653,0.0027527176,-0.053148065,-0.012455812,0.037169818,-0.001996623,-0.08429843,-0.031422205,-0.01003996,-0.002886094,-0.0061370907,0.022917202,-0.13935573,-0.026755134,0.08422401,-0.053578865,0.024113297,-0.032604467,0.046002094,-0.05187608,-0.003402981,0.0337733,0.027497895,0.053548884,-0.103870325,-0.0064489404,0.031581793,-0.01043022,-0.06346085,-0.015456543,-0.05036646,0.034671716,0.04533323,0.06753031,-0.04952809,0.13106982,-0.024802847,0.0023169555,-0.04705778,0.02537698,-0.0127203,-0.027703982,-0.0072219796,-0.004754798,0.05980628,0.010217193,0.0447087,-0.04098504,-0.08282201,-0.003718035,-0.092639744,-0.0298369,0.0050574197,-0.079890475,-0.049611825,-0.030305423,-0.037307564,0.0011608466,0.008125924,0.012368237,0.10584285,0.05817782,0.035906695,-0.010270296,-0.03674286,0.024363048,0.09998498,-0.015957173,0.020939058,-0.09026769,-0.04819967,-0.090077,1.0685001E-33,-0.010808777,-0.02698602,-0.06972879,-0.038207266,0.07748915,-0.13463168,0.024292914,-0.0151171