bour officer may grant the employee\nan order for compensation under section 77.”\n24.. Substitution of section 77 of principal Act .\nSection 77 of the principal Act is substituted with the following—\n“77. Compensatory order\n(1) An order of compensation to an employee who has been\nunfairly dismissed shall, in all cases, include a basic compensatory\norder for eight weeks’ wages.\n{2). Notwithstanding subsection (1), an employee who has\n■been unfairly dismissed may, at the discretion of the labour officer,','7af1c1a171fe0c9473e785c48afcb866ecdaae3659ca1a3e1fb93b4c26dd0116','Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026','General','[-0.101389,0.037135534,0.1305956,-0.035258625,-0.032715563,0.11022071,-0.022558123,-0.010554292,-0.027190674,0.06523245,0.11062862,0.104917385,-0.0795755,0.015562438,0.008145853,-0.016377006,0.025167622,0.10865175,-0.031139346,0.0057011866,0.097635135,0.053676285,-0.1324741,0.042925786,-0.017796952,0.018419491,-0.011312822,0.0026430935,-0.03678436,-0.047873013,-0.10032028,0.004173185,0.0023591588,-0.020294767,-0.0048722355,-0.03552359,0.048263952,-0.07835861,-0.043697868,-0.030049603,0.027151553,0.04210643,-8.3744386E-4,-0.005068776,-0.012568419,0.054159343,0.033737104,-0.08002176,-0.034112543,0.0052355947,0.038927384,-0.0015323914,-0.005995918,0.14440969,-0.03390964,-0.05457483,-0.0035593195,-0.08682628,0.030894015,0.051398095,0.003861207,-0.047582258,-0.03959057,-0.0036454226,0.00845599,-0.088600665,0.0051164413,-0.14282629,-0.024019245,0.076925665,-0.057330746,-0.0054254807,-0.016053433,0.063679546,0.005529201,0.038293283,-0.0034660313,0.0090805,0.014361163,-0.10856742,0.019250724,-0.03638191,-0.009140365,-0.0029738855,0.042926542,-0.08478346,0.006150641,-0.013723652,0.07406905,-0.02663317,0.11730047,-0.009761369,0.046775367,-0.045146354,0.025786776,-0.0214868,0.038009837,-0.0122096175,0.011882927,0.059064355,0.0057963263,0.02605619,-0.058234986,-0.06906192,0.026332764,-0.07879527,-0.04890723,0.014514013,-0.060570285,-0.07557712,-0.05449287,-0.0