r a job\ndeclared under section 9IB; or\n(e) contravenes any condition attached to an entry permit,\ncommits an offence and is liable, on conviction, to a fine not\nexceeding five hundred currency points or to imprisonment for\na term not exceeding five years, or both.\n(2) A person who contravenes a provision of this Act for\nwhich no penalty is expressly provided is liable, on conviction—\n(a) to a fine not exceeding five hundred currency points; and;','7af1c1a171fe0c9473e785c48afcb866ecdaae3659ca1a3e1fb93b4c26dd0116','Employment (Amendment) Act, 2026','General','[-0.07176225,0.04278076,-0.006202163,-0.031554475,0.071956135,0.08967173,0.061116986,-0.04318797,-0.08302677,-0.027971216,0.09042088,-0.013439964,0.01196475,0.029350188,-0.010059654,-0.051609907,-0.016763767,0.0037125838,-0.026584445,-0.0073429956,0.11251292,0.005532079,-0.108750045,-0.004587844,0.021400707,-0.040192716,0.010943997,-0.001897461,0.027172778,0.03256983,-0.031066647,0.081573464,-0.069132224,0.07399206,0.03376096,-0.07105869,0.06181702,-0.03858367,0.032899167,-0.07092291,0.074877195,-0.050313678,-0.015724638,-0.016121386,0.059876245,0.02072123,0.015971757,-0.029888114,-0.0981515,-0.008351351,-0.055951368,0.0028289568,0.05165905,0.051545616,-0.0725046,-0.11545205,-0.0073662754,-0.0020381296,-0.017301388,-0.03854564,0.03404741,0.0010214061,6.525106E-4,-0.021892041,-0.029187731,-0.0010667308,-0.10981923,-0.08088587,0.029356139,0.05117583,-0.024822365,-0.05469662,-0.06883616,0.018002372,0.0241977,-0.072873555,-0.064383164,0.007712741,-0.036798406,-0.092911854,-9.820754E-5,0.007530777,-0.03477619,-0.048277948,-0.02939705,-0.10574788,-0.0075978804,0.019780017,0.08356949,-0.0035692605,0.07791054,-0.06646661,0.052857023,0.0034649128,0.05794218,-0.037397012,0.024466535,-0.011475744,0.023520418,0.0244167,0.011609958,0.016470304,-0.05555287,0.012695269,0.013277041,-0.042377073,0.028802997,-0.018141204,-0.048897807,-0.01884421,0.07655609,0.029509144,-0.055108164,-0.05194164,0.016245069,0.019840598,0.0027