ionnaires and proposed texts of\ninternational labour standards, the taking of action necessary to comply with the obligations\nof membership of the International Labour Organisation, and any proposed denunciation of\na ratified Convention;\n(b) aspects of vocational guidance and vocational training;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 10','d1cc6c37d9f8420fad71d9e0bca366a6d1aaf3bbdda5cb69c9066fe0fdef38c0','Employment Act','General','[-0.043375544,-0.0061724163,-0.029148463,0.0057417173,-0.026256593,0.043163992,0.046529874,-0.022400875,-0.041706473,0.027990239,-0.042963374,-0.012187976,-0.04671037,0.016704388,0.053225793,0.0051080473,-0.025261208,-0.017455101,-0.09655478,0.016144961,0.09514984,0.027242986,-0.01058061,0.006771315,-0.08155335,-0.08912017,-0.012430708,-0.029886328,-7.3319447E-4,-0.011645528,0.05791642,0.051277142,0.0653274,0.07061995,0.005249209,0.03131087,0.059250962,0.0037637888,0.045092225,-0.052896526,0.01567423,-0.07362723,-0.01819111,-0.07404562,0.015524786,0.09052494,0.075037345,-0.014919446,-0.13875256,0.0108654145,-0.009813395,-0.06803456,0.013989541,0.0026347726,0.0014217347,-0.00686293,-0.023059217,-0.07713224,0.051489126,0.00554785,-0.04185439,-0.022246413,-0.07628277,0.026128875,0.034411326,-0.096132495,0.010913199,-0.0036033299,-0.06458994,0.03362009,-4.0253417E-5,-0.11789059,-0.0033296503,0.024514372,-0.016126977,0.0090559535,0.032932922,0.04728268,0.02545349,-0.09373589,-0.038581885,0.0926768,0.12215856,-0.0139016,0.04351681,-0.040360983,-0.001694101,0.0065635666,0.06177548,-0.04031454,0.023056779,0.015383867,0.04181173,0.051655218,0.0605689,-0.031022526,0.05393743,0.0057122046,0.012782805,0.064432144,-0.030781867,0.03110346,-0.028454239,0.008767985,-0.06740847,0.012841941,0.015344181,0.015185871,0.020123692,0.05884439,-0.086976424,-0.0022884875,-0.06341882,-0.034041654,0.052759495,-0.030698827,0.041756578,0.07450728,0.027476057,0.022546422,-0.035353664,0.041705012,-0.03938119,-0.06072688,-0.053754404,-0.0032276888,0.0