ars shall not be employed in any business, undertaking or work\nplace.\n(2) A child under the age of fourteen years shall not be employed in any business, undertaking or\nworkplace, except for light work carried out under supervision of an adult aged over eighteen years,\nand which does not affect the education of a child.\n(3) A person shall not continue to employ any child under the age of fourteen years after being notified\nin writing by a labour officer that the employment or work is not light work meeting the criteria in\nsubsection (2).\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 12','d1cc6c37d9f8420fad71d9e0bca366a6d1aaf3bbdda5cb69c9066fe0fdef38c0','Employment Act','General','[-0.06508636,0.08450831,-0.012985649,-0.04408415,-0.057213634,0.07550766,-0.0016920143,-0.012970822,-0.0605811,0.052460045,0.09688715,0.086143024,-0.0011531932,0.007631094,-0.0077206264,0.035399422,0.038753197,0.035415705,-0.014225151,-0.05007159,0.097461514,-9.961152E-4,-0.06278878,0.03992445,0.039676264,0.016738866,9.620841E-4,0.008936917,-0.01957164,0.019677384,0.030260645,-0.03808775,0.009225646,-0.07636631,0.14303924,0.04488299,0.049821272,-0.03109713,-0.02634017,1.8701813E-4,0.06202342,-0.032194093,-0.039451748,-0.109566145,-0.02835086,-0.0189268,-0.022954926,-0.040792145,-0.09828525,0.06689199,-0.013225025,-0.033755284,0.05400562,0.12349953,-0.03334882,-0.052496124,-0.033754583,-0.001537924,0.021282127,0.038796462,-0.07671659,0.04859415,-0.1003929,0.0050410186,0.015930321,-0.0737171,0.072249115,-0.064571336,0.005599463,0.019216368,-0.0038456495,-0.055308852,-0.06119902,0.009865915,-0.040951997,0.045463875,0.06745275,0.029416896,0.020992255,-0.17004089,-0.030217256,-0.023121567,-0.012624265,-0.05604417,-0.07018322,-0.07397155,0.027360963,0.05716206,0.086452834,0.012593101,0.06449154,-0.009744587,0.023750184,-0.06021482,0.087663576,-0.065315284,0.017686177,-0.04498752,-0.044359464,-0.007634704,-0.0049964124,-0.057856876,0.025460007,0.017338628,-0.04062964,-0.002881747,-0