the employee has been brought to the place of employment by the employer,\nthe family shall be repatriated at the expense of the employer, in the event of the employee’s\nrepatriation or death.\n(3) Where an employee has been in employment for at least ten years, he or she shall be repatriated at\nthe expense of the employer, irrespective of his or her place of recruitment.\n(4) A labour officer may, notwithstanding anything in this section, exempt an employer from the\nobligation to repatriate in circumstances where the labour officer is satisfied that it is just a','d1cc6c37d9f8420fad71d9e0bca366a6d1aaf3bbdda5cb69c9066fe0fdef38c0','Employment Act','General','[-0.108196914,0.041961577,0.019153174,-0.06940894,-0.028897058,0.033190325,0.01611967,-0.063988835,-0.070297725,0.00757104,0.0664744,0.027820762,-0.0043392107,-0.015652992,0.02420257,-0.03193831,-0.010657245,-0.003361268,-0.04456405,-0.02749676,0.042368926,0.007279729,-0.069245264,0.04766286,0.061174124,-0.00756004,-0.0155786425,0.0147010535,0.008924783,-0.023300873,0.029185629,0.03901084,-0.074031934,-0.0045354664,0.0059684627,0.09073491,0.0404587,0.01763563,0.029777924,-0.053789493,0.034587547,-0.032408867,0.025954995,-0.11114442,0.021990888,-0.017397137,0.04398095,0.013184951,-0.0786462,0.036390986,0.025123268,-0.0053655203,0.019811137,0.12714678,0.0012803134,-0.021692378,0.05109712,-0.060669005,0.014881558,0.029946728,0.02701657,0.00809357,-0.07357119,-0.018714787,0.015577577,-0.1590468,0.0406378,-0.08860213,-0.024896322,4.6865614E-5,0.0066486164,-0.08472838,-0.043445483,0.020864638,0.02663745,-0.009918208,0.06228802,0.029951163,-0.014900175,-0.07000554,0.018384876,0.03436014,0.08113953,-0.016895844,-0.020211369,-0.07710509,-0.019861959,0.024836479,0.14612408,-0.038365036,0.045019075,-0.009436599,0.04397912,-0.047999654,0.05093005,-0.09149862,0.033581566,0.069429375,0.03377636,0.037866328,-0.014442544,-0.061290074,4.489959E-4,-0.018421061,0.0038057384,-0.0068345945,0.044700705,0.026161227,0.011401658,0.023