venting the employee from\nreaching his or her place of work or from working;\n(b) absence attributable to a summons to attend a court of law or any other public authority\nhaving power to compel attendance; or\n(c) absence attributable to the death of a member of the employee’s family or dependent\nrelative, subject to a maximum of three days’ absence on any one occasion and a maximum\nof six days in any one calendar year.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 18','d1cc6c37d9f8420fad71d9e0bca366a6d1aaf3bbdda5cb69c9066fe0fdef38c0','Employment Act','General','[-0.09205239,0.09673313,-0.031106647,-0.024389416,-0.01808525,0.12471632,0.090988606,-0.09672265,-0.05514389,-0.024401978,0.106508695,-0.012209692,-6.662158E-4,0.005995247,0.037129924,-0.052084636,0.04510481,-0.02319728,0.01400456,-0.01824296,0.04917346,2.3212594E-4,-0.04109563,0.036331285,-0.024993872,0.013711377,-0.024701785,0.0025592241,0.060010027,0.031220155,0.0013402925,0.020650396,-0.015834328,-0.06176914,0.030466255,-0.024535794,0.053268507,-0.044119403,-0.04853889,-0.014088892,0.007983595,-0.015212662,-0.05909453,-0.026951829,-0.027044892,-0.03293423,0.0073716426,-0.024915649,-0.1233894,-0.017276594,0.029791603,-0.031746745,0.09206069,0.082010865,-0.0051988694,-0.10335922,0.031681135,-0.023070091,0.0018854404,-0.0035884695,-0.07078051,0.0025241277,-0.050620835,0.009069838,0.040518194,-0.06202728,-0.05466727,-0.012672659,-0.026676813,0.09266852,-0.071415156,-0.10781151,-0.014780254,0.0054881377,-0.036536347,0.03401686,0.039957765,0.010751574,-0.02329226,-0.06512907,-0.043777626,-0.022414368,0.033361502,0.018695634,-0.056331698,-0.057093766,-0.028347317,-0.011758358,0.09053089,-0.038368884,0.058929097,0.05411155,-0.020939654,-0.12313012,0.07341371,-0.08185819,0.074733146,0.0048690275,-0.024658276,0.053404074,0.043140966,0.041063525,0.015782401,0.004597615,0.07837943,0.050929934,-0.0071254214,-0.007887998,-0.030884419,-0.033019643,-0.03200399,0.019472115,0.009652843,-0.04964763,0.026907716