rmal hourly rate if the overtime is on the normal working days, and at two\ntimes the hourly rate where the overtime is worked on gazetted public holidays.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 22','d1cc6c37d9f8420fad71d9e0bca366a6d1aaf3bbdda5cb69c9066fe0fdef38c0','Employment Act','General','[-0.054914214,0.05226949,0.043997653,-0.047943093,-0.004614354,-0.029361311,-0.017909877,-0.019246038,-0.061413027,-0.0056651575,-0.0010511979,-0.020410426,-0.036148496,-0.014981168,0.077607594,0.019778602,-0.008230497,-2.7476066E-5,-0.06790547,-0.037697636,0.12864982,-0.06447603,-0.02355756,0.0052902256,-0.0028122512,0.005550697,0.032777447,0.020776957,0.014982821,-0.028091967,-0.025143724,-8.50861E-4,0.015569888,0.038466837,0.03609581,0.018108591,0.023669595,-0.008974367,-0.029096913,0.0048958105,0.018384384,-0.02727942,-0.037977975,-0.04721401,-0.06927112,0.06735751,-0.006024316,-0.100003265,-0.027617812,0.067543365,0.04594913,0.0547416,4.5726518E-4,0.083228074,-0.0061387606,-0.09640659,-0.041146487,-0.024207698,0.034345303,0.07742097,-0.008330513,0.08079009,-0.0040968093,-0.019640062,-0.011553148,-0.022702836,-0.102372624,-0.035117585,-0.12685978,0.08095571,-0.109541066,-0.10610075,-0.0943875,-1.8826282E-5,0.024030726,-0.022978012,0.0045099026,-0.012371301,0.045022063,-0.13846372,0.0013962142,-0.009376669,0.05707474,-0.044741273,-0.022658149,-0.068871595,2.4370274E-4,0.1464453,0.08722091,0.0016082829,0.052802015,-0.0017351771,-0.006105618,-0.036981516,0.11360357,-0.011314365,-0.012062733,0.08505072,-0.04082076,0.016443228,-0.048585232,-0.054823436,-0.012959117,-0.025240116,-0.028573262,-0.027030379,0.034401312,0.04220299,-0.039939594,-0.032028317,0.0041563767,0.044463575,0.03813882,-0.06065064,0.035834663,0.071547955,-0.048138812,0.09159555,0.027558342,0.09035407,0.07761053,0.055203464,-0.012577086,-0.029916443,-0.0069353986,0.038944162,0.021334218,4.5261536E-33,0.0097972285,0.014725276,-0.04579634,-0.020334955,0.0466485,4.964798E-4,-3.767896E-4,0.050411206,