the event of sickness arising out of pregnancy or confinement, affecting either the mother or\nthe baby, and making the mother’s return to work inadvisable, the right to return mentioned in\nsubsection (2) shall be available within eight weeks after the date of childbirth or miscarriage.\n(4) A female employee is entitled to the rights mentioned in subsections (1), (2) and (3) if she gives\nnot less than seven days’ noti','d1cc6c37d9f8420fad71d9e0bca366a6d1aaf3bbdda5cb69c9066fe0fdef38c0','Employment Act','General','[-0.033326797,0.06580174,-0.0038059955,-0.007971576,0.009257758,0.042615056,-0.023991562,4.7209652E-4,-0.056603696,0.044357255,0.025432674,-0.033289474,-0.021104874,-0.04840631,-0.012873791,-0.014749111,-0.03443986,-0.029680427,0.017985353,0.011979155,0.097243346,0.021781951,-0.009042198,0.021405641,0.041955266,-0.009117586,-0.017033663,0.04327779,0.068689026,0.012151299,0.034576885,-0.0032032863,0.005529995,-0.07311762,-0.045495953,0.051884584,0.021541387,0.028919766,0.03718179,-0.0369919,0.06619343,-0.052178215,0.004695521,-0.041374378,0.014704438,0.037815627,0.0111309355,-0.029416991,-0.08678072,0.037605695,-0.023281751,-0.06944912,-6.0216215E-4,0.100839406,-0.05262863,-0.10578591,-0.0058125504,-0.09848401,-0.0055008586,0.03845382,-0.018229928,0.03541176,-0.03806476,-0.022476306,0.013853158,-0.045856062,-9.896642E-4,-0.08069644,0.020067621,0.041870803,-0.0039925477,-0.041514974,0.023770647,0.093426615,0.017336467,0.019224824,0.06826715,0.033168286,0.01035788,-0.099342264,0.033378262,0.07488488,0.08200643,0.0011761741,0.033838615,-0.044539176,0.0103366105,0.066355824,0.116198294,-0.074144766,0.06958539,-0.010132856,-0.0074774106,0.006920785,0.040609322,-0.10493553,0.053998943,0.027418844,0.028800406,-0.0012976083,-0.0053881067,-0.074297346,-0.024351943,-0.0074859015,0.018640753,-2.0283501E-4,0.045994863,-0.01959519,-0.024181385,0.033225782,-0.01158226,0.01909824,-0.08776274,-0.008529616,0.019531224,0.07238325,-0.04852464,0.041198257,0.042063326,0.008284