 the contrary is stated, be deemed to be—\n(a) in the circumstances governed by subsection (1)(a), the date of expiry of the notice given;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 28','d1cc6c37d9f8420fad71d9e0bca366a6d1aaf3bbdda5cb69c9066fe0fdef38c0','Employment Act','General','[-0.10354487,0.032047737,9.6671015E-4,-0.009654626,0.015916867,0.10023078,0.06385284,0.02015971,-0.0013262571,-0.026380925,0.104725905,0.06681024,0.034614358,-0.009763963,0.021256577,-0.040256288,0.003370179,0.058193855,-0.036042288,-0.0293152,0.09750045,0.03794,-0.08289384,0.095467255,-0.037258845,-0.052907325,-0.02034675,-0.060038738,-0.026461756,0.02120927,-0.03787684,0.025239395,-0.016004883,-0.043415684,0.055372994,0.056840807,-0.019344509,-0.0020390945,-0.013694967,-0.039579723,-0.048907038,-0.041567113,-0.026778677,0.008269707,-0.016411029,-0.040547315,-0.039584413,-0.054794982,-0.07327109,0.078725785,-0.0034457075,-0.028418807,-0.0027208938,0.16601098,-0.021769423,-0.059023328,0.0028895598,-0.022735367,-0.09890224,0.066235565,0.017300483,7.046343E-4,-0.08113267,-0.010250748,0.036692835,-0.048772544,0.03834507,-0.11947236,-0.025386704,0.07870131,-0.07113633,-0.08908258,-0.03965589,0.039690215,0.01366438,0.040286597,0.057314303,0.054698408,-0.021547083,-0.08617434,-0.024509806,-0.008127826,0.024942085,0.00703779,-0.01548881,-0.10512548,-0.037940983,-0.023628844,0.093202144,-0.017950874,0.08528341,0.025863137,0.03852376,-0.07344318,0.005863773,-0.06865299,-0.013498136,0.015256254,0.030892354,0.06018966,-0.034111366,-0.021093806,-0.05985032,-0.005441959,0.015575273,-0.013008898,-0.13253403,-0.082375355,-0.0028468117,-0.06269572,-0.028590132,-0.061416473,0.036928542,-0.043678783,8.872808E-4,0.10862891,-0.03263609,0.050095245,0.07056601,0.0075246342,0.052672505,0.06215238,-0.033987988,0.03396612,-0.06618659,-0.0134847965,0.052771777,5.059629E-33,-0.0058102263,-0.07480117,-0.021666668,0.011090174,0.079491615,-0.021027908,-0.014731952,0.030473722,0.0058747227,0.023582986,-0.0131