hat an employee took, or proposed to take, any leave to which he or she was entitled under\nthe law or a contract;\n(c) an employee\'s membership or proposed membership of a labour union;\n(d) participation or proposed participation in the activities of a labour union outside working hours or,\nwith the consent of the employer, within working hours;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 30','d1cc6c37d9f8420fad71d9e0bca366a6d1aaf3bbdda5cb69c9066fe0fdef38c0','Employment Act','General','[-0.04347293,0.10647336,-0.018802006,0.043481614,0.074154735,0.0866618,0.04813742,0.02125838,-0.015693557,0.06408816,0.02402013,-0.020000698,-0.044832982,0.004764215,-0.002568707,-0.0029550982,0.034481257,-0.0064381366,-0.033396002,0.025397656,0.05116871,-0.008435301,-0.04552444,0.037365872,-0.065466136,-0.04433375,0.01226695,0.035814114,0.018075036,-0.0032920367,-0.020642621,0.111764,0.0042798202,-0.01915852,-0.07607853,-0.02358752,0.037882105,0.011274433,0.07661182,-0.01823266,0.05810713,-0.01247016,-0.0066526397,-0.013814637,0.061699864,0.0111660585,0.010877422,0.007033347,-0.13544877,0.029612228,0.01854109,-0.04967946,-0.002867286,0.083682485,0.0015948924,-0.1181113,-0.041249264,-0.09096214,-0.017193591,-0.029047178,0.017393563,-0.052972157,-0.06725156,0.032106508,0.0074266037,-0.058736168,0.045858048,-0.045349747,0.0021316912,0.04360943,0.027091507,-0.07685319,-0.017128615,0.09473203,-0.022827448,0.02163811,0.090970784,0.01357644,0.030654239,-0.059503514,-0.025644524,-0.024588024,0.019656155,-0.017018205,-0.06584635,-0.07853057,0.07189695,-0.053233285,0.10775803,-0.064083055,0.05990305,0.008183285,0.045626357,0.011134147,-0.006794027,-0.08831622,-0.0038434216,-0.0014927505,-0.040047828,0.10529699,-0.05355321,-0.017736455,-0.061183847,0.0073786527,-0.037598923,-0.022696123,0.009963361,-0.010848681,-0.051102538,-0.027773276,-0.12713887,-0.01148845,-0.070863195,-0.017804936,0.03303229,0.071951576,0.019276159,0.011107125,0.02471736,-0.020320121,-0.017386725,0.03286829,