he business of the former employer as receiver, liquidator, personal representative, or heir, or\nupon transfer of the whole or part of the business shall be deemed to constitute a single period of\ncontinuous service with the successor.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 35','d1cc6c37d9f8420fad71d9e0bca366a6d1aaf3bbdda5cb69c9066fe0fdef38c0','Employment Act','General','[-0.09639682,-0.0013536385,0.030658353,-0.096691035,-0.00511691,0.058473773,0.016693218,-0.07023185,-0.013198038,-0.06178483,0.044518318,0.067492254,0.0095689595,0.035024412,0.049455408,-0.045738727,0.0033569804,0.016477836,-0.029271685,-0.045616254,0.05167229,0.023100331,-0.10194261,0.07102808,-0.06479833,0.038899977,-0.004875551,-0.012449167,-0.014717531,0.007855545,-0.0116917165,-0.027242707,0.009559864,-0.004899911,-0.014823412,-0.016240725,0.023207098,-0.019724024,0.029264685,0.013772926,0.009768223,-0.0803654,-0.034462344,0.013021731,-0.033607084,0.008499515,-0.021873483,-0.09707719,-0.08640571,0.08358075,-2.6393903E-4,-0.0039312984,0.039610427,0.1429356,0.027116012,-0.057550624,0.047125198,-0.020959277,0.014548138,0.06670695,0.012060712,0.04594064,-0.04027447,0.0035476165,0.0028903598,-0.030802255,-0.048256375,-0.08566092,-0.0057227914,0.023164805,-0.09939887,-0.053242944,-0.038902894,0.05439122,-0.030636726,0.02886895,0.0438035,0.03294112,0.023928547,-0.13267104,0.0068157967,-0.060082037,0.077005886,0.024523253,-0.027146183,-0.043569602,-0.028293945,0.03897883,0.055171035,-0.027172055,0.044996645,0.06643269,0.03110393,-0.10348595,0.049898535,-0.07761432,-0.011428726,0.026338663,0.049519926,-0.025181433,0.0074504623,-0.04736858,-0.019188268,-0.030701848,0.00195556,-0.0451363,-0.10257039,0.039201126,-0.0627625,-0.05450418,-0.026324667,-0.0044814725,-0.03993906,-0.05867044,0.08520026,0.13067165,-0.023923809,0.079331584,0.08719959,0.0756473,0.07675287,0.06787308,-0.031747356,0.005204356,-0.06500395,0.010358423,0.07192367,2.888439E-33,-0.056133926,-0.12799962,-0.04236373,0.04888