for each year\nworked by the employee.\n[section 88 substituted by section 27 of Act 10 of 2026]\n89. Bonus and other payments\n(1) Any gratuity, bonus, or pay other than what is provided for in this Act paid by an employer to an\nemployee on the cessation of his or her employment shall be taken into account in the calculation\nof any severance allowance, and the amount of the gratuity, bonus, or any other similar payment\nshall be deducted from any severance allowance which is due.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 37','d1cc6c37d9f8420fad71d9e0bca366a6d1aaf3bbdda5cb69c9066fe0fdef38c0','Employment Act','General','[-0.06562801,0.05388383,0.0039864276,-0.04139269,0.030284587,0.0798596,0.04695541,-0.018644378,-0.020279832,-0.06846104,0.07620682,-0.009206517,0.03338647,-0.049325023,0.0047482136,0.005697811,0.012680177,0.075176276,-0.024217974,-0.04090305,5.6237426E-5,-0.0037607125,-0.07301267,0.022886313,0.05408194,-0.04918125,-0.022769319,0.035598636,0.008202402,0.0071187085,-0.017361116,-0.090628274,-0.012227381,-0.01498952,0.0043732524,-0.007455374,0.0075347438,-0.039384857,-0.06418194,0.035000384,-0.02877421,0.06845949,-0.055011045,-0.0355302,-0.023041582,-0.046275772,0.037566703,-0.042832248,-0.13263549,0.06618906,0.064975046,-0.01394888,0.005237865,0.12683725,-0.022058059,-0.0685157,-0.017289849,0.00247454,-0.05216179,0.04181172,-0.022906581,-0.022883926,-0.031812448,-0.012813843,0.029795669,-0.070028976,0.034439977,-0.08377427,-0.041493423,0.082115114,-0.12844197,-0.10016232,-0.023584347,0.05929478,-0.068061784,0.06425437,0.051304467,0.0088695595,-0.04029864,-0.04462536,-0.060603846,-0.017739797,0.055129938,-0.039103504,-0.05552042,-0.06532409,0.0063425195,-0.007465323,0.049617454,0.0051242867,0.06362908,-0.0053941347,0.03316694,-0.12371296,0.076277606,0.014268742,0.023873996,0.03560353,-0.050123446,0.026103592,-0.03072978,-0.008597886,-0.005488534,0.011673217,0.03302959,0.03455668,-0.10340676,-0.04399429,0.006869026,-0.020281777,-0.083662406