es statements by accused persons, admissions,\njudicial notice, presumptions of law, and ocular observation by the court in its judicial capacity;\n“fact” means and includes—\n(a) any thing, state of things, or relation of things, capable of being perceived by the senses; and\n(b) any mental condition of which any person is conscious;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 1','5bbeeced9a5069dcde3da8563b2dfb6af2acd08405d7fff410623a0a6ed2c2ab','Evidence Act','General','[-0.01669625,0.0943683,-0.056753628,0.0028240522,0.05945488,0.022357034,0.09537613,0.014298099,0.023826525,0.1302248,0.031332392,-0.099171944,0.021159558,-0.02396064,-0.07674207,-0.041145,0.08969242,-0.04985553,-0.026961157,0.048476823,0.049884442,0.036363058,0.089210175,-0.044377454,-0.04902709,0.053515315,-0.054557808,-0.07250151,0.071353555,-0.02630171,0.015941767,0.066529796,0.01176662,0.030029032,0.075001046,0.007569047,0.0128916865,0.023320708,-0.010372312,-0.04976288,0.045881134,-0.038398642,-0.0068433736,-0.026228799,0.02751459,0.08476857,0.027013298,0.13000672,-0.07228574,0.03765633,-0.13290791,-0.037854325,-0.042432483,-0.010049088,-0.018511549,-0.033342272,-0.048748087,-0.05658129,-0.0365508,-0.0033597045,0.08894305,0.0323331,-0.027419806,0.03254319,0.061606906,0.035226475,0.03206482,-0.021452887,0.045102544,0.0046168296,0.091952145,2.7908926E-4,0.039390624,0.035927292,-0.053501174,-0.03365305,0.012766683,-0.056215703,0.03313479,-0.049397852,-0.027322527,0.03907585,0.054216735,-0.08329496,0.0053750766,-0.06454539,0.014580098,-0.022304498,-0.07001336,-0.010281763,0.019058108,-0.06981366,0.0071388534,-0.0047296355,0.046799492,-0.07106941,0.0024014057,0.0404315,0.05094911,0.011679475,-0.002722495,0.04127279,0.0016152187,0.05703636,-0.05493339,0.007507075,-0.010160811,-0.08351461,0.028021622,0.022368344,-0.06738301,-0.002355755,-0.070394814,-0.019816168,0.04690212,0.00795005,-0.020935973,0.034273583,-0.0896203,-0.034928437,-0.06426442,0.013303422,0.027243126,-0.020467602,0.0359464