; or\n(b) persons from whom the parties to the suit have derived their interest in the subject matter of\nthe suit,\nare admissions, if they are made during the continuance of the interest of the persons making the\nstatements.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 4','5bbeeced9a5069dcde3da8563b2dfb6af2acd08405d7fff410623a0a6ed2c2ab','Evidence Act','General','[-4.5385835E-4,0.09014601,0.022387266,-0.049359,0.06243423,0.030707538,0.10766218,0.020258673,-0.022726826,0.054173797,0.0013625891,-0.033340745,0.037578415,-0.012383543,0.07140572,-0.054054283,0.10546564,-0.06003644,-0.04186918,0.059857666,0.06190539,0.019326547,-0.019041017,0.029562498,-0.021990927,-0.030803224,0.0065076873,-0.029024484,0.057946544,0.03336434,-0.038394295,0.14428714,-0.0033107677,0.07418757,0.009475517,0.0050079324,-0.04560514,-0.051999677,-0.023770958,-0.0012354213,0.056021787,-0.030745186,0.0132137425,0.0070674503,0.08026284,-0.024260674,0.023841359,0.019745959,-0.10050047,-2.8088264E-4,-0.06596822,0.048397098,1.333888E-4,-0.013104888,-0.0713728,-0.033265684,-0.047670733,0.035823945,-0.0903605,-0.013295861,-0.036471155,-0.059826873,0.025712566,0.003609655,-0.026126215,-0.040528722,0.014349458,0.045028854,0.03283942,0.023535164,0.097294144,0.038179494,-0.07574182,0.014145333,-0.056316193,-0.10715605,0.04318445,0.046703313,0.032214813,0.017961845,-0.03520701,-0.05617549,-0.06580997,-0.0618069,-0.055064727,-0.090959296,0.023553196,-0.034835696,9.6385664E-4,0.058392867,-0.013914291,-0.13866702,0.037595153,0.012371234,0.12871116,-0.013942747,-0.019377897,-0.03681054,0.1348054,0.017691946,-0.018312505,0.029194927,-0.09330649,-0.037366904,-0.043883994,-0.042280328,0.0035459588,-0.05025072,6.2466477E-4,-0.034866884,-0.048637528,-0.045231808,0.10619042,-0.02889705,0.037261847,0.0035984619,0.03579325,0.0057142912,-0.012612869,-0.06081054,0.019853195,0.11318298,0.022454299,-0.029114965,-0.055937346,-0.1284033,-0.04295145,1.5321641E-33,-0.041129153,0.0013425936,-0.08905435,0.038193848,