ng of section 73;\n(f) when the original is a document of which a certified copy is permitted by this Act, or by any\nother law in force in Uganda, to be given in evidence;\n(g) when the originals consist of numerous accounts or other documents which cannot\nconveniently be examined in court, and the fact to be proved is the general result of the\nwhole collection.\n(2) In cases of subsection (1)(a), (c) and (d), any second','5bbeeced9a5069dcde3da8563b2dfb6af2acd08405d7fff410623a0a6ed2c2ab','Evidence Act','General','[-0.11128229,0.118054114,0.0318135,-0.054333452,0.06141305,0.009308813,0.0027225446,0.048013315,0.090011284,0.08537193,0.04363588,-0.0052596116,0.04492609,-0.048055463,-0.047563486,-0.0090971505,0.015089511,-0.031384785,-0.029895991,0.056538183,0.029719438,-0.010582222,0.034200057,-0.012717752,-0.018916832,0.028193308,-0.027278427,-0.057092503,0.084746554,-0.073122725,0.046029456,0.054520268,-0.015446058,-0.006476071,0.07780063,0.06251372,0.057239216,-0.045692362,0.07040187,-0.03803194,0.051503118,-0.06954697,-0.018598001,-0.09938639,0.020304255,0.023734007,0.079554014,0.072651476,-0.06763066,0.021173187,-0.09473555,-0.052378375,-0.014516683,0.077668846,-0.006163943,-0.03158594,-0.0052259914,-0.021756904,-0.022965172,-0.0029492376,0.04306946,0.05361793,-0.12458772,-0.033557437,0.053448945,0.01196253,0.054421842,-0.024091072,-0.030256849,0.07369179,0.078454636,0.030240763,0.02032791,0.049185064,-0.0368776,-0.06880912,-0.017739668,-0.028586837,-0.012030249,-0.09300993,0.0069637136,0.05422651,0.036889054,-0.083662696,-0.04760243,-0.07555994,-0.03293627,-0.007529448,0.037047736,-0.012027614,0.028254231,-0.04806953,0.071652174,0.028123828,0.04882382,-0.0565283,0.041908737,0.03510932,0.09424664,0.023949156,-0.013388241,0.0036272379,0.025791356,-0.0044977805,0.06972827,-0.046025533,-0.04607383,-0.09775567,0.034789767,0.005217514,9.605664E-4,-0.036447685,-0.059693955,0.039425146,0.064044654,0.02464461,-0.0046378965,0.059848268,-0.10539353,-0.0683735,-0.026091658