, want of due execution,\nwant of capacity in any contracting party, want or failure of consideration or mistake in fact or law;\n(b) the existence of any separate oral agreement as to a','5bbeeced9a5069dcde3da8563b2dfb6af2acd08405d7fff410623a0a6ed2c2ab','Evidence Act','General','[-0.10949145,0.09432546,0.017132876,-0.09034728,-0.021769565,0.026341068,-0.027359193,0.02871554,0.07985135,0.13201632,0.051264256,-0.005768903,0.024062006,-0.04319562,0.025445394,-0.0271433,-0.013625465,-0.017378632,-0.029456537,0.05732483,0.07287638,0.038166706,0.10197894,-0.0031271947,0.0139786545,0.0115755275,-0.04770106,-0.03786725,0.078238264,-0.06711188,0.059842654,0.058006678,-0.011512266,-0.02283663,0.060432024,0.022251396,0.042211916,-0.0065875347,0.042428073,-0.03387088,0.062427234,-0.031480014,-0.0016926436,-0.104076356,0.007734797,-0.005406542,0.025304198,0.04282139,-0.05456173,0.022079926,-0.04556095,-0.054323886,0.0010515746,0.042937994,-0.016351867,-0.050222654,0.0038057084,-0.001980277,-0.028174076,0.008043665,0.002268413,0.012926813,-0.09226472,-0.022706358,-0.008421073,-0.022881458,0.057131305,-0.035869613,-0.049909387,0.05287778,0.060423203,0.035973754,0.04173446,0.050221536,-0.078613736,-0.047527045,0.034626696,-0.013338781,-0.04592624,-0.14253154,-0.008127311,0.03914286,0.06411363,-0.071717285,-0.054229856,-0.0891222,-0.007148151,-0.041804425,0.0068716127,-0.01630234,0.029216815,-0.085573,0.07800439,0.013324509,0.043924242,-0.03812527,0.018983517,0.026854422,0.07379165,-0.0024554273,-0.035084724,-0.023056442,0.0012082526,-0.020492783,0.05655817,-0.026755085,-0.016782321,-0.103002116,0.06676896,0.0056476705,-0.008922133,-0.015000286,-0.04684064,0.06723209,0.036666457,-0.046645124,-0.038115982,0.03086435,-0.07291489,-0.07830906,-0.04096768,0.028530564,0.03909687,-0.010082447,0.003807009,-0.10219225,0.058326736,2.7882489E-33,0.057180766,0.0052170493,-0.089490026,0.0196217,-0.011296002,0.056394383,-0.026460817,0.014092513,0.06144712,-0.0041028745,-0.02376163,0.007610347,-0