ny contract, grant or other disposition of\nproperty, as to which he or she is giving evidence, was not contained in a document, and if he or she says\nthat it was, or if he or she is about to make any statement as to the contents of any document, which, in\nthe opinion of the court, ought to be produced, the adverse party may object to that evidence being given\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 27','5bbeeced9a5069dcde3da8563b2dfb6af2acd08405d7fff410623a0a6ed2c2ab','Evidence Act','General','[-0.036336843,0.15550308,-0.004535345,-0.039254744,0.005612707,0.062591195,0.0069542,0.013018634,-0.010720817,0.11957241,-0.029999524,-0.022546817,-0.009915204,-0.060387008,-0.0061848923,-0.010268279,0.0050193877,-0.08877028,-0.059040163,0.1023078,-0.04014102,-0.004046084,0.040479437,0.010389845,-0.044263985,-0.02925931,0.020397156,-0.061096057,0.069970705,-0.020656377,0.03603844,-0.026924454,-0.0019457088,0.05906616,0.034323227,-0.025615826,0.025476262,-0.0053165033,0.029318383,0.03430164,0.025131071,-0.052457802,-0.024139542,-0.0401449,0.048616644,-0.0013777403,0.040451344,0.072845094,-0.10294343,-0.019766811,-0.1001124,-0.07427336,-0.060309276,0.010680035,-0.079145685,-0.065250374,-0.028997114,-0.028383853,0.016591819,0.01026651,-0.032425683,-0.013438268,-0.06795118,0.08727694,-0.008715989,0.040945992,0.08891947,0.031180479,-0.007885651,0.042198196,0.017901404,0.011489697,0.002215765,0.020062966,-0.047758814,-0.010715345,-0.040859617,-0.004127359,-0.011878058,-0.1167417,0.041301608,0.0275458,0.029706841,0.0040696724,-0.007852747,-0.023220588,0.008031308,0.015755016,-0.06334551,-0.040932514,0.071133524,-0.09831771,0.02463877,0.05006487,0.13831702,0.03845472,-0.015643382,-0.01775471,0.028985405,0.025524246,0.0434896,0.009386925,-0.008515124,0.042205233,0.005191413,0.035879098,0.03713229,-0.03196118,0.051471446,0.023560327,-0.04702529,0.009637559,-0.030593572,-0.034184366,0.04254361,-0.052628253,0.049658068,0.05934683,-0.060938507,-0.06941657,0.026397727,0.00