d48fdf53a08b7fb472d5f45e335d65984e04786040dc07f25555a08','',10),(596,4,'Hindu Marriage Act, 1955, of\nIndia, or any enactment substituted for that Ordinance or those Acts; or\n(iv) a marriage declared by the Minister by statutory instrument to be a marriage for the\npurposes of this Act;\n(d) “of the full blood” means descended from a common ancestor by the same wife;\n(e) “of the half blood” means descended from a common ancestor but by different wives;\n(f) “of uterine blood” means descended from a common female ancestor but different\nhusbands.\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, the following persons are Hindus, Buddhists, Jains or Sikhs, as the case\nmay be—\n(a) a person, legitimate or illegitimate, both of whose parents are or were Hindus, Buddhists,\nJains or Sikhs by religion;\n(b) a person, legitimate or illegitimate, one of whose parents is or was a Hindu, a Buddhist, a\nJain or a Sikh by religion and who has been brought up as a member of the community, group\nor family to which that parent belongs or belonged;\n(c) any person who is a convert or reconvert to the Hindu, the Buddhist, Jain or Sikh religion.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 1','550d730e6560f1cb258c26b6358c766454be15dd959a422a5a82982dd6948818','Hindu Marriage and Divorce Act — Chapter 145','General','[-0.073932916,0.010685115,-0.0613296,-0.0061943266,-0.08267401,5.811273E-4,-0.00286721,-0.042160083,0.07525891,0.031876825,0.03672461,-0.034286723,-0.02786306,-0.028941834,0.013795885,0.010139963,-0.045437276,-0.024903005,-0.07030054,0.101731874,-0.09324642,7.5042195E-4,-0.03880545,-0.013488911,0.022840047,-0.055183757,0.034666516,-0.052456323,9.699235E-4,0.08106706,0.07345563,-0.03593767,-0.023028819,0.12513047,-0.104492985,-0.061105922,-0.044019207,0.09204652,0.031468503,-0.017176004,0.08392613,-0.03268725,0.019647084,-0.019664757,0.07155012,0.055116933,-0.018118976,0.0126139335,-0.045615435,0.016349234,-0.053645153,0.013221018,-0.04448175,0.12909593,0.011559761,-0.119739