e under this section unless that person has\nhimself or herself attained the age of twenty-one years.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 2','550d730e6560f1cb258c26b6358c766454be15dd959a422a5a82982dd6948818','Hindu Marriage and Divorce Act — Chapter 145','General','[-0.07461353,0.13474363,-0.056685258,-0.013791481,-0.036742844,-0.0069684563,-0.0782856,0.0120451385,0.0045986096,0.07719013,0.03838028,-0.024993192,0.054894283,-0.0649829,0.029230222,-0.020388564,-0.029070308,-0.012665889,-0.087183334,0.020162722,0.022845972,-0.04330131,0.017919386,8.393936E-5,-0.029651763,0.02195961,-0.04563996,-0.004870808,0.074493386,0.0032361457,0.05798613,0.008416338,0.0029937497,0.06748989,-0.041371364,-0.052786753,-0.0025149286,0.079696596,-0.026592776,-0.00269033,0.082442485,-0.024379147,0.04077066,-0.06525242,0.06645863,-0.008196954,-0.034773562,0.049563438,-0.09379556,-0.004676948,-0.10518371,0.0070296116,-0.010351366,0.09411585,0.01933148,-0.029415496,-0.06959931,-0.10935195,0.01658799,-0.03867304,-0.0043396703,0.013794568,-0.071102776,-0.034053262,-0.05540159,-0.10199782,0.083882235,-0.037911348,-0.011506218,0.008825467,0.024373446,-0.049989022,-0.007959883,0.10434676,-0.040313527,0.010671211,0.015306755,-0.009995787,-0.04898333,-0.08830302,-0.036467116,0.04160201,0.09122579,-0.034225065,-0.010625995,-0.03215661,0.038270347,0.01770839,-0.040067483,-0.02750734,0.028095484,-0.060515944,0.10909889,-0.0025825691,0.06732626,0.015819468,7.723104E-4,-0.0788743,-0.014005407,0.020113636,-0.13669905,-0.050345056,-0.010432764,0.07426618,-0.06508755,0.015141276,-0.02644352,0.027272375,0.04570478,0.014445791,-0.027560497,-0.028125241,-0.05124844,-0.009703824,0.017895997,-0.045801368,0.009836054,-0.038158394,0.06916188,0.056156445,-0.06385317,-0.008478433,-0.037221104,-0.023718435,0.027022215,-0.04158854,0.043972224,-5.3233697E-35,-0.020492025,-0.01842141,-0.007964948,0.009511875,-0.0431072,0.07657897,-0.06038992,0.06417029,-0.061387703,0.0040583615,0.071360596,-0.059990