nts and other processes;\n(h) of summoning of witnesses;\n(i) of facts to be proved at any stage of the proceedings;\n(j) of the mode in which the facts may be given;\n(k) of service of applications for enforcement or protection of rights;\n(l) reply to applications for enforcement or protection of rights;\n(m) of consolidation of applications;\n(n) of the content of an application for enforcement or protection of rights;\n(o) of hearing of applications for enforcement or protection of rights and freedoms;\n(p) of costs;\n(q) withdrawal or discontinuance of applications; and\n(r) any other matter as the Rules Committee may deem fit.\n19. Limitation of human rights actions\n(','2154f49f6089090e44cbc0673470077a8810e617b550e832d5550cef3d82f9e9','Human Rights (Enforcement) Act, 2019 #U2014 Chapter 12','General','[-0.03131532,0.044712473,-0.001381288,-0.079808824,0.003856957,0.017423758,0.05032758,-0.03920632,-0.01865853,0.113951065,0.09985245,-0.043463964,-0.024536703,-0.045532376,0.011619768,-0.0348888,-0.005040751,-0.027726373,-0.06234063,0.051071294,0.097479716,0.045054905,-0.033829935,-0.013992734,-0.06494267,-0.04531549,-0.053627193,-0.043107793,0.04386282,-0.0770231,0.039456084,-0.0024556557,0.07606057,0.0020313517,-0.019210335,0.042779937,0.02648522,-0.0601075,0.03647906,-0.028515905,0.019438986,-0.07570659,-0.023602642,-0.10235143,0.07669111,0.023414716,0.010029182,-0.013616717,-0.047965266,-0.013426092,-0.029412704,-0.018735325,-0.009895772,0.052939363,-0.061057243,-0.048420697,-0.0021251617,-0.037745073,0.03759724,-0.015085466,-0.046283957,-0.041354317,-0.12074732,0.02637202,-0.020772634,-0.10549585,0.043191873,-0.0679628,0.027895132,0.025915675,0.055895496,-0.031780794,0.020600598,-0.018324267,-0.082696326,0.046835236,0.050733875,0.021328963,0.025584782,-0.08271883,-0.012122393,-9.631131E-4,0.11739925,-0.023702044,0.031042282,-0.048289496,-0.02395431,0.009031433,0.07910571,0.007481218,0.106624335,0.0031230813,0.0442202,0.020095546,0.017762652,-0.045665003,0.0