eo\nconferencing, the court recording system and any other technology approved by the Chief Justice for use in\ncase management;\n“virus” means a computer program designed to replicate itself, usually having some unex','94a538ec57c8253ebb484ae580f107af9a528e661f65739f2701b709c8e35f95','Judicature (Electronic Filing, Service and Virtual Proceedings) Rules, 2025','General','[-0.006264983,0.10659237,-0.0529316,-0.09808893,-0.020112636,-0.020902595,0.039099947,0.043581106,0.085172914,0.07805249,0.032023437,0.032237716,0.015872948,-0.0035428633,-0.024320303,-0.04795108,0.019137902,-0.106656626,-0.046971127,0.051031865,0.11145089,0.0392541,0.02063119,-0.066339634,-0.035388455,0.002906431,-0.11699494,-0.004819579,-8.573623E-4,-0.041918274,0.016213017,0.07098888,-0.032490402,0.03715321,-0.009869892,0.0128485365,0.046663914,0.024025636,-0.010143415,-0.047880866,0.025664201,-0.06520802,-0.0022837333,-0.02592064,0.027812388,0.03540029,0.0022929902,0.062570125,-0.11276704,0.04364945,-0.14227846,-0.011223814,0.025270635,0.1421761,-0.01476021,-0.037427906,0.022614442,0.034052838,-0.037932027,0.016216485,-0.04089067,0.061450895,-0.047301356,0.01653341,0.034557614,-0.012139612,0.040600166,0.006306693,0.010548806,-0.074895084,-0.0373251,-0.007575441,0.018280616,0.08105595,-0.06596764,-0.032533493,-0.017765587,0.035270784,0.041508567,-0.030192392,0.047671754,0.050581113,0.028011,-0.046958227,0.004578028,-0.06922008,0.003192199,0.045807593,0.03276824,-0.065793216,0.06247936,0.0070334887,0.032199368,0.0487465,-1.5803493E-4,-0.03529516,0.04223714,0.006883271,0.09650022,0.05085713,0.04739854,0.043043923,0.018635254,-0.0053570005,-0.025210265,-0.051879697,0.019037442,-0.0091079585,0.014751177,-0.056123633,-0.05515983,-0.021155735,-0.103287324,-0.070610605,0.009980209,0.02975388,-0.13189583,0.10636217,0.07233906,-0.0072765253,-0.0017671963,-0.035111148,-0.09663831,-0.09106551,0.008239303,-0.064499505,0.06402561,-6.820535E-34,0.018628322,0.0043204837,-0.048897628,0.004851774,0.033373877,0.0