 to the facility enabling the giving or receiving of evidence through electronic means\nwithout a person physically appearing in court;\nPart II – E-Justice\n5. Use of technology in court processes\n(1) In all judicial proceedings, the court and the parties to the case may, where possible, use technology\nto expedite the proceedings and make them more efficient and effective.\n(2) The technology referred to in subrule (1) includes—\n(a) electronic filing;\n(b) electronic service of documents;\n(c) digital display devices;\n(d) transcript devices;\n(e) evidence presentation devices;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 3','94a538ec57c8253ebb484ae580f107af9a528e661f65739f2701b709c8e35f95','Judicature (Electronic Filing, Service and Virtual Proceedings) Rules, 2025','General','[-0.08834802,0.071336605,-0.06916379,-0.14363046,-0.0021593752,-0.0043997434,0.07232848,0.05843733,0.06447381,0.06890142,0.0054177972,0.03750577,0.03631794,-0.017006643,-0.004637657,-0.071342334,0.09319709,-0.008381626,-0.04543366,0.017905228,0.06650872,0.0218023,0.036411792,-0.05712346,-0.089042224,-0.0070569916,-0.13035148,-0.05597988,0.017138736,-0.07429852,-0.0031912846,0.043029945,-0.0036088475,0.05528854,-0.05867999,-0.033854634,0.011731563,-0.03560971,-0.06179122,-0.059004307,-5.174662E-4,-0.04882936,-0.010358723,-0.02638181,0.031093413,0.037782572,-0.03591556,0.0677629,-0.104418464,0.008038591,-0.094907224,-0.036283556,-0.0022928973,0.114581734,-0.09099127,-0.030426418,0.0700642,0.027548984,-0.02724467,0.03059172,0.035061337,0.034184586,-0.02838755,0.0021490746,0.019946396,0.027609156,0.10183178,0.034080714,0.028597228,-0.013994079,-0.016317181,0.04192887,-0.021492556,0.07563402,-0.04702508,-0.004804209,-0.021861032,0.005260528,0.09678774,0.03609008,0.06936373,0.0017900119,0.0070101316,-0.07656843,-0.06754321,-0.01356975,-0.0109386705,-0.002302837,0.054787043,-0.053543914,0.018186476,0.036472782,0.020508286,0.030947007,0.04458059,-0.067511745,0.04330901,-0.01043772,0.136