the party shall seek the direction of the court.\n(4) As an alternative to verification of a hard copy list, the parties may seek the direction of the court\nfor a verifying affidavit to identify the documents by reference to a medium by which the data was\nserved and the date of service.\n24. Availability of System\n(1) The System shall receive electronic documents, except when the System is unavailable due to\nmaintenance or other cause.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 10','94a538ec57c8253ebb484ae580f107af9a528e661f65739f2701b709c8e35f95','Judicature (Electronic Filing, Service and Virtual Proceedings) Rules, 2025','General','[-0.12788175,0.07923852,-0.018208412,-0.064140566,0.021938536,-0.052121863,0.044525284,0.0064037694,0.06695567,0.041094486,0.04822351,0.016768364,0.05467513,0.0030131002,-0.11429013,-0.08924316,0.02149677,-0.009902597,-4.2660457E-5,0.021929203,-0.0068977224,-0.019717837,0.038724698,-0.012907938,-0.032505225,-0.0051896144,-0.013630016,-0.0685489,-0.02110875,-0.05912325,0.03038708,0.07117089,-0.0127347475,0.032477226,0.023381274,0.00847016,0.051179796,-0.014714579,0.04198785,-0.06609642,-0.036182318,-0.08129626,-0.029517649,0.03108953,0.058264263,0.028494133,0.0265994,0.07490425,-0.10360807,0.020193242,-0.07309297,-0.038090654,-0.025302537,0.047672935,-0.11903234,0.0060088197,0.060953144,-0.0014252139,-0.034145527,0.038265757,0.034952544,-0.026020901,-0.0283186,0.021559551,0.051322307,0.028049717,0.07082425,-0.03569324,0.022535319,-0.008210469,0.06947234,0.05267901,0.026842063,0.05471653,0.0052283565,-0.050752275,-0.015079887,-0.027940316,-0.015161614,-0.06768512,0.0075634625,0.08080571,0.04132464,-0.086841546,-0.00941692,-0.005460574,-0.050991103,0.035729542,0.013141881,-0.03523501,0.06492152,-0.081909485,-4.7719752E-4,-0.045645703,0.11280533,-0.016296202,0.049806867,-0.011005312,0.09611139,0.014593788,-0.010428192,0.060019564,0.0034351535,-0.037866436,-0.05100695,-0.0049582715,0.008748135,-0.073004395,-0.003624486,-0.04