virtual link proceedings or a virtual hearing, he or she shall, within five\ndays after receipt of notice of the application for virtual proceedings, file an objection by letter or\nelectronically through the System stating the reasons for the objection, and shall serve a copy on\nthe opposite party.\n(2) The opposite party served with the objection under subrule (1) shall, within five days of receipt of\nthe objection, file a reply.\n(3) Upon the filing of the reply under subrule (2), the court shall give its decision on the matter without\nundue delay.\n36. Documentary evidence\n(1) Where documen','94a538ec57c8253ebb484ae580f107af9a528e661f65739f2701b709c8e35f95','Judicature (Electronic Filing, Service and Virtual Proceedings) Rules, 2025','General','[-0.033824105,0.06572824,-0.008680102,-0.12664758,-0.08376521,0.016844109,0.016893469,-0.0029643285,0.049131017,0.0752636,0.029389905,1.6462992E-4,-0.04551308,-0.018538319,0.061375927,-0.035029467,0.03939567,-0.019455846,0.0025919054,0.07736439,0.08660537,-0.020663071,0.021292396,-0.019817224,-0.011161896,-0.085944034,-0.10107467,-0.01991531,0.09060466,-0.07376337,0.015562617,0.03947988,-0.07258717,0.004539222,0.020096872,0.017041575,0.042688537,-0.03433858,-0.024569513,-0.037127506,0.032817382,-0.056392502,-0.04847003,-0.059075262,0.029370846,0.041425537,0.03533408,0.08028124,-0.08324999,0.029974665,-0.09559186,-0.035363633,0.063174464,0.082643494,-0.07344716,-0.033218578,0.079514,0.025346626,0.018248474,0.06957975,0.03174719,0.07039933,-0.109346025,0.026240343,0.020639531,-0.021146122,0.07899926,-0.012471156,0.018061947,-0.034326036,-0.010681864,-0.0065522064,0.047481008,0.021223392,-0.087889515,-0.013023338,-0.026417376,0.0056134523,0.04121034,-0.038877785,0.030012619,0.045544367,0.04997856,-0.077741355,-0.041698184,-0.007011404,-0.017676793,0.02777337,0.08000369,-0.047094073,0.08616477,-0.0074675744,0.020536132,0.020196011,0.09623087,-0.027527925,0.018736461,0.037335385,0.09607849,0.0667688,0.035669163,0.03316494,