 a notice under subrule (1) objects to the execution of the decree or\norder, the court may consider the objection virtually and make such order as it deems fit.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 16','94a538ec57c8253ebb484ae580f107af9a528e661f65739f2701b709c8e35f95','Judicature (Electronic Filing, Service and Virtual Proceedings) Rules, 2025','General','[-0.013205082,0.04969458,0.029940683,-0.052520413,0.010498655,7.999556E-4,0.011860068,0.0047272174,0.023923235,0.05998469,0.045961034,0.019810148,0.046409495,-0.06581066,0.024921685,-0.018474478,0.014928582,-0.030712258,-0.051904976,0.00814696,0.0407993,0.05289745,-0.03307952,0.014207845,-0.086126514,-0.01657978,-0.008387583,0.003503257,0.07626387,-0.0066284835,0.0049016685,0.01712077,0.050259102,0.034458686,-0.0072791134,0.003704656,0.05212086,-0.0335342,0.0046540657,-0.04802922,0.004051363,-0.04553939,0.028878689,0.0044734473,0.060333807,0.00851023,-0.02985518,0.030694237,-0.06896902,-0.01807312,-0.018383555,-0.1254484,-0.01541949,0.09528138,-0.05649866,0.015294186,0.0732841,-0.047900464,-0.08293283,-0.021943578,-0.030961372,0.051152207,-0.065023385,0.04190661,-0.024427116,-0.019565776,0.078883566,-0.040568728,0.060069755,0.08006863,0.017064638,-0.03622035,-0.039677303,-0.0036893892,-0.075582586,-0.050022803,0.029250376,0.05472603,-0.030537557,-0.10724012,-0.02115954,0.0037191545,0.008615488,-0.057411253,0.023200778,-0.09726271,0.013412157,-0.024851618,0.12297462,0.09071285,0.056925245,0.0027966131,0.07833273,-0.04739661,0.044470657,-0.0113915345,0.044180915,-0.023833062,0.070076555,0.06650865,0.016238166,0.012830647,-0.11575335,0.0026208484,0.032100067,-0.0051676994,-0.09264961,-0.03210963,0.01545164,-0.12633732,-0.05470145,-0.09489996,0.022941394,-0.052764025,-0.040121086,0.026975967,0.015448448,0.10507647,0.03787421,-0.14524736,0.038870864,-0.007329673,-0.04148559,-0.040685546,0.04587371,-0.05320829,0.014500255,4.0642634E-35,0.016250342,-0.015104724,-0.069409736,-0.029451724,0.04230006,0.061