ich one person, namely the landlord or lessor, grants or is deemed to have granted\nanother person, namely the tenant or lessee, exclusive possession of land usually but not\nnecessarily for a period defined, directly or indirectly, by reference to a specific date of\ncommencement and a specific date of ending;\n(d) usually but not necessarily in return for a rent which may be for a capital sum known as a\npremium or for both a rent and a premium but may be in return for goods or services or both\nor may be free of any required return;\n[paragraph (d) amended by section 4(b) of Act 1 of 2004]\n(e) under which both the landlord and the tenant may, subject to the terms and conditions of\nthe lease and having due regard for the interests of the other party, exercise such of the\npowers of a freehold owner as are appropriate and possible given the specific nature of a\nleasehold tenure.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 4','68e12867abb34684adf4d997244b8b2018962d2095ae1c315b73d9526b8b4291','Land Act','General','[-0.049228016,0.021520644,0.011671733,-7.690685E-4,-0.056451157,-0.0072040157,0.0030746455,-0.075339794,0.096109256,0.027988972,0.054665696,-0.006754997,0.07556037,-0.017429274,0.006111443,0.0277172,-0.061788857,0.056611363,-0.020963669,0.039234053,0.1646969,0.021476315,-0.044707928,-0.026166562,0.052359965,-0.0145693915,-0.0046870615,0.026291382,0.11684734,-0.004378213,-0.0037470192,-0.013676055,0.07803414,0.042630322,0.018147485,0.022108026,-0.045541648,-0.046382166,-0.03239537,0.021980911,-0.02681871,-0.022957647,0.08976743,-0.009234851,-0.022090979,0.044116337,0.03957161,-0.037135683,-0.11930206,-0.023061614,0.069928244,0.059630997,-0.0028216653,0.12003598,-0.04948821,-0.017099943,-0.0059691565,-0.05832332,0.0075938636,-0.041702647,0.041657392,0.028612057,-0.045040574,-0.015203649,-0.0027115305,-0.05729962,-0.078223705,-0.018099023,-0.07785098,0.01552874,-0.014322373,-0.026426585,-0.02808994,0.03549009,-0.0095886355,0.024689386,0.02040124,