 Any person aggrieved by a decision of the board under this section may appeal to the District\nLand Tribunal against that decision; and the District Land Tribunal may confirm, vary, reverse or\nmodify the decision of the board and make such other order in respect of that decision or as it is\nempowered to make by this Act.\n8. Incidents of certificate of customary ownership\n(1) A certificate of customary ownership shall be taken to confirm and is conclusive evidence of the\ncustomary rights and interests specified in it, and the land to which the certificate refers shall\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 7','68e12867abb34684adf4d997244b8b2018962d2095ae1c315b73d9526b8b4291','Land Act','General','[-0.064154364,0.060028017,0.0033823822,-0.052112553,-0.033364765,0.07165247,0.039822694,-0.0028550979,0.019404765,-0.033052176,0.029010883,-0.020298997,0.029323688,0.011598275,-0.10025008,-0.053995527,-0.017812112,0.057244696,-0.0018163647,0.07160333,0.054467414,0.026531955,-0.031595655,0.04372496,-0.064054824,-0.06755476,-0.041554596,0.05955374,0.021381224,-0.09929535,-0.010023729,0.030093964,0.066442795,0.004325162,-0.026620863,-0.00374698,0.010900192,-0.029313384,0.036926858,-0.018238826,0.0072708926,-0.061725814,-0.01902753,-0.016751515,0.0032340777,0.07866906,0.0011474901,-0.056050424,-0.064923055,0.02921254,-0.010074554,-0.05280109,-0.009305406,-0.04191657,-0.08619834,-0.060231224,-0.0013252408,-0.00584369,-0.0021710128,0.021951238,0.012734642,0.0021910283,-0.040499043,0.025559388,0.04037629,-0.017183632,-0.01672521,-0.016033502,-0.031050023,0.052263618,0.032303113,0.011409533,0.0066888947,-0.005565211,-0.049947336,-0.043464266,-0.029186735,0.047486514,0.05660274,-0.16349167,-0.009501059,0.11557072,0.046977144,-0.03607811,0.016363401,-0.0324315,0.011367243,0.04928449,0.059050407,0.053662453,0.061384078,-0.06397438,0.054338027,-0.05580971,0.027955757,0.009620821,0.016307598,-0.041187406,0.08434556,0.05046939,0.053544793,0.041178167,-0.10123005,-0.0