absolute majority of all the members of that association at the meeting referred to\nin subsection (6).\n(8) An approved constitution shall be binding on all members of the association.\n18. Incorporation of officers as managing committee\n(1) The officers of an association which has voted to approve a certified constitution shall apply to the\nCommissioner on the prescribed form to be incorporate','68e12867abb34684adf4d997244b8b2018962d2095ae1c315b73d9526b8b4291','Land Act','General','[0.010734566,0.03500257,0.037124332,-0.029494364,-0.01095387,-0.02117785,-6.447795E-4,-0.028345654,-0.061755154,0.06221222,0.0044448734,-0.011229081,0.018625902,-0.018456537,-9.955298E-4,-0.0029870057,0.01163494,0.010548575,-0.09313129,0.05206382,0.104631595,0.09439149,0.013337968,-0.0053512817,-0.06950872,-0.04936569,-0.029502476,-0.041932713,0.014194239,-0.06895757,-0.012778599,0.032039914,0.02188055,0.059061423,0.01946147,0.005543133,0.047432438,-0.012243014,0.0575331,-0.043975774,0.0177627,-0.061826803,0.00948705,-0.048576403,0.013056622,0.052908007,0.02219898,-0.001769269,-0.077374116,-0.016442085,0.010718348,-0.056045152,0.0031894483,0.011079918,-0.028106967,0.010734671,-0.050169677,-0.031324126,0.035869747,8.103432E-4,0.0060224314,-0.0050716763,-0.1468337,-0.0060777925,0.083411425,-0.038934328,0.027290806,-0.061301667,0.036447007,-0.014886723,0.06144464,-0.012676128,-0.006292008,0.032284405,-0.049033534,0.008654215,-0.04436412,0.060606908,0.041360058,-0.13809286,0.0043111537,0.10551954,0.06652645,-0.04575984,0.1097277,-0.022236027,-4.218034E-4,0.043597076,0.05443218,-0.055558056,0.07791276,-0.07236314,0.022106858,-0.0034658252,-0.02880767,0.026591817,0.08037647,-0.07351057,0.0075126267,0.05377422,0.004405979,-0.018755672,-0.09406024,-0.01859745,0.0015982281,-0.05812546,0.022696046,-0.012888698,-0.018704914,0.10117362,-0.04238638,-0.018430052,-0.039458666,0.017598553,-0.019218497,0.03562131,0.03454798,0.04269377,0.019689871,-0.05873061,-0.058743913,0.0115142865,0.031070052,-0.07