gible for\nreappointment for a further one term.\n(2) A member of the commission may be removed from office by the President only for—\n(a) inability to perform the functions of his or her office arising from infirmity of body or mind;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 29','68e12867abb34684adf4d997244b8b2018962d2095ae1c315b73d9526b8b4291','Land Act','General','[-0.028470522,0.011256646,0.016161706,0.054401204,-0.10456091,0.017717399,0.037390396,-0.09701143,-0.022018308,0.054803748,-0.01694437,-0.007444717,0.00713387,-0.08436757,-0.02118749,-0.03560055,0.004467669,0.046754498,-0.030495996,0.10682539,0.11880804,-0.014227779,-0.06665858,-0.029013054,-0.02147761,-0.10606527,-0.12105361,-0.017643161,0.008498469,-0.03947273,0.022723507,-0.0317651,0.01655708,0.045434196,0.049757153,0.008494951,-0.0011950325,0.03173584,0.09284616,-0.05045874,0.06920642,-0.038047433,-0.027533421,-0.096592344,0.029101947,0.015131855,0.025487112,0.04751672,-0.11932507,-0.051309884,0.022399206,-0.005090733,-0.06256545,0.09527586,-0.0307682,-0.11099072,-0.033285674,-0.040481143,0.040930465,-0.025932102,0.015543413,-0.017814111,-0.016873108,0.012331652,-0.011695003,-0.05784824,0.0064335023,-0.08363059,0.0032424387,0.021648463,-0.013526036,-0.03461072,-0.04752317,0.061673503,-0.031579882,-0.016017277,0.028733097,0.031215653,0.071843944,-0.012492224,0.042154856,0.08608833,0.045566835,0.025307065,-1.1600051E-4,-0.0745051,-0.0027551223,-0.03848322,-0.0036487076,-0.042546317,0.0033438164,0.0440791,0.13161877,0.013376052,-0.031864166,-0.0860645,-0.017899705,0.047198545,-0.03372175,0.06374145,-0.09338507,-0.055212483,-0.014381814,0.0043294705,-0.13549961,0.035266913,0.0013809106,-0.07212252,-0.009638261,-0.04279306,-0.09874405,-0.033535045,-0.09648897,-0.010952633,0.038426995,0.035781026,-0.09460117,-0.0014909499,-0.026515596,0.026299246,-0.038933527,-0.017524546,0.037087314,-0.06507088,0.05325468,3.1409488E-4,0.08794098,-2.4757213E-34,-0.07586081,0.013400788,-0.06853126,0.06277964,