rge of its functions under this Act at least once in every two\nmonths at such place and time as the chairperson shall appoint.\n(4) The quorum at any meeting of a board shall be three.\n(5) Any decision of a board shall be arrived at by consensus and, in case of a contentious issue, by a\nmajority vote.\n(6) Subject to this Act, a board may regulate its own procedure.\n63. Expenses of a board, remuneration of members and audit\n(1) All expenses of a board shall be charged on the district administration funds.\n(2) Members of the Board shall be remunerated','68e12867abb34684adf4d997244b8b2018962d2095ae1c315b73d9526b8b4291','Land Act','General','[0.008430277,-0.0432544,0.019050777,-0.047249958,-0.11121404,-0.026561122,-0.009639977,-0.03687066,-0.031632904,0.07740446,-0.03623954,-0.027550634,-0.019432385,-0.020084145,6.5878534E-4,-0.015766213,0.031636216,0.0018540298,-0.06256569,0.06019987,0.08278494,0.034389347,0.006016323,-0.040777758,-0.065106854,-0.099218264,-0.024333674,-0.040031675,0.015856178,-0.08145502,0.041010205,0.014030205,0.07939036,0.044022683,-0.0023420323,0.10909019,0.04182154,0.0029203908,0.02960511,-0.048532363,0.06504378,-0.042652603,0.030417804,-0.05593808,0.008082525,0.05808911,0.07324497,-0.002276588,-0.09123986,-0.04317763,0.011154511,-0.07110585,0.03385369,0.045523595,-0.07851957,-0.031294394,-0.012529722,-0.056456227,0.036152646,0.013436428,-0.013506036,0.047277488,-0.07570219,-0.0301629,0.04835708,-0.054807413,-0.010633711,-0.09197145,-0.014132533,-0.07222733,0.049625922,-0.023982732,0.015095221,-0.010476701,-0.035393987,-0.012612457,-0.030156825,0.090337336,0.08785868,-0.12799777,0.009743536,0.08959263,0.06926054,-0.00867076,0.06337302,-0.03915281,-0.0025354414,0.020352319,0.023567865,-0.034023516,0.050869964,0.027197873,0.060152072,0.06081086,-0.064740136,0.022386683,0.049006045,-0.049118303,0.0060099023,0.04436998,-0.04620478,0.031057952,-0.059665717,-0.004036817,-0.046687506,-0.035610825,0.0034076858,-0.016431915,0.005375555,0.0750022,-0.