r a period of five years and may be eligible for\nreappointment.\n(2) A member of a District Land Tribunal may be removed from office by the Chief Justice only for—\n(a) inability to perform the functions of his or her office arising from infirmity of body or mind;\n(b) misbehaviour or misconduct;\n(c) incompetence;\n(d) absence from at least five consecutive meetings of the District Land Tribunal without lawful\nexcuse;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 38','68e12867abb34684adf4d997244b8b2018962d2095ae1c315b73d9526b8b4291','Land Act','General','[-0.0036024773,0.035727978,0.006384133,-0.020101156,-0.02289709,0.0049356925,-0.027139703,-0.029814877,0.0071177655,0.05325936,0.010226339,-0.03995798,-0.0015014107,-0.05913526,-0.02473849,-0.02344579,0.004921914,0.034517832,-0.061718192,0.021458859,0.075712435,0.028577685,-8.8358356E-4,-0.043463737,-0.023357771,-0.05536869,-0.047898944,-0.00498199,0.029839667,-0.0783802,0.020075653,0.041182198,-0.014846184,0.04969267,0.041457154,-0.0035402589,-0.03518746,0.016693514,0.0074409684,-0.05801428,0.068540685,-0.003673034,0.0143534,-0.08490889,-0.0034144712,0.01892855,0.022603624,-0.027190823,-0.13993484,-0.058110777,0.090528704,0.010949074,0.011627585,0.12585399,-0.0781594,-0.068873,-4.978386E-4,6.8050524E-4,0.0055793514,0.025700606,0.05846727,0.051014204,-0.085544325,-0.024913859,-0.021164846,-0.07274929,0.045944918,-0.07279346,9.094249E-4,0.010246524,0.018230215,-0.07138847,-7.1151624E-4,0.037060097,5.278208E-4,0.026999084,0.0073795314,0.096691735,0.100517064,-0.058554705,0.021648739,0.05675969,0.06835809,-0.01739211,-0.02771277,-0.0637934,0.0027018168,0.017747456,0.028478678,-0.05740063,0.09015653,0.029970875,0.12736826,0.007568258,-0.043493718,-0.058768477,0.014905297,0.021451104,-0.009826024,0.057289753,-0.06924187,-0.011586035,-0.114766814,0.033587784,-0.058259115,-0.004055698,-0.03761678,-0.014279354,-0.0152596785,-0.019562937,-0.089713484,-0.07535232,-0.057522334,0.025065323,-0.009338901,0.025740795,-