ons and all documents or things relating to\napplications;\n(b) issue and serve notices and summons of the District Land Tribunal;\n(c) issue interim orders in the absence of the Chairperson;\n(d) keep all documents, books, things or records of the proceedings of the District Land\nTribunal;\n(e) taxation of costs; and\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 40','68e12867abb34684adf4d997244b8b2018962d2095ae1c315b73d9526b8b4291','Land Act','General','[-0.046999417,0.102415964,-0.06099537,-0.05389035,-0.06158313,0.010208013,-0.0023042604,0.030998172,-0.020981018,0.11445986,-0.07991456,-0.14110638,0.0059210644,-0.008432576,-0.041396946,0.025627883,0.025144441,0.053902686,-0.037507914,-0.013185005,0.084771164,0.06607281,-0.008657081,-0.0588261,-0.027305342,-0.04276329,-0.03484476,0.010084268,0.039791737,-0.06422273,-0.005939759,0.033584982,-0.03687461,0.038158897,0.014581994,0.012886902,-0.028551813,0.0059924107,-0.0069023347,-0.02247913,0.04037327,0.05293106,0.0126144085,-0.07359021,0.0032193584,0.06385524,0.08685814,0.012530099,-0.13818233,-0.025179056,0.05608067,0.06346154,0.02381907,0.06121938,-0.07208393,-0.03709292,0.07072841,-0.01664121,0.008815995,-0.006657861,-0.028814409,0.012127699,-0.10526544,-0.042916905,0.022008581,-0.093354285,0.015401643,-0.032349713,-0.028008522,-0.058596827,0.031781763,-0.019267945,0.014780294,0.019452684,-0.007786926,-0.0028831735,-0.03677988,0.04937127,0.06396611,-0.06915277,0.010045763,0.04556505,0.03861373,-0.026096415,0.03875997,-0.051498465,0.02149533,0.058523156,0.05982343,-0.014497735,0.12898251,-0.020316275,0.048521604,-0.012047577,0.017276881,-0.022542015,0.01822889,-0.030234013,0.034143988,0.04462172,-0.020415606,-0.035454717,-0.08503369,-0.022578267,0.00332174,0.013885715,0.015272941,0.058506507,0.018633006,-0.009563158,-0.09455718,-0.052763425,-0.06881349,0.06572379,-0.02344683,0.06607251,-0.027988112,-0.034444086,0.015302433,-0.054695003,0.040629014,-0.016594404,-0.072240196,-0.05733193,0.06458689,0.0263690