ator or some other person to\nmediate in the dispute.\n89. Functions of the mediator\n(1) There shall be one or more Mediators in each District who shall','68e12867abb34684adf4d997244b8b2018962d2095ae1c315b73d9526b8b4291','Land Act','General','[0.007998802,0.0809011,0.06669782,-0.100540206,-0.049218975,-0.023616804,-0.00980725,-0.0032540248,-0.049659804,0.09869733,0.029055156,0.009515468,-0.01224751,-0.047663376,0.012720379,0.018908152,-0.056981463,0.041711353,-0.069069475,0.039525468,0.08568691,0.061753742,-0.003449309,-0.025514502,-0.03009001,-0.031267535,-0.017279793,0.012296509,0.016654514,-0.08578462,0.008335611,0.07672955,-0.030926874,0.006254394,0.005428692,0.014669974,0.0072342404,-0.03624914,0.019012112,-0.08161504,0.02692681,-0.068528734,0.027357478,-0.14789584,-0.0010880707,0.050934196,0.048965022,-0.031039989,-0.0641979,-0.034131996,-0.004343182,-0.016990483,0.02828809,0.056068,-0.028876979,-0.039865542,-0.008094541,0.015560125,0.05443821,0.038884614,0.028978305,0.025219366,-0.13614364,-0.018529339,-0.011926935,-0.12837328,0.077118225,-0.07692051,-0.018812275,0.046812184,0.06830934,-0.048946753,0.047723442,-0.021455506,-0.01066037,-0.024713635,-0.004918115,0.074410416,0.020649873,-0.089327656,0.018245494,-0.0060404562,0.069721214,-0.055407092,0.036794968,-0.083449565,-0.030932061,0.022316983,0.11592957,-0.045191854,0.114310674,-0.03347449,0.07662646,0.055021454,0.040218044,-0.04296079,0.03127059,-0.027569508,0.029413382,0.07480675,-0.016503533,-0.031233631,-0.084706634,-0.046171624,0.042274997,-0.023873176,0.017123897,0.02972365,-0.008607649,-0.014390666,-0.10174091,-0.047443464,-0.02789862,0.03916826,-0.014863823,-0.013467856,0.03518496,-0.036416225,-0.02291523,-0.1089167,0.002311432,0.030448584,-0.04103148,-0.040401313,0.013830092,-0.017501833,0.02525889,2.4597774E-33,-0.0111280205,0.010534425,-0.10287863,-0.047834154,-0.028825788,-0.009049277,0.01718003,0.05049194,0.013279714,0.0013228211,-0.02818363,-0.028332455,-0.042798527,-0.04229542,0.010533479,0