ption of land or boundaries;\n(c) contains an entry or endorsement made in error;\n(d) contains an illegal endorsement;\n(e) is illegally or wrongfully obtained; or\n(f) is illegally or wrongfully retained;\ngive not less than twenty one day\'s notice, of the intention to take the appropriate action, in the\nprescribed form to any party likely to be affected by any decision made under this section.\n[subsection (2) substituted by section 37(a) of Act 1 of 2004]\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 43','68e12867abb34684adf4d997244b8b2018962d2095ae1c315b73d9526b8b4291','Land Act','General','[-0.01621842,0.09001393,0.017577847,-0.02647459,-0.030212566,0.006840536,0.05067792,-0.013640779,0.005255405,-0.014132802,0.04353597,-0.09637343,0.06641359,0.006966575,-0.08062738,-0.019430162,-0.032747198,0.08991217,-0.04568924,0.0644178,0.08551782,0.06390529,-0.07236331,0.03638653,-0.017026264,-0.04050688,-0.029412802,0.06709453,-0.0076737916,-0.11903774,-0.011614033,-0.02577317,0.0024572148,0.012712604,0.077813536,0.00847364,-0.009025527,0.018094117,0.07170561,-0.01343447,0.087527096,-0.08292113,-0.018801892,-0.0066316053,-0.031717107,0.0473727,0.05619907,0.006469722,-0.09262261,0.001898697,0.019629823,-0.03898556,0.025755588,0.06930867,-0.030695897,-0.005588597,-0.008265287,0.010579534,-0.016687308,0.042252183,-0.04951108,0.029145172,-0.06150279,-0.013788579,0.019617861,-0.08158987,-0.044867508,-0.056561735,-0.059449445,-0.026599886,0.08443235,-0.019351205,0.006870296,0.009147836,-0.055856656,-0.008974001,-0.08961831,0.10026837,0.014285006,-0.09038809,0.02879338,0.019091688,0.024891967,-0.031949036,-0.011468977,0.033435196,0.01653238,0.0021093788,0.020270701,0.037915714,0.07753233,-0.09425507,0.099676974,0.01798094,-0.011677352,-0.002447687,-0.0040809615,-0.10295225,0.07113808,0.05346463,-0.019877274,0.0017443934,-0.10837815,-0.012553441,0.029783394,-0.009085187,-0.048936628,0.001275851,-0.03611671,-0.014887865,-0.00872173,-0.029399084,-0.091281995,0.026271837