ans the Parliament of Uganda;\n“persons with disabilities” means persons with disabilities as disabilities are defined under the Persons\nwith Disabilities Act;\n“public officer” means any person holding or acting in any public office;\n“public service” means service in any civil capacity of the Government or a local government;\n“registered voter” means a person whose name is entered on the voters register;\n“speaker” means the speaker elected under section 11 or section 24 and “deputy speaker” shall be\nconstrued accordingly;\n“urban authority” includes a city council, city division council, municipal cou','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.0042625065,0.02064677,0.048942037,-0.022311684,-0.06663237,-0.062089544,5.2885793E-5,0.0018510116,-0.04782049,0.06573232,0.03195794,-0.081363454,6.473409E-4,-0.03595173,0.048472814,0.008834174,-0.014057741,-0.02854767,-0.057329178,0.053317335,0.18413475,0.07940254,-0.004083552,0.03507831,-0.018587701,0.03545865,-0.07935473,-0.013067072,0.035910126,-0.043117,0.03190022,0.020634057,0.10431022,0.01240665,0.028422106,0.082770705,0.08712009,-2.5467944E-4,0.013775324,-0.039764274,0.05513941,-0.037028298,-0.0046259,-0.13635428,-0.0027181006,0.04405235,0.07003236,-0.01616799,-0.074203275,0.004750256,0.024283782,-0.0067175715,-0.019884147,0.0857303,0.043530777,-0.012269234,-0.0491644,-0.0039385566,-0.010638898,0.008529261,-0.06433367,0.10050771,-0.12125168,-0.0015587057,-2.481823E-4,-0.07511198,0.0035698132,-0.04947365,-0.003809973,-0.079085186,0.0031011526,-0.07321033,0.026816476,0.050875667,-0.056580298,-0.10022854,0.050646152,0.07652442,0.026175955,-0.075489745,-0.042896003,0.048575085,0.06699247,-2.0772679E-4,0.03992984,-0.029655814,-0.055182382,4.5447677E-4,0.06545012,-0.018773738,-0.0016765835,0.041291866,0.07873346,0.023151934,0.06823662,-0.019867178,0.096414834,0.02325954,6.773026E-4,0.05600849,-0.068731464,-0.057348173,-0.038189422,0.0032787828,0.012994777,0