quivalent of a parish in a district council.\nPart II – Local governments\n3. Local governments\n(1) The system of local government shall be based on the district as a unit under which there shall be\nlower local governments and administrative units,\n(2) The local governments in a district rural area shall be—\n(a) the district council; and\n(b) the subcounty councils.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 2','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.05360828,-0.025616169,0.0077914833,-0.040984035,-0.083906464,-0.030143602,-0.034759354,-0.071735054,-0.0034640196,0.056655526,-0.0043427455,-0.124858834,-0.007077384,-0.03211299,-0.0058687334,-0.0020496568,0.027788097,0.05224125,-0.009337866,-0.014780909,0.08177403,0.10829676,-0.038338337,0.046818443,0.004837398,-0.029138526,-0.06602415,-0.005184347,-0.0018693442,-0.017586248,0.03791795,0.027842266,0.13763365,-0.015194449,0.003933425,0.06382063,0.037484802,0.03814941,0.051833056,0.03087322,0.046333853,-0.026663328,-0.029741744,-0.10976228,0.028011195,0.012306795,-0.011193805,0.051326234,-0.09249312,-0.04051526,0.04462179,-0.0022587746,-0.05283573,0.06354707,-0.051423762,-0.03383442,-0.021180311,0.07400034,0.015618985,-0.002316329,0.004238301,0.022839008,-0.11932726,0.037379816,0.03811537,-0.04052065,-0.011806554,-0.0018264813,-0.013969229,-0.042052723,0.007196258,-0.067073174,0.09794715,-0.034502693,0.0050272834,-0.10025397,0.04624739,0.005873337,0.0854308,-0.034515776,-0.013950523,0.08017852,0.014082646,-0.07872624,-0.010484076,-0.05496393,-0.056737643,-0.033804595,-0.037906565,-0.035912596,-0.006378685,0.027549114,0.024599385,0.04865634,0.05986325,-0.042851105,-0.032159213,-0.024605786,0.0019175259,0.06507797,-0.12072064,-0.052118815,-0.010584286,-0.055046376,-0.004210803,-0.028625311,-0.036888734,0.010495276,-5.75287E-4,0.05434951,-0.030081421,-0.041535698,-0.09178781,-0.021415573,0.042035513,0.0074622026,-0.010409652,-0.0035657284,-0.0