for its action.\n8. Cooperation among districts\n(1) Two or more district councils may, in accordance with Article 178 of the Constitution—\n(a) cooperate in the areas of culture and development; and\n(b) for the purpose of the cooperation, form and support councils, trust funds or secretariats.\n(2) A local government council may concur with any other local government council in appointing a\njoint committee for any matter in which they have a common interest.\nPart III – Local government setup\n9. Local government councils\n(1) A council shall be the highest political authority within the area of jurisdiction of a local\ngovernment and shall have legislative and executive powers to be exercised in accordance with the\nConstitution and this Act.\n(2) A person shall not be a member of a local government council unless that person is a citizen of\nUganda.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 4','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.0057881316,-0.12349173,0.0018287988,-0.01615798,-0.105527975,-0.01912909,-0.038600493,-0.061472423,-0.02584354,0.0333198,0.060025346,-0.0713116,0.017058635,-0.015763832,0.03004342,-0.021609742,-0.012417701,-0.023785565,-0.07552371,-0.003032786,0.09526934,-0.041446537,-0.054991517,0.014031887,-0.03886844,-0.040343955,-0.02371175,-0.041657433,0.0190136,-0.040210854,0.0074205007,-0.05177225,0.10457639,0.021305112,2.3727085E-4,0.09320611,0.08121827,0.0027227402,0.0031776426,-0.013478587,-0.024112584,-0.004113316,-0.0355744,-0.057508357,-0.031376548,0.05851229,0.02477889,-0.024416367,-0.12905174,-0.0552385,0.038624424,0.044674538,0.009105253,0.0074341805,0.009185683,0.008143599,-0.004313113,-0.028589282,-0.036442734,-0.043732602,-0.053871807,0.06491861,-0.10179689,-0.03252383,0.015537819,-0.034303043,-0.005361805,-0.05974194,0.028497718,-0.076272875,0.03878099,-0.06279798,0.037852943,0.03332351,-0.059582043,-0.052789718,-0.033329405,0.08367426,0.09041101,-0.06