o be transmitted to the chairperson and the Minister.\n(6) The Minister shall evaluate the notice in consultation with the Attorney General and if satisfied that\nthere are sufficient grounds for doing so shall, within twenty-one days after receipt of the notice,\nconstitute a tribunal consisting of a judge of the High Court or a person qualified to be appointed a\njudge of the High Court, as chairperson and two other persons all of whom shall be appointed by the\nMinister in consultation with the Chief Justice, to investigate the allegations.\n(7)','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.017697329,0.056093678,0.04620329,-0.02279846,0.0014780189,0.017077817,0.014065553,-0.06565442,0.039829228,0.0805557,0.07349103,-0.004369113,0.014651112,-0.07333945,-0.017717512,-0.024524033,-0.029308809,-0.019599393,-0.03399756,0.07169592,0.0831714,0.03108979,-0.0030318117,0.039395034,-0.0024099706,-0.045691986,-0.06995386,-0.049946226,0.022248236,-0.041913178,0.0094179725,0.03800524,0.07317543,0.0051487773,-0.019074023,0.041335437,0.044643763,-0.027735522,0.052706506,-0.079884864,0.06470615,0.009803749,0.0098870825,-0.1278586,0.019352246,0.011988781,-0.030654164,0.014282015,-0.1026181,-0.045946084,-0.0036682345,-0.0790168,-0.01673611,0.033327885,-0.043063585,-0.051830534,0.0047548017,0.0075763366,0.032707892,0.037977144,0.017608078,0.044744786,-0.11981843,-0.0042640585,0.032323018,-0.08918495,0.05684665,-0.08821081,0.036323287,0.10443066,0.042631283,-0.08171013,0.007628932,-0.05672077,-0.10114584,0.023913661,0.014046256,0.02663024,0.04919847,-0.07714618,0.05338237,0.061960436,0.09547959,-0.060126305,0.025639864,-0.11932147,-0.04175252,-0.02010322,0.046921805,-0.048148483,0.080367714,0.038348094,0.058060903,0.0072978246,0.026160719,-0.055293325,0.0010400348,0.048132725,-0.011539471,0.07382828,-0.009569731,0.013543133,-0.112973146,-0.07661145,0.00209515,0.0017261185,0.041660648,-0.02785562,-0.017574647,-0.01108303,-0.