cretaries for the efficient performance of its functions.\n(2) The chairperson of a committee under this section and the members of the committee shall be\nelected by simple majority through secret ballot from the members of the council who are not\nmembers of the executive committee.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 11','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.042612635,7.036009E-4,0.0015536533,-0.027239611,-0.07993237,0.010574195,-0.022925742,-0.016506389,0.042908065,0.061566025,-0.03231948,-0.061719876,0.011247901,-0.056476638,-0.048091546,-0.035956506,0.058866613,0.046314064,-0.07781437,-0.0034433948,0.057731897,0.039041054,0.008062975,0.033836935,-0.055082858,-0.07433141,-0.055940486,-0.0715129,0.011743103,-0.04774848,0.071524255,-0.003988136,0.025280537,0.048268016,0.014836648,0.006451075,0.019395078,-0.005363341,0.080710836,-0.04503647,0.06481116,-0.017444884,-0.029356143,-0.10315903,0.027635258,0.04473593,0.047593165,0.08567842,-0.105699055,-0.015046586,0.018899385,-0.104053006,-0.011564006,0.0044128546,-0.022424722,-0.04839976,0.009922221,-0.072130755,0.019129446,0.044616226,0.020526955,-0.024637895,-0.10379467,0.020277796,0.048847843,-0.031437885,0.055749256,-0.08659238,0.0071442598,0.053928167,0.015633333,-0.018677799,0.036375802,0.01688942,-0.027560715,0.0026881024,-0.008214824,0.024026219,0.08222447,-0.08455887,0.016145773,0.03366889,0.060596745,-0.08745188,0.05012291,-0.0745531,0.03667155,0.035568573,-0.033614017,-0.028124655,0.037187967,0.016068367,0.030479703,0.02891021,-0.031895727,-0.017932177,0.0028098105,0.022918673,0.025272243,0.052463744,-0.064221166,0.0024573945,-0.0521371,-0.09049953,-0.06753609,-0.0049130833,0.03095118,-0.008388898,-0.0026837448,0.007266694,-0.11218313,-0.018555867,-0.013631764,0.0040958496,-0.023034194,0.006195227,-0.014647517,0.02151794,-0.040322915,-0.03016767,-0.02528512,-0.04922623,-0.031040184,-0.07847823,0.06711103,-0.025249204,0.04