ployed by the Government\nto provide services in the council’s area of jurisdiction and to monitor the provision\nof Government services or implementation of projects in the area under the council’s\njurisdiction;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 13','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.048484482,-0.00951006,0.070504405,-0.04163731,-0.08998514,0.027683094,-0.008958383,-0.040927432,0.019690167,-0.01533604,-0.033491503,-0.030324481,-0.013220439,-0.042930663,-0.031982493,-0.0251259,0.082748204,0.081339896,-0.015265404,-0.014731176,0.07599504,0.021037119,-0.09266745,0.002698828,0.021319589,-0.11326899,-0.11094843,-0.0094794575,0.003773656,-0.056234404,0.015687756,-0.035377186,0.077025115,-0.02041353,-0.040292405,0.04370292,0.04381975,-0.018455748,0.052884698,-0.009315401,-0.0055188905,0.004907371,-0.056955922,-0.067579895,-0.019191127,0.01603209,0.027848268,0.011726241,-0.12318033,-0.024755714,0.06424783,-7.3617656E-4,-3.9560342E-4,0.04204517,-0.010033946,-0.019293515,0.05050652,-0.009440745,0.05204826,0.024109436,-0.0717832,-0.0064493557,-0.12345708,0.024429524,0.008542785,-0.045319937,-0.025487045,-0.055881713,-0.015493975,-0.0028918285,-0.04473411,0.0012530513,0.072708406,-0.052467287,-0.04751848,-0.07531997,0.036411885,0.044709202,0.063350484,-0.06487606,0.03440555,0.091694675,0.017537337,-0.103637755,0.008504386,-0.077130295,-0.06771895,0.0025225028,-0.04871156,0.0077729956,0.031316362,0.01579141,0.04009559,0.021917159,0.041989975,-0.0030861252,0.002422434,0.031183433,0.075738624,0.09780994,-0.057786416,-0.034479775,-0.026239017,-0.06758285,-0.046033442,-0.019149724,-0.061301593,-0.056907073,0.0032307801,0.0031517022,-0.0549419,-0.008688883,-0.047610704,-0.0012927317,0.012716468,0.013701714,-0.03523549,0.020505685,-0.039995886,-0.028743502,-0.024823565,0.01866031,0.052743576,-0.06660714,0.08534794,0.034315232,0.030885132,8.855421E-34,0.011781207,0.020810343,-0.017383737,0.041