y\nParliament under any law.\n(2) Subject to the Constitution, the Government may, on request by a district council, assume\nresponsibility for the functions and services assigned to the district council, and in such a case the\nGovernment shall retain any grants pertaining to any task reverting to the Government.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 16','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.036149062,-0.0116296485,0.058977596,-0.052327733,-0.02981574,-0.026458032,0.0066940095,-0.103493825,-0.04468369,0.07473181,0.0023744078,-0.006553151,-0.050951075,4.3526813E-4,0.032261133,-0.029447505,0.033594754,-7.4474985E-4,-0.09162889,0.030142523,0.14382157,0.010672625,-0.020197626,0.036342278,-0.08010092,-0.023476593,-0.020035759,-0.039291687,-0.021303838,-0.09497773,0.03304591,-0.021389456,0.032332744,0.020385986,-0.02274788,0.084108576,0.08059023,-0.02365684,0.030373381,-0.047442365,0.031563193,-0.086198054,-0.04673214,-0.109578475,-0.032487053,0.021001473,0.052832883,-0.035581023,-0.13554917,-0.07987566,0.016732449,-0.053012136,-0.0030785426,0.034922644,-0.029277043,-0.047686223,-0.00554735,-0.0461926,0.04694956,0.030417956,-0.01413771,0.044089213,-0.14247565,-0.004105856,0.03995722,-0.053736806,0.018027624,-0.036724113,-0.009246515,-0.04668077,0.02629745,-0.07362698,0.09353986,-0.040347632,-0.03221507,-0.043734286,-0.001728623,0.0298367,0.07235885,-0.14735876,0.007372414,0.09392371,0.09041044,-0.016618086,0.00957737,-0.020232879,-0.039981056,0.022645673,0.1022106,-0.05061404,0.035778638,0.07374167,-0.007729832,0.016691264,0.009429964,-0.02903983,0.05142914,-0.06602678,0.054951973,0.0804293,-0.021893982,-0.049799222,-0.031822074,-0.016056564,-0.012736654,-0.022133518,0.008336175,-0.016607556,-0.025378844,0.07523092,-0.030195367,-0.004516489,-0.038010616,-0.002302398,0.033801783,-0.01666018,0.019336462,0.036712356,0.008821097,-0.0159159,-0.043638382,1.0406998E-4,0.021658503,-0.12752087,0.