tee referred to in subsection (3) shall coordinate all plans of lower\ncouncils and submit the integrated plans to their respective councils for consideration.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 18','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.019617952,0.009524739,0.023369564,-0.027987054,-0.07863943,-0.033417873,-0.06928603,0.05091292,-0.06224157,0.06755724,-0.02076968,-0.1116018,0.0138350595,-0.048443895,0.0023157594,-0.059294056,-0.02148351,-0.017805295,-0.046966046,-0.059755877,0.04536552,0.028902391,-0.015075937,-0.0022351607,-0.06074969,-0.018040562,0.0074329213,0.0021564646,0.02862101,0.034072723,0.029853046,0.026626369,0.07772684,0.010453167,0.011066172,0.055150226,0.0060163015,-0.009145545,0.055095237,-0.0032140824,0.01472364,-0.0044655516,-0.07973869,-0.014748397,0.023073893,0.0842994,0.04634138,-0.004352606,-0.15972212,-0.0438165,0.023385407,0.02854829,-0.02345157,0.0136768855,-0.0614049,-0.008844297,0.0072961277,-0.03049549,0.077416345,-0.022689402,-0.040432278,-0.0464353,-0.060497783,-0.05156673,0.053489946,-0.025284393,0.03795127,-0.0036662412,-0.039214443,-0.026155064,0.065126546,-0.13084897,-0.028231252,0.010687148,-0.015239095,-0.007844291,0.018424684,0.018071568,0.06580901,-0.11420351,0.034123763,0.1182864,0.046823036,-0.021388685,0.011471571,-0.0049532303,0.016273078,-0.023848418,0.01499498,-0.044944722,0.043549728,-0.031991545,0.03151215,-0.024787601,-0.03889768,0.042013403,-0.047830086,-0.0836935,0.043596566,0.0013440793,-0.072101004,-0.034160506,-0.018166335,-9.0237334E-4,-0.105459176,-0.019859023,0.024351517,0.048821487,0.056487177,-0.006009051,-0.06914487,-0.04451826,-0.01079131,-0.03774816,0.009960086,0.0054607834,-0.00607367,0.037119858,-0.02169519,-0.008444267,-0.0391938,-0.0714419,0.013498241,-0.040848136,0.07705107,-0.0010093489,-0.0024913303,1.185119E-33,-0.018052937,0.010010153,-0.042164054,0.011410436,-0.019432802,0.027784938,-0.0067569404,-0.009109394,0