rdinance made under section 40 may prescribe fees or charges equivalent to full cost recovery in\nrelation to any act done or to be done or service given under the ordinance and may require any act to be\ndone or performed to the satisfaction of a prescribed person or body.\n44. Scope of ordinance\n(1) An ordinance may be made to apply to the whole district or any part of a district or to a particular\nsection or profession of the people, and the power to make ordinances shall include power to\nregulate different matters in respect of different parts in the district.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 20','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.038708027,0.101258226,0.02304793,-0.04657179,0.0270954,0.0670596,0.05489707,-0.03981029,0.015582176,0.043648947,0.122382514,-0.100634255,0.04919223,-0.026807543,-0.0048580403,-0.043391474,0.030606348,0.048219793,-0.09761273,0.08539258,0.124242954,0.053278543,-0.049576383,0.10049701,-0.022839025,0.007371358,-0.055007014,-0.0073752585,0.05642113,-0.037967626,-0.037170738,-0.012571352,5.746673E-4,0.016207816,0.021575607,0.010077707,0.060374483,-0.05189074,-0.022875095,-0.019131564,-0.0026116108,0.0033390084,-0.070851065,-0.0042061266,-0.013857726,0.009592495,0.058567803,-0.008412247,-0.10303373,-0.00694187,0.013397816,0.053225823,-0.027197441,0.044271946,-0.022730289,-0.12499305,-0.003935627,0.03736793,-0.0470694,0.005861961,-0.0718392,0.077764496,-0.061754853,0.024348827,0.05619426,-0.058625676,-0.028606353,-0.028966533,-0.026592849,0.05541008,0.0057927133,-0.100967,0.0128248315,0.012478898,-0.06634348,-0.0015439831,0.0066287485,0.022084171,-0.0249106,-0.13195735,-0.022040067,0.013986661,0.06294969,-0.05518002,0.0051983544,-0.03374837,-0.07335999,0.006026739,0.08909916,-0.0033072357,0.06693905,-0.034099627,-7.8214554E-4,-0.06351924,0.11324798,0.0047624623,0.020162657,-0.068952,0.022913279,0.04218142,0.021424275,0.06127445,-0.08063527,-0.028060