unless that person—\n(a) is of high moral character and proven integrity;\n(b) has a working experience of not less than ten years in a responsible position;\n(c) is ordinarily resident in that district; and\n(d) has a minimum qualification of advanced level certificate or its equivalent and a diploma\nfrom a recognised institution.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 26','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.046837658,-0.047275294,-0.022605894,-0.047413316,-0.1769103,0.038243767,-0.06725212,-0.041712217,0.0073877578,-0.035131883,-0.0046842974,-0.10159886,0.027586564,-0.02414862,-0.0063115917,-0.03898866,0.13349156,0.015897611,0.0031800845,0.03189375,0.0141471345,-0.021816082,-0.05439552,-0.0072056255,-0.08359686,-0.041759294,-0.043547083,-0.037246246,-0.020391405,-0.04167687,-0.053756192,-0.07354034,0.087654546,0.02855898,0.09328843,0.07864553,0.05462216,0.03278454,0.097269304,0.047224693,-0.060454223,0.017870894,-0.0358457,-0.04693559,-0.025945738,-0.0038344252,0.021405434,-0.0052908845,-0.101598926,-0.010915313,-0.005063236,0.0067232926,-0.021008344,0.06962914,-0.013900322,-0.030199805,0.008949181,-0.03315751,7.136957E-4,0.020783782,-0.08252268,0.032462895,-0.07124729,-0.0051346193,0.035091918,-0.05811658,-0.052971978,-0.06270649,-0.004518338,-0.054492403,-0.036643706,-0.020119729,-0.028679835,0.012181613,-0.027309062,0.03448153,0.0013443227,0.016993443,0.10778097,-0.16586877,0.061656494,0.1063687,0.04667405,0.00285566,-0.010976182,-0.026210552,0.013734909,6.3149276E-4,0.009425144,0.0023133503,0.071005605,0.062064227,-0.029584132,-0.07121367,-0.036657322,0.0035009927,-0.025288166,0.034191158,0.06767425,9.7118353E-4,-0.025393412,-0.0042661037,-0.05587824,-0.030337691,-0.080340885,-0.016856749,-0.003859595,0.01679502,-0.024732588,-0.001643478,-8.013959E-4,-0.0032212883,-0.08292307,0.009830065,0.022653611,0.069200456,-0.021175278,0.020699117,-0.07113312,0.015663749,-0.01743271,0.0