 nuisance;\n(h) detect, apprehend and bring offenders to justice;\n(i) collect data and keep the records of the council;\n(j) assist the relevant council in planning, budgeting and budget implementation;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 31','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.022356333,-0.034175985,-0.008912839,-0.033340905,-0.0844582,-0.0037594796,0.0288788,-0.025813166,-0.043826733,0.06886921,0.014309,-0.09008338,-0.026699904,-0.05017966,-0.006026195,-0.0142674055,0.043626312,0.09026909,-0.0054196254,-0.02341506,0.08161749,-0.020631732,-0.08127501,0.02451578,-0.116946705,-0.031587347,-0.10773121,-0.029024074,-0.029377805,-0.09438985,-0.02882254,-0.1099635,0.10286503,0.030926745,-0.006952898,0.074553594,0.07349955,-0.06075765,0.028066844,0.031730678,0.002465064,-0.014924129,-0.026334329,-0.05963035,0.0030542116,0.032710407,0.013773369,2.006535E-4,-0.11460326,-0.04479964,0.04207952,-0.019399727,-0.024587197,0.035371684,-0.052725,-0.045596883,-0.03502714,-0.06486725,0.034128126,-0.009807789,-0.071859,0.056822993,-0.08946125,0.02785734,0.08953021,-0.07605526,-0.0074206847,-0.065934464,-0.009198069,-0.06642661,5.1213003E-4,-0.05129486,0.01788133,-0.003280968,-0.08911399,-0.017511433,-0.038116448,0.058729127,0.056978516,-0.124406986,0.09333527,0.1288311,0.0307214,0.020130467,0.0031449122,-0.004416325,-0.0028939252,-0.006892597,0.046115253,0.027484957,0.083743885,-0.008897379,0.0028424005,-0.005342905,0.010952914,0.018420782,0.007521985,-0.0015671237,0.022589494,0.022795793,-0.01748578,-0.050779916,-0.060517196,-0.0074085244,-0.030838002,0.02582902,-0.03018552,-0.030149238,0.007886991,-0.0047132717,-0.036955073,0.0028326057,-0.107597716,-0.051958147,0.056866348,0.047733802,-4.208219E-4,0.018933928,-0.029031344,-0.029746529,-0.06499509,0.0034205916,-0.020908678,-0.05192876,0.07005664,0.06198354,0.054502036,2.658351E-33,-0.037940506,0.027924888,0.017457498,0.039048415,0.014628026,0.