udget and work\nplan of the council.\n(8) The council may revise the development plan, where necessary, to harmonise it with the approved\nbudget.\n(9) The approved budget shall take effect on the first day of July in each year.\n81. Revenue and financial and accounting regulations\n(1) Local governments’ revenue generally shall be regulated as provided in Schedule 7 to this Act.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 33','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[0.010768412,0.03257868,-0.0027686944,0.027278028,-0.019942835,-0.017636053,-0.009648676,-0.0143193,-0.045707237,0.056047544,0.008750749,-0.08451533,-0.09625015,-0.04236552,-0.033352695,-0.015516205,0.017427227,0.02196964,0.025769943,0.01822854,0.100786366,0.0011714133,-0.0117886495,0.076716654,-0.024803802,0.013057201,-0.031058742,-0.0059653083,0.00293671,-0.02993627,0.013306594,-0.0028632649,0.06455658,-0.054959983,0.039414912,0.06387989,0.04796129,0.040826213,0.009602542,0.043444686,-0.073359974,0.019363776,-0.027898144,-0.051839866,-0.008787966,-0.026278306,0.050922316,0.023525704,-0.16197114,0.05196787,0.026560644,0.03783572,-0.0287745,-0.040400833,-0.03113375,0.012835388,0.0063301683,-0.052821554,-0.008638296,-0.044994123,-0.12755367,0.013405619,-0.11590374,-0.011546593,0.05744405,0.015376897,0.03209594,-0.022923898,0.007593729,-0.06541584,-0.019053493,-0.07580757,0.011058369,-0.079880156,-0.038876217,-0.00881676,0.006491299,0.14154671,0.060891036,-0.072346926,0.016785065,0.106876254,0.0133912405,-0.048116624,0.016846552,0.009920645,0.037396822,0.041582797,0.040059343,0.058374293,0.032391045,0.048695702,-0.022240765,5.864661E-4,-0.02409844,-0.0064087748,-0.006385138,-0.077122815,0.13086526,0.032126013,-0.012648806,-0.016817093,-0.0030558046,-0.02049272,-0.027269362,-0.0679332,0.025920393,-0.054476336,0.0140830325,-0.012929897,0.032978956,-0.018103553,-0.011779007,-0.066166714,0.024878759,0.03798497,-0.041746054,-0.0052049523,0