le for finance;\n(c) the Minister;\n(d) the local government or administrative unit to which the audit relates;\n(e) the local government public accounts committee;\n(f) the Local Government Finance Commission;\n(g) the Inspector General of Government; and\n(h) the Resident District Commissioner.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 36','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.0056269695,0.03113456,-0.028513009,0.034340393,-0.03013925,0.018414423,0.02003,-0.0777063,-0.0050339927,0.067948975,-0.024546007,-0.10677991,-0.031383805,-0.096369505,-0.108576365,-0.06702289,-0.075161286,0.02435917,0.018752672,0.05275281,0.040744048,-0.018162556,7.9645397E-4,-0.02507954,-0.058401216,-0.010512437,-0.055104848,-0.019234294,-0.0037722534,-0.05039013,0.0035650143,-0.06535584,0.068081245,0.004565427,0.026683217,0.012168586,0.0132842725,0.08463943,0.06181716,-0.028924469,0.028054675,-0.02322404,0.034450714,-0.086461976,-0.011515847,0.007778972,0.04896576,0.026548835,-0.08734949,0.045954432,-0.031759858,-0.027833056,-0.0065864823,-0.048793003,-0.02078187,-0.059479002,-0.008424884,-0.086837836,-0.004033544,-0.040462743,-0.039669305,0.085904635,-0.11281154,0.047462963,0.037196655,1.5068363E-4,0.02691953,0.036505263,0.0074687335,-0.023290731,-0.04271435,-0.13235876,-0.08040511,-0.051111914,-0.04941895,0.029036501,0.032328002,0.059987456,0.004569811,-0.05042906,7.607152E-4,0.086140774,0.06775953,-0.020323921,0.022697488,-0.011819863,0.0033241361,-0.037446894,-0.010411556,-0.016499436,0.0708705,0.03103026,0.07323025,-0.011670213,0.07129064,-0.06182283,0.0128569985,0.023017438,0.1176132,0.051128477,-0.0043348954,0.011725043,-0.014353802,0.043556146,-0.057045735,0.005610697,0.06345369,-9.70273E-5,-0.003067926,-0.01830486,-0.018987717,0.0434883,-0.051008467,-0.05181279,0.08132821,0.04959939,-0.056168564,0.013967201,-0.04322422,0.06498306,-0.018441042,0.008496146,0.009091889,-0.100284874,0.05265856,0.07406921,