s ceased to hold that office.\n(3) In accordance with section 71, the Town Clerk shall be the accounting officer in charge of a city,\nmunicipal or town council and shall be accountable to the respective council for funds of the\ncouncil.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 38','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.022230178,0.057211727,-0.022782095,0.020285396,-0.066926055,0.030616013,0.044452835,-0.07601634,-0.054691397,0.0878983,0.038093913,-0.14084096,-0.0324876,-0.097472034,-0.08123023,-0.06765473,-0.013876899,0.05375039,0.03906847,0.016779857,0.049512926,0.03047433,0.0065423967,-8.691435E-4,-0.04101672,-0.018387197,-0.064986266,-0.0059592635,-0.0011075493,-0.062262166,-0.0021358004,-0.10356343,0.052301094,-0.02054336,0.014914468,0.033290923,0.038655374,0.053329416,0.06272411,-0.013826843,0.03607195,-0.0044154273,-0.02816138,-0.12001235,-0.052537836,0.001696883,0.05963881,0.026335109,-0.12653351,-0.01934363,0.011509329,-0.016784865,0.004833353,0.01572517,-0.07033817,-0.033842985,0.017911805,-0.023477953,-0.003657296,-0.01625259,-0.042259447,0.025030093,-0.08093983,0.042336185,0.07220504,0.039876394,-0.0054753437,-0.02086865,-0.04517707,-0.041321896,0.008440329,-0.102419384,-0.03714823,-0.061352596,-0.01354261,0.02011177,-0.027202576,0.034429982,0.041709572,-0.026296759,0.049193773,0.08151005,0.059731875,-0.032083333,-0.014730149,-0.026034286,0.007832757,-0.044460684,0.059752937,-0.016525816,0.09117305,0.04125512,0.06489654,0.0018486262,0.034575205,-0.0475505,-0.017384646,0.03257886,0.05941288,0.03024319,-0.04488011,-0.0164703,-0.050739195,-0.035974298,-2.7738555E-4,-7.771239E-4,0.082694575,-0.039834507,-0.024853298,-0.0014831501,-0.020979473,0.002405788,-0.08518841,-0.02255308,0.11977077,0.041827653,-0.053631403,0.014571415,-0.07229701,-0.028212523,-0.019553818,-0.0013432058,-0.012387606,-0.073929034,0.05895795,0.026337903,0.04351864,9.387098E-36,0.00482787,0.071416095,-0.035