 term of the council is less than twelve months, the President\nshall continue to administer the district until the next elections are held.\n111. Financing of services during takeover period\n(1) During the period in which the President has taken over the administration of a district, the\ndecentralised services in the area of jurisdiction of that local government council shall be financed\nby direct appropriation from the national budget to a district vote held by the Chief Administrative\nOfficer.\n(2) The conditional grant shall, during the period under subsection (1), be utilised under the\nsupervision of the Permanent Secretary of the Ministry responsible for local governments.\nPart X – Local government councils elections\nElectoral Commission, returning officers and other election officers\n112. Electoral Commission to organise local council elections\nThe Electoral Commission shall organise, conduct and supervise election of the local councils.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 42','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.04667547,-0.010784168,0.047276538,-0.029786788,-0.06790164,-0.007985477,-0.052710038,0.0076341107,-0.016563186,0.09915303,0.032135215,-0.067714825,0.020771671,-0.052234866,0.009483002,-0.030833421,0.010101033,-0.01547967,-0.053190727,0.035278343,0.117897525,-0.021926695,-0.075987294,-0.009905407,-0.0019782747,0.0054718778,-0.039303005,-0.016157072,0.044262107,-0.039241835,0.03656287,-0.040497787,0.07519572,0.01366409,0.03784755,0.042347413,-0.013341802,-0.01728511,0.018538726,-0.016898856,0.016770765,-0.048419587,-0.06747265,-0.07953999,-0.010484313,0.040253427,0.05174975,0.07939269,-0.13641398,-0.011744441,0.03989026,0.023199953,-0.024085762,-0.0010615087,0.005638674,-0.033703104,-0.044599507,-0.07416154,-0.017992456,-2.6153369E-4,-0.041701965,0.076000884,-0.110063456,-0.004467062,0.03821421,-0.07538278,-0.0077963048,-0.0407881,0.008180765,-0.029292494,0