s a citizen of Uganda;\n(b) is ordinarily resident in that district or city;\n(c) is a registered voter;\n(d) has completed a minimum education of advanced level standard or its equivalent;\n(e) has submitted to the returning officer of a district or city, on or before the nomination day, a\ndocument, in this Act referred to as a nomination paper, in Form EC 1 specified in Schedule\n8 to this Act, which document shall be signed by two persons, nominating him or her as a\ncandidate;\n(f) attaches to his or her nomination paper, a list of the names of fifty registered voters from\neach of at least two-thirds of the electoral areas, and each voter shall have appended to that\nlist, his or her signature, physical address and voters registration number as specified in\nForm EC 1 of Schedule 8 to this Act.\n(4) For the purpo','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[0.012893984,-0.031052042,0.006409518,-0.03616357,-0.073855065,5.744277E-4,-0.04869565,-0.062291123,-0.0534162,0.07032715,0.014446798,-0.085842475,0.0076289764,-0.086337626,0.0044152834,-0.02426551,-0.034209274,0.022441689,-0.005603966,0.056068745,0.08593451,0.014777065,0.022231413,-0.0035850052,0.013464999,-0.06760687,-0.010497899,-0.0027021305,0.0300196,-0.029608782,0.06356654,0.009316208,0.071727395,0.009124558,0.026986487,0.04351751,2.769883E-4,0.006815822,0.054007865,-0.041783836,0.034769215,-0.06414596,-0.040018447,-0.10564209,0.037028495,0.051729742,0.025863655,0.024255784,-0.110270135,-0.04779943,0.06047019,-0.0014630766,-0.033396225,0.026966454,-2.36688E-4,-0.08082285,-0.051754765,-0.023695441,0.050762784,0.036169868,-0.037883144,0.029103734,-0.12069896,0.020180875,-0.01273944,-0.059224207,-3.0854417E-4,-0.06541465,0.021162217,-0.04656825,0.08448117,-0.024576845,0.0026572172,0.02887206,-0.025672669,-0.0614242,0.0052616345,0.059617948,0.08557854,0.009286619,-0.02416045,0.09475091,0.052322105,0.0031309074,0.09798855,-0.036008578,-0.08978785,0.