\nreturning officer shall ensure that campaign meetings by different candidates do not coincide.\n(3) The returning officer shall forward a copy of every campaign programme submitted under\nsubsection (2) to the Electoral Commission.\n(4) The returning officer may, after consultation with all the candidates, organise one or more joint\ncandidates’ campaign meetings for those candidates who consent to hold such meetings.\n(5) A candidate or a candidate’s agent authorised in writing by the candidate to do so, may hold\nconsultative meetings with the candidate’s campaign agents for the purposes of planning and\norganising the candidate’s election campaign.\n(6) A candidate shall not hold any public campaign meeting under subsection (1) except in accordance\nwith the programme submitted by the candidate to the returning officer under subsection (2).\n(7) A candidate’s agent may conduct campaign meetings on behalf of the candidate and otherwise\nconduct any campaign which the candidate is allowed to hold under this Act.\n(8) A person who contravenes','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.009796112,0.0015702693,0.019337121,-0.039044257,0.012919541,0.03220168,0.004210755,-0.059459254,-0.02172635,0.037863147,-9.757348E-4,0.0071533793,-0.033846702,-0.0991732,0.039613437,-0.02795883,0.003180773,0.0371259,0.0177593,0.08336644,0.052143726,0.02227016,0.025741303,0.047689162,0.018002931,-0.041386392,0.02147145,-0.03481991,-0.0011229636,-0.044866152,0.068546265,0.024627442,0.029255567,0.012243083,0.08195173,0.048188675,0.011340023,-0.015258193,0.030928547,-0.058927853,0.022124562,-0.07747421,-0.03629664,-0.10879377,0.0027511008,-0.0112476265,0.018970171,0.047634758,-0.05595583,0.0034549537,-0.0241479,-0.022544557,-0.031089883,-0.039694607,0.058767643,-0.012193849,-0.0016335974,-0.029306058,0.021683393,0.039866805,-0.0087289205,0.022905735,-0.19041334,0.022780297,-0.052611034,0.0034181199,0.0042510666,-0.057256937,