sistance of polling assistants proceed to count the votes separating the votes polled by each\ncandidate.\n146. Interruption and postponement of counting, tallying or recounting\n(1) Where counting, tallying or recounting of votes is interrupted by a riot or violence or any other\nreasonab','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.022698313,0.002569866,0.018243402,-0.016080964,-0.014079175,0.050112262,0.032218605,-0.077645294,0.012434823,0.08183,0.07614324,0.021809952,0.024687808,-0.07312934,-0.022806438,-0.03332308,0.0140352715,-0.05911282,-0.055237837,0.03594363,0.11223898,-0.0025609173,0.04811987,0.018531818,0.0015944393,-0.04280263,0.018125337,-0.03624656,0.058834158,-0.059570104,0.026148157,-0.0023552699,0.026777552,-9.0373866E-4,-0.010892886,-0.034098692,0.10678542,-0.07052803,0.04404284,-0.04694901,0.08924355,-0.07654847,-0.0015073335,-0.095786795,-3.8757085E-4,0.015899733,0.017783822,0.021170216,-0.08452948,-0.04545445,-0.0077028903,0.027659781,-0.030743495,0.06749989,0.033958286,-0.07263315,-0.0020653068,-0.06388849,0.036060646,0.05714875,-0.028473523,0.049168725,-0.12144279,-0.026995305,-0.03836776,-0.03265544,-0.03306359,-0.056617707,0.057825156,0.03653711,0.04175291,-0.0024671739,0.08280308,-0.050155144,-0.065206304,0.011931743,-0.04458911,0.023878682,0.03182951,-0.038815133,-0.0127949305,-0.002399084,0.07934377,-0.050174773,0.11831337,-0.07632735,-0.03851926,0.009622738,0.044190537,-0.036204334,-0.012401809,0.05754843,0.028344085,0.07210801,0.042736545,-0.018549899,0.07094744,0.05326264,0.024278272,0.06256182,-0.0413173,-0.0067061232,-0.08237613,0.0112035675,0.013709886,-0.029196747,-0.02658206,-0.04063463,-0.014425124,-0.010148417,0.014317175,-0.028957779,0.022533694,0.05919783,0.03999152,-0.024739303,-0.021466607,0.04941692,-0.019818861,0.03492098,-0.0153507795,0.004901313,0.020234356,-0.09515035,0.06911591,-0.009767003,0.044700805,2.7634098E-33,-0.0011118342,-0.019881021,-0.08724852,0.0