n may petition the High Court for an order that a candidate\ndeclared elected as chairperson of a local government council was not validly elected.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 57','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.044708654,0.07184323,-0.026578184,-0.0042746086,-0.027985044,0.02866323,0.014616949,-0.024681563,-0.010502795,0.09221025,0.014856255,-0.050655633,0.033061,-0.06422988,-0.02957115,-0.010045118,0.038793985,0.10032468,-0.023937548,0.015761351,0.08132333,0.032700896,-0.019076774,0.038926132,-0.04327209,-0.07679598,-0.022030989,-0.020830946,-0.027372863,-0.017419169,-0.008904208,-0.0649161,0.035181876,0.021622168,0.050481442,-0.013730405,-0.03445472,-0.023500297,0.028811553,-0.08298898,0.104423195,-0.07595776,-0.03348693,-0.039442983,0.010586699,0.010821256,0.04086975,0.07764711,-0.089929864,-0.022767242,-0.03912771,-0.02119339,-0.033717785,-0.08562967,0.00883188,-0.09665749,0.0041501406,-0.06372889,-0.009445015,-0.03434452,-0.004722787,0.011131118,-0.12275036,0.008523104,0.011779189,0.038681004,0.035296597,-0.08002636,0.053718287,0.014507767,0.02250108,-0.023773288,0.019142017,0.016389709,-0.043576088,-0.0051124087,-0.053762987,0.10518014,0.0430081,-0.039484292,-0.03884913,0.00519583,0.006685583,-0.026655808,0.08373341,-0.06391692,0.035972968,0.026031392,-0.0020151474,-0.028717084,0.004920259,0.07297648,0.03815827,0.066896446,-0.029548982,-0.041159313,0.013848097,0.0066903546,0.13497423,0.062455483,-0.08079311,-0.023609359,-0.061401587,-0.035675183,-0.041941036,-0.009471497,-0.04845899,-0.079844445,-0.0022176125,-0.0023201203,-0.078595616,-0.004618842,-0.027939416,-3.6971684E-4,0.027659012,-0.0016768065,-0.05082169,0.07526056,-0.04813733,0.059703678,-0.03339094,-0.04357665,-0.012793845,-0.07510692,0.1319148,-0.019309603,0.074707285,1.7173315E-33,-0.013098705,0.040359184,-0.0024936625,0.10329213,-0.049109735,0.114387654,0.0080456585,-0.033947565,0.046414588,-0.006