mission shall arrange a fresh election in the relevant constituency in accordance\nwith section 132.\n155. Witness in election petition\n(1) In the hearing of a petition, the powers of the court and the rules of procedure shall be those, which\napply to a civil action in a court of law.\n(2) A witness who, in the course of the hearing of an election petition, wilfully makes a statement of\nfact m','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[-0.06807644,0.039032202,0.049449887,-0.089004576,-0.06650798,-7.697621E-5,0.040884398,0.016122907,-0.010633793,0.116811626,0.04011259,-0.036495145,0.014019315,-0.06744238,-0.020897025,-0.0051531587,-0.024262426,0.044277523,-0.03997235,0.020578776,0.116787314,0.048941955,-0.040617302,0.01960436,0.034782473,-0.05455451,-0.01341907,-0.0023465222,0.023459062,-0.09020493,0.028791273,-0.016146187,0.037821945,-0.010964093,0.006082009,-0.0037243303,0.05921717,-0.06968921,0.010324593,-0.11466438,0.052982476,-0.04884686,-0.01983681,-0.12399358,0.029711094,-0.015791338,0.03358884,0.03888268,-0.115628235,-0.012781287,-0.0084663555,-0.013929159,-0.020755867,0.05426221,-0.011351017,-0.046721786,-0.028037079,-0.041372124,0.034854587,-7.754029E-5,-0.03891085,0.028361471,-0.12440583,0.017724793,-0.018450059,-0.039300267,0.02437585,-0.13615894,-0.014910956,-0.022209447,0.048267387,-0.05274971,0.040011335,-0.022137858,-0.073741294,-0.0751234,0.010530059,0.099907465,0.021389583,-0.0016879623,-0.02950059,0.04609318,0.051930755,-0.028659051,0.09541841,-0.06566921,-0.06475973,0.029300928,0.05875274,-0.024673438,0.008504226,0.060801968,0.08403881,0.08177447,0.0581563,-0.038241718,0.075099885,0.03124707,0.0964228,0.10644336,-0.096302554,-0.03293092,-0.13674441,-0.025560398,0.017791588,0.03302773,-0.023018897,-0.04068766,0.016013661,-0.0363876,-0.055445433,-0.046559233,0.01182647,0.039518032,0.049607724,-0.02419586,-0.06331875,0.06513058,-0.04426164,-0.025473502,-0.04870714,-0.012505806,-0.0228725