airperson of lower local government council\n6. Vacation of office of member of executive committee\n7. Revocation of mandate of councillor\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 68','d5ed76b2c20abce6aae90ab1f60a0b2aec7f61ac23034fa0bef2b148f1621160','Local Governments Act','General','[0.006230313,0.014002623,0.031701356,-0.029336734,-0.087767325,-0.01991806,-0.017928101,-0.05856063,-0.021554835,0.06927807,0.045392733,-0.04491189,-0.018246798,-0.0101455245,0.040745582,-0.042933498,-0.020708462,-0.048926506,-0.061369736,0.074012846,0.14322571,-0.0026618221,-0.029474875,0.026372736,0.015902242,0.0034719554,-0.05606741,-0.012619713,0.03635942,-0.05056949,0.05507057,-0.017211303,0.022195108,0.004049008,0.03742897,0.05241313,0.08236308,-0.004806566,0.03407862,-0.06119832,0.053989045,-0.08268864,-0.012017153,-0.10078404,0.017730318,0.041825812,0.08474112,0.045795728,-0.07977331,-0.05135559,0.05492344,-0.011510723,-0.006291798,0.05382748,-0.024856616,-0.025771894,8.112664E-4,-0.0034610657,0.034784954,0.007341326,-0.02799567,0.10382633,-0.1257056,-0.024991479,0.059656247,-0.07568801,0.03252638,-0.057498626,-0.011096981,0.0074978704,0.033493657,-0.089401096,0.06347524,0.019188983,-0.056235276,-0.023155877,0.023572002,0.06535421,0.0045985198,-0.06657365,-0.04148987,0.036597457,0.11338646,-0.023501879,0.044218417,-0.084714584,-0.014162695,0.01671615,0.08670709,-0.05868201,0.025624039,0.085595906,0.053926416,0.028080251,0.061678715,-0.01253945,0.051366203,-0.009223581,0.054105017,0.079964794,-0.013865563,7.8373094E-4,-0.027786467,-0.019981986,0.048001416,-0.01858086,0.007942878,-0.021529412,-0.014704316,0.0146340225,0.02906563,-0.017065171,-0.02814085,-0.011507059,0.033165857,0.041919615,-0.034402117,-0.008411946,0.014915524,-2.4033923E-4,-0.025941541,-0.0035151748,-0.04066016,-0.09107623,0.018827332,0.045619052,-0.0027940548,5.5502463E-34,-0.067657046,-0.013277381,-0.039466336,-0.027366633,-0.014173702,0.020652158,-0.0290772,0.087241694,0.014946747,-0.04102559,0