er this section may appeal to the High\nCourt.\n23. Discharge of person informed against\n(1) If, on an inquiry under section 21, it is not proved that it is necessary for keeping the peace or\nmaintaining good behaviour, as the case may be, that the person in respect of whom the inquiry is\nmade should execute a bond, the magistrate shall make an entry on the record to that effect, and,\nif that person is in custody only for the purposes of the inqui','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.04728286,0.1000914,-0.03178435,-0.08550756,-0.070555545,0.02212718,0.0732427,-0.043941442,0.007904729,0.095587514,0.08767668,-0.012480544,0.027624458,-0.018950317,0.004416976,-0.014950246,0.036875453,-0.022384182,-0.08493353,0.10631747,0.030238545,-0.010982389,0.059335418,-0.039376274,-0.11878263,0.027486542,-5.445699E-4,-0.0918088,0.0687567,-0.028802877,0.07294451,0.05062764,0.04928553,0.017871479,0.002730279,-0.0020663417,0.026788054,-0.044183817,0.013287075,-0.06987778,-0.023852555,-0.018047528,0.028146679,-0.14219709,-0.0039027524,-0.048302144,0.041888654,0.013706681,-0.06774157,-0.061133288,-0.058157902,-0.02855983,-0.018259559,0.036457747,-0.04305581,-0.042731717,0.01848255,0.010337531,-0.004768557,0.07084862,0.01890448,0.0322504,-0.11017782,0.03262381,-1.8365175E-4,-0.03697147,0.08751692,-8.015882E-4,0.032585658,0.04347638,0.025956478,-0.02150734,0.02481831,-0.032235112,-0.048856355,0.0129864765,-0.022789098,-0.06196506,-0.018143142,-0.081095144,-0.021669889,-0.013179371,0.11122723,-0.028105795,0.031306133,-0.104585126,-0.008564044,-0.016820632,0.06794638,-0.043038856,0.03297586,0.01207908,-0.023768898,0.014737758,0.04020065,0.009376715,0.033981826,0.019942028,-0.016307076,0.073729716,0.05093932,-0.002163249,-0.061191563,0.019508803,0.05254027,0.00776211,0.00841709,-0.09132545,0.03526407,0.010705406,-0.021120975,0.07692216,6.3097023E-4,0.03609889,0.017656922,-0.0501001,-0.011448427,0.07804226,0.02431762,-0