 act either on the report of the lower court or on the application of a party\ninterested or on its own initiative.\n(3) Every application for the exercise of the power conferred by this section shall be made by motion,\nwhich shall, except when the applicant is the Director of Public Prosecutions, be supported by\naffidavit.\n(4) Every accused person making any such application shall give to the Director of Public Prosecutions\nnotice in writing of the application, together with a copy of the grounds on which it is made; and no\norder shall be made on the merits of the application unless at least twenty-four hours have elapsed\nbetween the giving of the n','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-7.677238E-4,4.1349045E-5,0.008638291,-0.0759795,-0.032061294,-0.01253782,0.018867621,-0.010808835,0.012544286,0.108213656,0.04291288,0.008707184,0.019483253,-0.05388289,0.044771977,-0.044455737,0.056007933,-0.04655351,-0.08453621,0.10008809,0.066168554,-0.021294357,-0.0067184437,-0.041056927,-0.108965866,-0.04182813,-0.04538566,-0.014802341,0.028764261,-0.084797874,-0.030294111,0.07585679,9.6601533E-4,0.023126345,-0.021398747,-0.00192475,0.063413344,-0.05159191,0.053456035,-0.07041633,0.030176455,-0.0012590082,0.056832787,-0.09839325,-0.012467238,-0.016588977,0.042781692,0.011090045,-0.10844004,-0.064785406,-0.11826356,-0.050780103,-0.007012333,0.0643087,-0.0629903,-0.0035452775,0.029671488,0.0047758836,0.079511136,0.0029931345,-0.04456263,0.020441929,-0.04207105,0.006096568,0.036907066,-0.12814908,0.047531076,-0.009940135,-0.005774693,0.017737046,0.054023053,-0.034013495,-0.003967229,0.011240908,-0.06737167,-0.045114465,-0.020174956,-0.019890727,0.002842492,-0.023813453,0.010493714,0.010516445,0.059029695,-0.068567865,0.05201203,-0.11389784,-0.06570007,-0.0119166365,0.095217414,-0.061506785,0.032910936,-0.0034120104,0.009756934,0.03677329,0.09068774,-0.0048558367,0.07794562,-0.024970053,0.07756335,0.07256134,