rom custody.\n77. Considerations for bail\n(1) Where any person appears before a magistrate’s court charged with an offence for which bail may be\ngranted, the court shall inform the person of his or her right to apply for bail.\n(2) When an application for bail is made, the court shall have regard to the following matters in\ndeciding whether bail should be granted or refused—\n(a) the nature of the accusation;\n(b) the gravity of the offence charged and the severity of th','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.07747336,0.03472526,-0.023506328,-0.066017166,0.00797826,0.047057237,0.025300702,-0.025392279,0.011339477,0.10404071,0.16971514,0.02298225,-0.015448172,-0.019329727,0.020767521,-0.050162457,0.04956976,-0.036977585,-0.04429362,0.081371054,0.10191719,0.005686968,-0.002621389,-0.04850445,-0.0341912,0.010362381,-0.040633727,-0.054557838,0.07531704,0.008231842,-0.01606423,0.052516192,0.01814222,-0.03177907,0.017848613,0.049723297,0.026521554,-0.050766535,-0.003164535,-0.0050046016,0.032378573,0.0063200556,-0.01035231,-0.014994563,0.05056106,-0.022219175,-0.010496429,0.052950643,-0.06341197,-0.060940947,-0.022056825,-0.019067427,-0.016982006,0.079956494,-0.037173107,-0.01956222,-1.7233122E-4,0.0033409982,0.005377743,0.01605573,-0.032431796,0.055319015,-0.051680543,-0.005416664,-0.02461925,-0.05952831,0.029496666,-0.016305158,0.063859545,0.08702035,0.032539863,0.003443672,-0.030238386,0.005350102,-0.09191539,0.018052692,0.016012229,0.02036836,-0.017272448,-0.06469602,0.013410755,-0.04061005,0.051790427,-0.090519086,0.02665544,-0.1266765,-0.059128754,-0.038468976,0.08456643,-0.030014677,0.105986066,0.037806515,-0.033788756,0.0073261443,-0.025794858,-0.0076345103,-0.020059496,0.047010027,-0.02802218,0.07307637,0.022469686,-0.008584227,-0.11299953,0.020303851,0.054768443,-0.070133045,0.022989905,0.016696682,-0.036448628,0.018191693,0.019226415,0.042303763,0.07049572,-0.04393462,0.011512753,0.01825297