6,-0.044847492,-0.025748463,-0.021097146,0.0039439397,0.06106847,-0.025290968,0.037149303,0.022120275,0.033321157,-0.09676028,-0.011483884,0.057741314,0.037329063,0.04469921,-0.05677804]','','2026-08-29 13:12:01.371271','Schedule 1 (Sections 1, 227(1)) ................................................','Magistrates Courts Act.pdf',33,'Magistrates Courts Act.pdf','3ca9da8361aaa26e122ac6fa75cd8b8473ba3414f97b450f28790610e42ca0c0','',185),(1139,88,'(3) shall be prima facie evidence of all facts set forth in the\ncertificate without proof that the officer purporting to sign the certificate did in fact sign it and was\nempowered so to do.\nPart XII – Witnesses and evidence\n94. Summons for witness\n(1) If it is made to appear that material evidence can be given by or is in the possession of any person, a\nmagistrate’s court having cognisance of any criminal cause or matter may issue a summons to that\nperson requiring his or her attendance before the court or requiring him or her to bring and produce\nto the court for the purpose of evidence all documents, writings or things in his or her possession or\npower which may be specified or otherwise sufficiently described in the summons.\n(2) Any exhibit produced before a court may be retained by the court until thirty days after the\nconclusion of the trial at which it was produced, and in the event of an appeal for such further\nperiod as the court to which the appeal is made shall direct.\n(3) Nothing in this section shall be deemed to affect the provisions of section 122 or 123 of the\nEvidence Act.\n95. Warrant for witness who disobeys summons\nIf, without sufficient excuse, a witness does not appear in obedience to the summons, the court, on proof\nof the proper service of the summons, a reasonable time before, may issue a warrant to bring the witness\nbefore the court at such time and place as shall be specified in the warrant.\n96. Warrant for witness in first instance\nIf the court is satisfied by evidence on oath that such person will not attend unless compelled to do so,\nit may at once issue a warrant for the arrest and production of the witness before the court at a time and\nplace to be specified in the warrant.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 24','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.12760407,0.10809204,0.06457231,-0.04224212,0.014202994,0.036787506,0.024325961,0.01564545,0.03695017,0.019214654,0.05285541,-0.07262981,0.02253151,-0.023302255,-0.022012843,-0.0018678572,0.09039168,-0.018359134,0.0051559093,0.046311058,0.06630932,-0.06286509,-0.055575814,-0.004287047,-0.0066020563,0.017778879,-0.04760391,-0.04667927,0.09610614,-0.04203434,-0.011994975,0.060116194,-0.024090422,-0.053025763,0.023800852,0.054337915,0.096401505,-0.07456667,0.05350743,-0.065652855,0.017342566,-0.020555235,0.009577338,0.0345935,0.012442112,0.071016446,0.058179498,0.0692683,-0.084403925,-0.006071013,-0.09445411,-0.02695761,-0.019379565,-0.009895073,-0.066563234,-0.025538135,0.07615393,-0.012300068,0.01929028,0.009822266,-0.010937195,0.028715331,-0.032147963,0.020066692,-0.025687916,0.04880587,0.019014308,-0.034535278,0.08547307,0.04072528,0.0787612,0.05722539,0.0138738975,0.028664052,-0.066211715,-0.024371687,-0.05062332,-0.0687779,-0.018778645,-0.098465234,-0.011676791,0.042595904,-0.036964074,-0.05471024,-0.030597845,-0.0977204,-0.031677343,0.013295582,-0.012914541,0.030047093,0.09425687,-0.026595512,-0.06481695,-0.022413533,0.060423333,-0.009046785,-0.006236947,0.028564977,0.07604835,0.023821618,0.0059603355,0.11504819,-0.007370711,0.050490268,0.012988788,-0.0139086675,-0.0443559,-0.12619685,0.013297614,0.033530127,-0.01137414,0.026481098,-0.0173302,-0.03601906,0.01587919,0.052388202,0.016747909,0.021762999,-0.072617754,-0.0695825,0.029344892,0.052124023,0.019949717,0.018118752,0.022987576,-0.040174007,0.033746246,3.300905E-33,0.046708956,-0.009932935,-0.052466635,-0.020692987,0.029601464,0.056999538,0.0418