e convicted\nof that offence although he or she was not charged with it.\n(2) When a person is charged with killing an unborn child and the court is of opinion that he or she is\nnot guilty of that offence but that he or she is guilty of an offence under section 133 or 134 of the\nPenal Code Act, he or she may be convicted of that offence although he or she was not charged with\nit.\n(3) When a person is charged with infanticide or with killing an unborn child and the court is of\nopinion that he or she is not guilty of any of the offences, and, if it appears in evidence that the\nchild had recently been bo','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.009497759,0.025420688,-0.09643972,-0.008660415,0.07229821,0.043863818,0.118281454,0.075968765,-0.043171044,0.045900054,0.16834062,-0.070190035,0.024358729,0.025813755,-0.07864993,-0.01510518,0.03883249,0.055326533,-0.05742638,0.07504333,0.0375325,-0.0024271805,0.031027077,-0.028777154,0.01838302,-7.2430115E-4,-0.06373074,-0.032275427,-0.013206442,0.0046445904,0.015188956,0.0016008925,0.017695015,-0.0010390255,0.04837775,-0.007076193,0.06763178,-0.019528542,-0.045431253,0.012404692,0.014166086,1.3887075E-4,-0.024324099,-0.030664671,0.0065228664,-0.09829103,-0.096055076,0.0143615175,-0.049767945,-0.07623557,-0.041192953,-0.03243599,-0.031835884,0.024095928,-0.050486036,-0.07317198,-0.038964294,0.05536824,-0.018410118,0.005588203,-0.01597223,0.0278772,0.07084144,-0.05027003,0.032459658,0.018754838,-0.0010961207,-0.09097645,0.039035767,0.058982123,0.030887218,-0.022075102,-0.0650565,0.01593336,-0.059806123,0.057401516,9.144259E-4,0.053267725,0.005254499,-0.01025805,-0.04902469,-4.4867044E-4,0.021323392,-0.07644001,0.037663057,-0.08369957,-0.077242695,-0.017599156,0.031018179,0.01229013,0.056844063,-0.028501667,0.048307467,-0.015921285,0.088712126,-0.024734596,-0.061813656,-0.021189373,-0.026415395,-0.010587234,-0.07076608,0.06367114,-0.06814015,0.06821598,0.060