Act\nWhen a person is charged with rape and the court is of opinion that he is not guilty of that offence, but\nthat he commits an offence under one of section 118, 119, 124 or 141 of the Penal Code Act, he may be\nconvicted of that offence although he was not charged with it.\n151. Person charged with incest may be convicted of unlawful carnal knowledge\nWhen a person is charged with an offence under section 138 of the Penal Code Act and the court is of\nopinion that he is not guilty of that offence, but that he committed an offence under section 116 or 119 of\nthe Penal Code Act, he may be convicted of that offence although he was not charged with it.\n152. Person charged with defilement of a girl under eighteen years of age may be convicted\nof an offence under section 115 or 121 of the Penal Code Act\nWhen a person is charged with the defilement of a girl under the age of eighteen years and the court is of\nopinion that he is not guilty of that offence, but that he committed an offence under section 115 or 121 of\nthe Penal Code Act, he may be convicted of that offence al','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[0.012020076,0.028679399,-0.08610215,-0.03797027,0.029200329,0.026348509,0.066065855,0.019916687,-0.057143144,0.080287755,0.116117954,-0.09571846,0.05443501,0.002541862,0.021159742,-0.07298398,-0.0047250423,-0.06032877,-0.069313206,0.078758165,0.06181089,0.026255028,0.09389566,-0.031411853,-0.028413236,8.571308E-5,-0.016398173,0.01586563,-0.025106123,-0.019608691,-0.017573945,0.019720394,-0.009680588,0.0071310885,-0.05827126,-0.021209989,0.02230737,-0.019264989,0.052016836,-0.045285303,0.09269985,-0.012126024,-0.036373105,-0.0871737,0.03623533,-0.0025735183,-0.07757845,0.01565262,-0.035232183,-0.11327576,-0.059497252,-0.025573108,0.055309482,0.07052704,-0.024999134,-0.11369086,-0.05953629,0.018249588,0.036198117,-0.010910829,-0.0080653615,0.08228911,-0.03032453,-0.01911695,0.007298019,-0.0707