e\noffender on bail or remand him or her in custody as he or she thinks fit.\n[subsection (1) amended by section 16 of Act 6 of 2026]\n(2) Where a court presided over by a chief magistrate convicts a person of any offence and on obtaining\ninformation about his or her character and antecedents the court is of the opinion that they are\nsuch that greater punishment should be inflicted for the offence than the court has power to inflict,\nthe court may, instead of dealing with him or her in any other manner, commit him or her in\ncustody to the High Court for sentence.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 42','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.02360417,0.07623512,-0.018509619,-0.06390156,0.0024201358,0.07723137,0.028202305,-0.038877353,0.01838507,0.053615242,0.13667011,-0.0029976,0.056430656,-0.06809455,-0.036687635,-0.06644842,0.030254059,0.044729553,-0.0023300622,0.038267355,0.08127191,0.011854873,0.008753921,-0.008138205,-0.092523135,0.01514595,-0.07848,-0.10712249,-0.0071677915,-0.028459312,-0.009434512,0.03157591,0.03712286,0.04809344,-0.066353224,-0.012179445,0.036329165,0.008598125,-0.017315423,-0.050326508,0.01663402,0.029082581,0.05380232,-0.026960516,0.036173947,-0.07867142,-0.01607275,-0.009555866,-0.07611115,-0.098570675,-0.06471621,0.0121624535,0.05625636,0.12786093,-0.06670104,0.023497611,0.03645155,-0.030854125,-0.019781632,-0.0082226675,-0.055646885,0.06504331,-0.056823965,-0.024365745,-0.025086576,-0.027953194,0.0024038479,-0.0038180074,0.09068325,0.087111935,0.010480434,-0.055555988,-0.031622704,-0.049926005,-0.07935907,0.023404239,-0.012411786,0.039209764,0.03282251,-0.017716566,0.04156895,-0.018554049,0.03165501,-0.09713792,-0.044006012,-0.100930326,0.0010040379,-0.018130012,0.036774233,-0.0447387,0.04601082,-0.04624318,0.042756088,-0.057994973,0.019725857,-0.040029686,-0.0070081013,0.025351753,0.016900452,0.051646687,0.07093598,0.074872956,-0.047334697,0.0089