upon the officer shall cease to execute the warrant.\n(4) A warrant under this section may be executed within the local limits of the jurisdiction of the court\nissuing it, and it shall authorise the distress and sale of any property belonging to such person\nwithout those limits when endorsed by a magistrate, within the local limits of whose jurisdiction\nthe property was found.\n182. Commitment\nIf the officer having the execution of a warrant of distress reports that he or she could find no property\nor no sufficient property on which to levy the money mentioned in the warrant with expenses, the court\nmay issue such process as may be necessary for the appearance of the person against whom the order for\npayment was made and sentence him or her to imprisonment according to the scale prescribed by section\n179.\n183. Payment in full after commitment\nA person committed for non','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.13468327,0.06995448,-0.0034373335,-0.02292182,-0.014655603,0.019539552,0.06141013,0.029672628,0.0057812748,0.049480945,0.096446715,0.012725156,0.04105565,-0.01578038,0.009018028,-0.037071023,0.044113073,0.0110014025,-0.06547279,0.06641426,0.101768106,0.017445235,-0.03610973,0.014822776,0.016245568,-0.023609666,0.024675326,-0.03777311,0.05117939,0.012737444,0.045249294,-0.0051695667,-0.02514883,-0.013783515,0.015222739,-0.0056981286,0.08150015,-0.12684377,-0.021211706,-0.06826795,4.8449478E-4,-0.021123912,-0.015804064,-0.06314575,0.014467627,-0.018040713,0.05943875,0.06891223,-0.007578295,-0.056247145,-0.0036143267,-0.05648801,-0.032424778,0.07399296,-0.05568913,-0.029361304,0.014721474,-0.046877895,-0.004273242,0.0012738098,0.0038139217,0.049389392,-1.332991E-4,0.03728062,0.025605485,-0.03788683,-0.026431862,0.011691815,0.038092572,0.038634952,0.10542463,-0.030658865,-0.04611074,-0.0017231588,-0.09112541,0.014942127,0.02758627,-0.08669674,-0.08161642,-0.09029801,-0.021003768,-0.0256589