 on account of or in trust\nfor some other person or partly on his or her own account and partly on account of some other\nperson, the court shall make an order releasing the property, wholly or to such extent as it thinks\nfit, from attachment.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 49','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.076631226,0.14766856,-0.06465286,0.0029487498,0.015445162,-0.01511868,0.08422644,-0.0448065,0.08414199,0.09427717,0.07948169,-0.0014370936,0.05255813,-0.059342295,-0.06009248,0.025010908,-0.019193761,0.032902453,-0.06568951,0.056031197,0.055357162,0.007565948,0.014340159,-0.012094021,-0.022463389,0.019285448,0.019345371,0.008933969,0.04080685,-0.069783844,0.08531117,0.036116775,-0.04231558,-0.01749726,-0.040073857,0.013479533,-0.040715672,0.014417776,-0.012397991,-0.018738354,0.07190895,-0.012294501,0.116748296,-0.11792595,-0.004243302,0.05335723,0.069774546,0.10679359,-0.069803685,-0.032286614,-0.012770349,-0.013468334,-0.062277116,0.090031415,-0.07471704,-0.00123545,0.07668434,-0.06380747,-0.012264832,0.0010106263,0.043500926,0.02923492,-0.06216136,0.0015543606,0.04111097,0.029664993,0.049040604,0.025378462,-0.054486938,-0.00866911,0.178755,-0.05094399,-0.037447143,-0.010490955,-0.026898604,0.056079254,-0.0066953176,-0.047552012,-0.023694659,-0.093552314,-0.018675221,-0.01817537,0.104596205,-0.07471368,-0.008369602,-0.042323876,3.537025E-4,-0.029142903,0.019878356,-0.02061451,0.05762766,-0.031361632,0.043337315,-0.0064298064,0.07928939,-0.0631744,0.0027952155,-0.03366296,-0.06835128,0.037110075,0.0041077957,0.021582626,-0.041532636,-7.5442507E-4,0.080000006,0.017626591,0.039094068,-0.051514268,0.0136713525,-0.027769906,-0.085976936,0.0026644839,-0.058737792,-0.010649261,0.027995022,0.06008032,-0.040730998,0.04835942,-0.008403522,-0.13329017,0.02047185,0.011300478,-0.035011124,-0.032222316,-0.05008232,-0.031972338,-0.015220481,4.561165E-33,-0.019920347,-0.02448