under this Act on an escaped convict, the sentence, if of fine, shall, subject to\nthis Act and any other law for the time being in force, take effect immediately, but if of imprisonment shall\nnot take effect until the convict has served the period of imprisonment that remained unexpired at the\ndate of his or her escape from prison.\n193. Police supervision\n(1) Where any person to whom this section applies is sentenced to imprisonment, the court shall, at\nthe time of passing the sentence, order that he or she shall be subject to police supervision for a\nperiod not exceeding five years from the date of the expiration of that sentence.\n(2) Every person subject to police supervision sh','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.053651843,-0.022761459,-0.0037753899,-0.03439996,-0.017047789,0.016236236,0.026604606,-0.07011911,0.0210198,0.040157292,0.1896287,-0.004502516,0.060911223,-0.049674965,-0.018126404,-0.055734172,-0.012410413,0.015116179,-0.06623773,0.07044468,0.082407005,0.021643342,-0.0065778983,-0.014380935,-0.02598163,0.017709654,-0.0799745,-0.05884428,0.039760865,-0.080200896,7.653387E-4,0.004138115,-0.030017296,0.03983526,-0.026348757,-0.0039777216,0.059281785,-0.017241403,0.025911015,-0.063999765,0.014494598,0.017239625,-0.013923485,-0.07123638,0.024407035,-0.08074199,-0.077245474,-0.04781354,-0.061264414,-0.059877563,-0.059439298,-0.014136612,0.0048612524,0.09925881,-0.043894313,-0.052426085,0.004737541,0.030579478,0.0055842176,-0.018820027,-0.002762742,0.04239858,-0.07587257,-0.018098962,0.017073788,-0.09020032,0.01149349,-0.03394249,0.072997354,0.07113116,-0.0033233208,-0.08788764,-0.0532538,-0.021346228,-0.11476793,0.05511968,0.022257047,0.020770108,-0.049904943,-0.0038315018,0.011064742,-0.03683405,0.098663196,-0.04262915,0.042665314,-0.120652534,-0.10027389,-0.007901893,0.050858498,-0.041448474,0.07608857,0.05238332,0.062195614,-0.016294366,0.09007117,-0.06264381,0.05447195,0.01412