 made.\n195. Compensation in case of frivolous or vexatious charge\nIf on the dismissal of any private prosecution by a magistrate’s court, the court shall be of opinion that the\ncharge was frivolous or vexatious, the c','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.06262289,0.080928795,0.003432268,-0.084860355,0.011345756,0.02137168,0.10698059,0.052056864,0.032496367,0.10249495,0.080317356,-0.10521241,0.018724896,-0.029035952,-0.042166952,0.008759455,0.034028422,-0.0039405073,-0.015717722,0.058218036,0.04102673,0.050251834,0.0044810693,-0.0013501126,-0.031269077,-0.046240926,-0.062262658,0.0024234953,0.025673056,-0.029419655,0.020338977,0.051002823,-0.02604392,-0.029830232,0.035836536,0.024759613,0.041163415,-0.042464994,-0.034604516,-0.04182276,0.028482378,0.010727261,-0.0039568176,-0.12032269,0.04154542,-0.072580025,0.08314831,0.026413625,-0.09827823,-0.0110459905,-0.04121671,-0.053605508,0.009775734,0.022364464,-0.066884845,-0.01632774,0.027523087,0.021402972,0.021746518,0.032223973,-0.047363084,0.00762552,-0.111170046,0.054128077,0.02231489,-0.09160333,0.05495821,-0.03680213,0.005377289,0.015532769,0.09940139,-0.007900024,0.040239055,-0.031717043,-0.075517975,0.043087933,0.031128354,0.011908834,-0.017709117,0.0094513,0.0067487257,-0.05694632,0.020936297,-0.060041115,0.047673725,-0.09773707,-0.041468255,-0.012163424,0.12117224,0.015647717,0.10843717,-0.01321826,0.005092887,0.011970577,0.084865905,-0.024995323,0.045038443,0.00855625,0.016269285,0.07216895,0.009540454,0.011451557,-0.034362443,-0.050107487,0.06925054,0.004231321,0.04167143,-0.016266355,0.008409584,-0.04251712,-0.07181798,-0.047872674,0.036524396,0.017197544,0.022239283,0.025437191,4.3037397E-4,0.005002981,0.037114013,-0.047591686,-0.009702807,0.076157086,-0.057473317,-0.051552977,2.43821E-4,-0.019851793,-0.042669337,1.5955222E-33,0.01642098,-0.029008467,-0.057279464,-0.08996952,-0.05222263,-0.04593713,-0.044504017,0.059825953,0.041464213