immovable property;\n(c) for the foreclosure, sale or redemption in the case of a mortgage of, or charge upon,\nimmovable property;\n(d) for the determination of any other right to or interest in immovable property;\n(e) for compensation for wrong to immovable property;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 57','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.031507254,0.110403545,0.014554121,-0.05999086,0.018645996,0.043396562,0.098075055,-0.014038571,-0.039326653,-3.4943124E-4,0.0393036,-0.04248245,0.021283045,-0.038062576,0.072114125,0.025455877,0.0046834215,0.0073633813,-0.001032533,0.11350046,0.0135825295,0.020300275,-0.086862035,0.019026944,-0.081385516,-0.019746553,0.016201578,-0.041823037,0.02416027,-0.013111488,-0.026148427,0.113279745,-0.06715991,0.065213926,-0.04597303,0.020760247,-0.029784802,-0.07039081,-0.030530635,-0.046662133,-0.0062221154,-0.016141413,0.030052459,-0.05457935,0.0647442,0.015157583,0.05227229,0.031426586,-0.093471184,-0.06975108,-0.02840694,-0.024621628,-0.05326837,0.08308831,-0.049347717,-0.040317316,-0.037139032,0.007644581,0.034522794,-0.012476999,8.370004E-4,-0.003662514,-0.034547634,0.017310148,0.017798543,-0.020127391,0.03942054,-0.008000568,-0.024421353,0.056237057,0.10660603,0.0044256262,0.07095409,-0.007240351,-0.038234867,-0.055750877,0.016848266,0.05148252,0.05671874,-0.058927294,-0.022134181,0.05847001,-0.017858049,-0.10967277,0.025606599,-0.11594463,-0.022704232,-0.007826612,0.124465935,0.045578577,0.02576911,-3.4124625E-4,0.094992585,0.012733727,0.077010445,-0.070609145,0.025210781,-0.0467735,0.004003239,0.056588694,0.014728483,0.056471676,-0.07723694,-2.594093E-4,0.0761036,-0.0318146,-0.045719143,-0.0770585,-0.03499228,0.018014194,-0.09358529,-0.030754266,0.05695149,-0.118404426,0.024990823,0.014279848,0.031476032,0.020496374,0.048240595,-0.11363428,-0.023008924,0.06151112,-0.027166786,-6.3861243E-4,0.034102827,-0.029067649,-0.06781586,4.706275E-