er is illegal or improper, or that any proceedings are irregular, he or she\nshall forward the record with such remarks on the record as he or she thinks fit to the High Court.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 60','c06cb2d73e00d6efb369c39a508f6534bade96ab3f6eb327f8970cd01b0bba9d','Magistrates Courts Act','General','[-0.018092036,0.032252733,0.016023133,-0.022871627,0.02524442,-0.0057177185,0.044714365,0.019815922,-0.053609274,0.06590339,0.05237775,-0.06212296,0.0050083594,-0.03669998,-0.0017829543,9.911781E-4,0.06277994,-0.02436216,-0.021370681,7.094136E-4,0.112338066,0.019981923,-0.084831886,-0.034578692,-0.09517988,0.015201324,-0.095349535,-0.061583538,0.025038823,-0.0071536484,-0.05586935,0.0939799,0.031898446,0.0051631085,0.03939224,0.017449357,0.042476617,-0.04226478,0.0033549182,-0.060533848,-0.006385732,0.052925833,0.064587235,-0.049592864,0.033096343,-0.016338306,0.026302887,-0.013025962,-0.13096951,-0.04528,-0.061489813,-0.024778625,0.02355637,0.025247255,-0.006632478,-0.0038497315,0.02132521,-0.014615347,0.029651524,0.0013293913,-0.042499382,0.024307458,-0.08120698,-0.03733451,0.04185353,-0.047169734,0.023093961,-0.08074114,0.024257809,0.047730036,0.007820819,-0.04727443,0.0099060275,0.024114365,-0.1051806,-0.021982271,-0.0030736248,0.0195647,0.04095678,-0.062152598,9.430729E-4,0.011123483,-3.476886E-4,-0.083076194,-0.033760402,-0.11849209,-0.014137251,0.004679923,0.043200053,0.042581618,0.08100065,-0.05110316,-0.0033145226,-0.02265725,0.035026427,-0.07113906,-0.034367416,-0.009630521,0.08613791,0.06676091,0.06808216,0.05678633,-0.09577189,-0.044404242,0.021868685,0.049274523,-0.020935886,-0.03273557,0.01544341,0.0070849895,-0.062418547,0.06083563,0.015875315,-0.09232086,0.0042169825,0.06072467,0.05169199,0.08982854,-0.038751476,0.018231787,0.021895558,0.02887942,0.0019358941,0.004981985,0.0681528,0.04676693,-0.02763156,4.3977E-33,-0.041772176,-0.102899276,-0.029080583,-0.0023268247,0.017270392,0.05257758,-0.013400368,0.00323195,0.079