1 to this Act.\n8. Registrars to supply forms of notice free of cost\nEvery registrar shall supply forms of notice gratuitously to any persons applying for them.\n9. Notice to be entered in Marriage Notice Book and published\n(1) Upon receipt of a marriage notice the registrar shall cause it to be entered in a book to be called the\n“Marriage Notice Book” which may be inspected during office hours without fee.\n(2) The registrar shall also publish the notice by causing a copy of it to be affixed on the outer door of\nhis or her office, and to be kept exposed there until he or she grants the certificate under section 10,\nor until three months have elapsed.\n10. Registrar to issue certificate on proof of conditions by affidavit\n(1) The registrar, at any time after the expiration of twenty-one days and before the expiration of thr','a5d11b3f904d9d3026d74044ec89f457972892034ab7b1f77b4340579fc74442','Marriage Act #U2014 Chapter 146','General','[-0.006240498,0.06858765,0.03662738,-0.05149813,-0.06384475,0.055840325,0.043436475,-0.06406287,0.0699347,0.044637803,0.014497706,-0.026097957,0.011520964,-0.058512732,0.061689645,-0.0019621747,-0.039096136,0.01450319,-0.0557899,0.036449015,0.0500295,0.076117285,-0.0068010944,0.05785284,-0.02149253,-0.043005988,0.025204804,-0.008078261,0.049097423,-0.029451314,0.07302976,0.060919613,0.054552283,0.035829432,-0.0021477544,-0.017415587,0.029684735,0.012004335,0.08342554,-0.09286498,0.0381376,-0.08077488,0.05021123,-0.100067265,-0.0024947997,0.016320977,0.026564026,0.05045791,-0.0851178,-0.023662576,-0.07671239,-0.087581456,0.016620973,-0.0020865647,-0.019267742,-0.06713562,0.024075268,-0.020166725,-0.01523213,0.07194746,0.004945027,0.05898284,-0.06835364,-0.0013028677,-0.04246509,-0.058494903,0.060236167,0.05223942,-9.1813446E-4,-0.00605177,-7.4281526E-4,-0.027703162,0.039093718,0.034039684,-0.09488068,-0.03893955,-0.016311035,0.008752474,-0.020195987,-0.10692426,-0.14225161,0.029052304,0.08174541,-0.038585138,0.025659304,-0.0689104