ttestation of that taking by signing\nyour names to that effect, you become legally married to each other, although no other rite of a\ncivil or religious nature shall take place, and that this marriage cannot be dissolved during your\nlifetime, except by a valid judgment of divorce; and if either of you before the death of the other\nshall contract another marriage while this remains undissolved, you will be thereby guilty of\nbigamy and liable to punishment for that offence.”\nEach of the parties shall then say to the other—\n“I call upon all persons here p','a5d11b3f904d9d3026d74044ec89f457972892034ab7b1f77b4340579fc74442','Marriage Act #U2014 Chapter 146','General','[-0.092596635,0.06991755,0.018910827,-0.058341637,-0.117571816,-0.013540576,0.032375548,-0.054918755,0.060508195,0.055941135,0.016553197,0.009984857,0.026818285,-0.042898476,0.054182883,-0.019278772,-0.06800265,-0.024441682,-0.04255662,0.09361883,0.054900378,0.03476938,-0.038287915,6.634571E-4,-0.020245435,-0.06973963,-0.019038213,0.0264631,0.030418182,-0.09093844,0.12675813,0.042432427,0.05460156,0.063550904,-0.0063067833,-0.0067780083,0.057464864,0.037871156,0.07573548,-0.034590475,0.07577516,-0.07200081,0.043921,-0.09381071,0.0029619865,0.06203572,0.013874877,0.01595495,-0.0382563,-0.018277422,-0.11559587,-0.0514931,-0.0019387477,0.031009927,-0.010990589,0.0074494425,-0.033605855,0.008594954,0.0050872974,0.08143714,0.022201193,0.083613545,-0.08161984,0.03434298,-0.025411228,-0.054900516,0.04682106,0.038650297,0.005564102,0.016333235,0.0299866,-0.008307738,-0.008275055,0.023983186,-0.06463887,-0.098999254,-0.02958536,0.0109907985,0.010322375,-0.121212855,-0.035153504,0.03761442,0.09351723,-0.028596228,-0.009857746,-0.04533444,-0.030907623,0.04494302,0.05741928,-0.051494636,-0.038927652,-0.06179039,0.046747845,0.034079727,0.057192225,0.022451391,0.04029675,0.04018614,0.034991574,0.062372435,-0.03849339,0.052590184,-0.0705891,0.0023175867,0.0074291243,0.0443134,-0.014459996,-0.033817958,0.02062357,-0