in the Marriage Register\nBook of his or her district, and the Registrar General shall file the copy in his or her office.\n30. Correction of clerical errors in marriage certificates\nAny registrar, when authorised by the Registrar General, may correct any clerical error in any certificate of\nmarriage filed in his or her office, upon production to him or her of the certificate delivered to the parties,\nand shall authenticate every correction by his or her signature and the date of the correction.\n31. Evidence of marriage\nEvery certificate of marriage which shall have been filed in the office of the registrar of any district, or a\ncopy of the certificate of marriage, purporting to be si','a5d11b3f904d9d3026d74044ec89f457972892034ab7b1f77b4340579fc74442','Marriage Act #U2014 Chapter 146','General','[-0.09453366,0.03762981,3.4204568E-4,-0.0021258972,-0.07350519,0.066820785,-0.052185368,0.015445815,0.03899213,-0.023611417,0.0015980797,0.035877027,0.058823366,-0.07267729,-0.026417699,2.1042074E-4,0.009908807,0.029824078,-0.0023466,0.0695109,0.009129337,0.041239526,-0.007785007,-0.012187141,-0.02238741,-0.046128627,0.0026788907,0.030890778,0.05967534,-0.059009153,0.098264925,0.041890536,0.045587517,0.058318783,0.0077869683,-0.082917534,-0.0038899784,0.016268678,0.039183497,-0.0074910065,-0.006164041,-0.069036506,0.0061996314,0.001515133,-0.040074892,0.095141105,0.011553105,0.025984386,-0.048160855,0.044509843,-0.13248715,-0.025353173,-0.008270393,0.04909308,-0.06213066,0.01700622,-0.0015973777,-0.020742163,-0.056184452,0.019751871,0.04925386,0.11624048,-0.055403143,-0.031146897,-0.031793337,0.005485415,0.043168437,0.039621864,0.051206972,-0.03368531,-0.041209545,0.030375075,-0.013510025,0.088398695,-0.062544204,-0.061730213,-0.054750025,-0.0138324415,0.079180464,-0.1666844,-0.096007496,-0.009818471,0.07814064,-0.04953651,-0.044234194,0.02187512,-0.027032325,0.049809694,0.066437416,-0.023019351,0.05076499,-0.06267724,0.069013245,-0.0881681,0.05375285,0.015052325,0.053