as Registrar General for the purposes of this Act.\n2. Constitution of marriage districts\nThe Minister shall, by statutory order, divide Uganda into districts for the purposes of this Act, herein\nreferred to as marriage districts, and may, by like order, alter the marriage districts, either by alteration of\nboundaries or by union or subdivision of districts, or by the formation of new districts.\n3. Appointment of registrars\n(1) The Minister shall, appoint a fit and proper person to be the registrar of marriages for each\nmar','a5d11b3f904d9d3026d74044ec89f457972892034ab7b1f77b4340579fc74442','Marriage Act — Chapter 146','General','[-0.052660372,0.030175036,0.025804698,-0.07192421,-0.09165249,0.0148308845,-0.05772526,-0.02962531,-0.0037157787,0.10683129,0.039080616,0.008231042,0.0021365182,-0.05498016,0.0562485,-0.018147562,-0.012439002,-0.049291898,-0.0799606,0.08225839,0.10105556,0.062203586,0.012683123,0.015545526,-0.013126167,-0.019494504,0.0022065672,-0.01397657,0.0096384045,-0.004154982,0.08208984,0.09407052,0.037800554,0.077298835,-0.023889208,-0.086573966,-0.006247067,0.04454157,0.047469556,-0.049005058,0.079284176,-0.10756277,0.07138594,-0.14426361,-0.0049232924,0.015083275,0.006199269,-0.015330751,-0.0729114,0.041332588,-0.062101822,0.0019650927,0.008888185,0.03582014,0.027977629,-0.022853903,-0.012976205,-0.03526282,-0.0037938445,0.07486266,0.04932784,0.09216406,-0.084440656,0.0014893354,-0.036086474,-0.11207959,0.043135118,-0.009175756,-0.0043255584,-0.022255251,0.027730012,-0.0107791,-0.014121562,0.04282715,-0.07028463,-0.048875272,0.020744605,0.036228705,0.030968588,-0.11165394,-0.075241975,0.015068943,0.08709095,-0.059977587,0.017262222,-0.046771105,-0.0743611,0.020689644,0.046444606,-0.039703727,-0.003237078,-0.009518189,0.06511894,5.93573E-5,0.04869299,-0.015141757,0.056650873,0.0075896573,-0.0058966964,0.057538126,-0.059070613,-0.013906904,-0.07250503,-0.01671472,0.0038098171,0.011188508,0.037302636,-0.014667618,-0.018261494,-0.027032947,-0.031