ar,\nand may revoke such appointment.\n(2) For the purposes of this section, absence means absence from the place at which, as provided by\nsection 4, the office of the registrar is situate.\n4. Offices of registrars\nEvery registrar shall have an office at such place in his or her district as the Minister shall from time to\ntime direct.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 1','a5d11b3f904d9d3026d74044ec89f457972892034ab7b1f77b4340579fc74442','Marriage Act — Chapter 146','General','[-0.03827681,0.050001957,-0.038489446,0.007153427,-0.10842944,0.014006351,-0.05906417,-0.078468926,0.068431,-0.0096934065,0.022966778,-0.0037409782,0.017372094,-0.117711045,0.05994244,-0.03202031,-0.015577675,0.012333492,-0.07391676,0.024198312,0.044698935,0.06758406,-0.051683858,-0.0071058716,-0.034381125,-0.03983444,0.030194724,0.005766089,0.042160857,-0.034537222,0.08172106,0.039045192,0.042329915,0.074057214,0.050229006,-0.0016006213,-0.020582713,0.10401037,0.009395429,0.01725657,0.057743743,-0.01874634,0.034714915,-0.07449753,0.009285748,0.028439825,-0.008274968,0.033122923,-0.0869351,-0.044334874,0.005631592,-0.055738445,-3.14995E-4,0.071943186,-0.068533175,0.013178717,0.026167594,-0.04729489,-0.048743173,0.038260277,0.037591618,0.078502476,-0.061403535,-0.026863,-0.045747116,-0.031592607,0.053132102,-0.023483627,0.03793919,-0.00683909,-0.04259432,-0.030219657,0.016551396,0.08711296,-0.061747845,-0.09249399,-0.012920566,0.023397168,0.07738047,-0.06871538,-0.0083846515,1.9834061E-4,0.10312899,-0.02042675,-0.036856443,-0.02688138,-0.04435316,-0.022568638,0.013300317,-0.019372951,0.003842497,0.023910116,0.100209534,-0.0014691191,0.014260362,-0.009900453,0.03725757,-0.017864803,0.04076159,0.08740791,-0.10937657,-0.013590941,-0.09944607,0.057583377,-0.046312295,0.05496826,-0.08538977,-0.025233459,-0.029065467,0.0060339146,-0.031723443,-0.0545407,0.007345294,-0.016000878,-0.039817244,0.006789687,0.0091308,-0.0028652558,-0.015411747,-0.009473186,-0.060665254,0.016511664,