o apply is a minor, the application shall be made by his or her lawful guardian, and if the\nwidow be a purdah-nisheen the application shall be made by her personally or on her behalf\nby her duly authorised vakil;\n(b) in the case of a divorce—\n(i) other than of the kind known as Khula, by the man who effected the divorce; and\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 1','f492d4ac96a761fbc669591edb815e20f610836a9add9b52b61f83f121d8c65c','Marriage and Divorce of Mohammedans Act — Chapter 147','General','[-0.10292372,0.0069709835,-0.056965493,-0.051255416,-0.09775073,0.058478367,-0.03278412,-0.032993775,0.06664002,-0.014526844,0.035660557,0.020850036,0.039032433,-0.061108984,0.032176834,-0.0022069465,-0.015339632,0.016301699,-0.019920448,0.06202297,-0.0059437975,0.05554498,-0.10060955,-0.007684324,-0.015130212,-0.10053892,-0.003315606,-0.013800403,0.046303492,-0.02366752,0.071522176,0.03500844,-0.074682884,0.04304729,0.06046804,-0.024794608,-0.045201484,0.0969077,-0.01583519,-0.0067610624,-0.009283711,-0.058173154,-0.010290085,-0.01390075,0.0016983496,0.029909208,-0.020574711,0.033289365,-0.04798697,0.01701405,-0.06587118,-0.051412113,0.015319094,0.07903931,0.014081985,-0.033222362,0.006550846,-0.021500722,-0.05357415,0.032588065,-0.0329785,0.052877843,-0.080618106,-0.022570895,0.025731143,-0.006150902,0.12997214,-0.016690454,0.070531085,-0.013956907,-0.036570515,-0.057743944,-0.008434842,0.08835488,-0.10325917,-0.07369532,0.0037854475,0.008238084,0.04050685,-0.1264174,-0.07431449,0.083461605,0.078325644,-0.03734933,-0.0017442977,0.013494089,-0.038095925,-0.0020991683,0.04340912,0.02723684,0.07195563,-0.01309623,0.06840374,-0.06823927,0.010174755,0.02663884,0.012044755,0.025078207,0.043203473,0.07148498,-0.052078508,-0.010324894,-0.0811886,0.06486378,-0.0036308172,0.009713979,-0.07797582,-0.07723086,0.024165561,0.015516001,-0.06908745,-0.023786286,0.007797988,-0.0509195,-0.034428697,0.062016513,0.00816736,0.039674304,0.097717226,-0.022416692,-0.05606626