nd any other orders, warrants or requests for the\npayment of money;\n“monogamous marriage” means a marriage which is by law necessarily monogamous and binding during\nthe lifetime of both parties unless dissolved by a valid judgment of the court;\n“night” or “nighttime” means the interval between half-past six o’clock in the evening and half-past six\no’clock in the morning;\n“oath” includes affirmation or declaration;\n“offence” is an act, attempt or omission punishable by law;\n“person” and “owner” and other like terms when used with reference to property include corporations of\nall kinds and any other association of persons capable of owning property, and also when so used include\nthe Government;\n“pers','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.006703311,0.080952995,-0.057553254,0.0041397274,-0.06299589,-0.025230544,0.09140365,0.028512908,-0.009297762,0.08133087,0.08339565,-0.039862856,0.017948752,0.015522272,-0.024016108,-0.041347418,-0.00550318,-0.029777883,-0.05672841,0.1639344,0.16136205,0.09787141,-0.012460761,-0.0034637728,-0.024204396,0.0028791788,-0.052972145,-0.03635077,0.026432581,-0.055979256,0.021138232,0.038147274,0.03600367,0.067409925,0.0041865925,0.046205208,0.03407744,0.016488066,0.024195751,-0.059401914,-0.016855765,0.04046439,0.0046839463,-0.10784814,0.031885546,0.03586595,-0.003759543,0.07772174,-0.09284548,-0.024592035,-0.03358181,-0.015351882,0.028620578,0.12997927,-0.007525511,-0.12059487,-0.015543788,-7.8945165E-4,-0.04474404,0.023857944,-0.004107402,0.05250473,0.0059937416,-0.0045880647,-0.07546874,-0.08086948,0.06238542,-0.021093694,0.008068969,0.027285222,0.047754094,-0.10323917,0.03166484,0.030993195,-0.10855394,-0.048367955,0.046516463,0.05658337,0.039201822,-0.07005575,0.0014896861,0.081804,0.07607719,-0.020986553,0.015200406,-0.025243364,-0.030178906,0.03296577,0.10302286,-0.035676982,0.0016153463,-6.4822525E-5,0.12133135,0.017200073,0.077591494,-0.022552183,0.0068880157,-