ssel” includes a ship, a boat and every other kind of vessel used in navigation either on the sea or in\ninland waters, and includes aircraft;\n“wife” means wife of a monogamous marriage;\n“wound” means any incision or puncture which divides or pierces any exterior membrane of the body,\nand any membrane is exterior for the purpose of this definition which can be touched without dividing or\npiercing any other membrane.\n3. Saving of certain laws\nNothing in this Code shall affect—\n(a) the liability, trial or punishment of a person for an offence against any other written law in force in\nUganda other than this Code;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely a','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[0.06816595,0.03706337,-0.10359288,0.002509944,-0.0041883723,0.018765533,0.09078844,-0.08248084,0.00672934,0.006295494,0.06196386,0.0051982757,0.029729752,-0.057567663,0.07728567,-3.827197E-4,0.08805581,-0.0432086,0.01991214,0.14023803,0.06109256,0.049845345,0.009966048,0.002190679,-0.08556082,-0.013455951,0.031509906,-0.0032695823,0.042822145,-0.04288474,-0.0047071283,0.015879137,-0.015762942,0.069012865,0.07107054,0.029016877,0.08229878,-0.06932529,-0.014884422,-0.018944886,-0.04127879,-0.030115021,-0.0074200137,-0.020483691,-0.003597811,-0.032862682,0.06739521,-0.011114453,-0.0392862,-0.09526623,-0.00441786,-0.011547353,-0.020512823,0.05014262,-0.09426828,-0.04750851,-0.08345404,-0.034287635,-0.020582132,-0.03394258,0.047386695,-0.010758382,-0.022650478,0.039573796,-0.012486677,0.033710524,0.018763127,-0.03929385,0.044071868,-0.033533696,0.0103260325,0.058947917,0.035897594,0.041627023,0.0075606927,-0.13053446,-1.3638102E-4,-0.024527531,0.035601106,-0.043639857,-0.012732833,0.04451272,0.053413596,-0.030553786,-0.030390592,0.036952607,-0.036123805,0.053649012,0.11024963,0.049638428,-0.073181726,0.0063980995,0.021997664,-0.005451392,0.023378141,-0.07863291,0.054308545,-0.0065935114,0.057034586,0.026207406,-0.0210