. Extent of jurisdiction of courts\n(1) The jurisdiction of the courts of Uganda for the purposes of this Code extends to every place within\nUganda.\n(2) Notwithstanding subsection (1), the courts of Uganda shall have jurisdiction to try offences created\nunder sections 23, 24, 25, 26 and 27 committed outside Uganda by a Uganda citizen or person\nordinarily resident in Uganda.\n[subsection (2) amended by section 33(b) of Act 14 of 2002]\n(3) For the avoidance of doubt, the offences referred to in subsection (2) committed outside Uganda by\na Ugandan citizen or a person ordinarily resident in Uganda shall be dealt with as if they h','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.046881616,0.04967577,-0.051898997,-0.09275664,-0.044773158,0.035335325,0.048437536,-0.0073115253,-0.02262162,0.08824215,0.1013776,0.018135574,0.0290142,-0.045015644,0.016919268,-0.057198886,-0.04101683,-0.01824469,-0.06595858,0.07057243,0.15619527,0.051062334,0.0073881857,0.024770234,-0.08743908,-0.007940224,-0.04770881,-0.050890226,0.01765217,-0.063772455,-0.0015670405,0.006527776,0.016584624,0.06345976,-0.054520242,0.03433399,0.07534008,-0.021209696,-0.0014437565,-0.06062061,0.0068875044,0.02006888,0.020908175,-0.07384286,0.04380359,-0.038492005,-0.0065447,-0.006948756,-0.12717791,-0.08191575,-0.01762627,0.0024275372,-0.011687738,0.08063638,-0.013615787,-0.10297573,-0.030073961,-0.056430236,0.048276227,0.007821964,-0.008262603,0.027833078,-0.041668277,0.007257998,0.0042413957,-0.08906118,0.0069277543,-0.065139286,-0.049829666,-0.015280234,-0.002168386,-0.065699585,0.03780262,0.02639775,-0.066776894,-0.0045123687,0.04392359,0.057966124,0.013577609,-0.08466001,0.030815063,0.03433198,0.10919529,-0.030176697,0.011937874,-0.020075018,-0.044744384,-0.041423883,0.13018513,-0.028575102,0.057629466,0.011471073,0.09433707,0.020093018,0.008026227,-0.044382382,0.06048253,-0.050394304,0.018526051,0.07004061,0.0100770015,-0.015522199,-0.058065563,-0.01