tly to kill him or her or do him or her grievous bodily harm if he or she refuses; but threats of future\ninjury do not excuse any offence.\n15. Defence of person or property and rash, reckless and negligent acts\nSubject to any express provisions in this Code or any other law in force in Uganda, criminal responsibility\n—\n(a) for the use of force in the defence of person and property; and\n(b) in respect of rash, reckless or negligent acts, shall be determi','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.003253651,0.0018219717,-0.054259907,-0.058462247,2.0609208E-5,0.02536716,0.06598008,-0.05305492,-0.044697993,0.067012765,0.09605557,-0.014362557,0.026102308,0.032251075,-6.77451E-4,-0.035933778,-0.003537537,-0.072938845,-0.06275049,0.11338852,0.10466596,-0.0078813955,0.06790996,0.011376389,-0.066085406,0.059211385,-0.016875716,-0.0719809,0.02099467,-0.0332653,0.002606914,0.058026653,-0.00468409,0.021238765,-0.026538663,-0.0011836315,0.02460093,-0.0034722392,0.056130182,-0.039854143,0.024675727,0.0011303197,-0.026162095,-0.036965437,0.0010366695,-0.060251698,-0.004444435,0.023559393,-0.07682409,-0.10770953,-0.02705411,0.0067295367,0.036191985,0.082946114,-0.024467407,-0.08886695,-0.0026891085,0.0027886475,-0.004610433,0.064580455,-0.0030727854,0.093392365,-0.021395344,0.0035203183,0.035011068,-0.044887215,-0.008411527,-0.0149525935,-0.017018799,0.010678625,0.004383469,-0.098019026,0.07395007,0.014754279,-0.07633796,-0.005477847,0.039367963,0.0155209,-0.031039739,-0.050516043,0.016484158,0.024655227,0.10037965,-0.03926895,0.07420129,-0.06762639,-0.08323868,-0.0055826926,0.06278424,-0.01619459,0.0742612,-0.003941955,0.047339298,-0.06808057,0.04901397,-0.002061661,0.026855804,-0.015514587,-0.023138348,0.01799144,-0.01707683,0.015939897,-0.09478281,-0.02147474,0.09849367,-0.0038084446,0.09215765,0.006753239,0.019741895,3.0279573E-4,0.009908735,0.06294969,0.006202224,-0.008674256,0.039291926,0.060439665,-0.010519372,0.