arlike\nundertaking with, for, by or against any chief, body or group of persons commits an offence and is liable on\nconviction to imprisonment for life.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 9','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.029275147,-0.013989649,-0.061751038,0.006515762,0.02909757,0.041036632,0.14309844,-0.06353877,-0.050402578,0.02485387,0.068986915,-0.030991413,0.09245697,-0.011711382,0.0227676,0.036378227,0.012507405,-0.020451466,-0.07801841,0.046520777,0.04573672,0.0071066427,0.019179868,0.07963718,-0.07614454,0.029415065,-0.03742428,0.010790482,-0.023774682,0.055032026,0.091553986,-0.029904531,-0.08496775,0.043050475,0.060510486,0.007301906,0.07659589,-0.015930623,0.05605439,-0.014311234,0.0066705667,-0.05530487,-0.057721347,0.011429879,-0.026481157,-0.011275243,-0.033844575,-0.0069736033,-0.05259526,-0.0759697,0.01947722,-0.03258252,-0.036697354,-0.022692494,-0.017144589,-0.12335643,0.008406193,0.04367985,0.08163477,-0.03690142,-0.030048305,0.04481196,0.07586987,0.027360085,-0.063423224,-0.029034825,0.013961279,0.05858469,-0.04015803,0.026679335,0.0906073,-0.051044602,0.05634463,0.019649211,-0.047294877,-0.110154934,0.07653482,0.023050893,-0.025818544,-0.021128612,0.028049057,0.12628916,0.05859271,-3.1973055E-4,0.0053268312,-0.02937632,-0.03396597,0.04060261,0.07385828,0.05621963,0.008245915,0.016008336,0.0856213,0.022928447,0.14535585,-0.042947363,0.027589532,-0.04000554,-0.05127138,0.017616583,-0.038754772,-0.035721328,-0.10835375,0.008139013,-0.041056447,-0.039357267,-0.007279959,-0.04376617,-0.11516877,-0.01715722,-0.06357693,0.004154199,-0.07102529,-0.12444079,0.100711696,-0.025258237,-0.06531181,0.031179968,-0.057568755,-0.050032347,0.028880164,0.014945507,0.009477048,-8.589051E-4,0.015329619,-0.026325174,-0.054465313,1.4632218E-33,-0.063748084,0.071167156,-0.0465914,0.015896704,-0.039537717,-0.005218308,-0.032641314,-0.016814021,0.027987719,0.066014014,0.02327633,0.