owledge or privity, or in\nresponse to a request made before the prohibition of the importation of such publication\ncame into effect; or\n(b) who has any such publication or extract from such publication in his or her possession at the\ntime when the prohibition of its importation comes into effect,\nshall forthwith, if or as soon as the nature of its contents has become known to him or her, or in the\ncase of a publication or extract from such publication coming into the possession of such per','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.060545612,0.032885805,-0.05667818,-0.03352506,0.036543667,0.05744042,0.026582204,-0.056631655,-0.028695177,0.048561793,0.12275549,-0.012274998,0.032124378,-0.014117057,-0.03115329,-0.094187245,0.0011363092,-0.010641445,-0.08681658,0.0863533,0.09529866,0.022852555,-0.03300284,0.031715967,-0.029983295,-0.0022741833,-0.11616639,-0.0779558,0.045743536,-0.0338172,0.012633328,0.00983643,-0.01885754,0.032857325,0.066562556,-0.022924544,0.093306035,-0.06612541,0.043454807,-0.039434798,0.04392368,-0.03888864,-0.049215194,-0.015376969,0.009414072,-0.026107417,-0.008730277,0.0270391,-0.08624536,0.016363913,-0.035986487,0.048091654,-0.038806107,0.11005939,-0.030113723,-0.08712685,-0.02605766,0.030798087,-0.06718848,-0.024804791,-0.05764137,0.017350323,-0.06597065,-0.01950433,0.012450676,-0.03831959,-0.03614187,-0.02936021,0.008951885,0.058158226,4.9396907E-4,-0.05266965,-0.048419505,0.060119353,-0.005342377,-0.065834105,-0.014402266,0.02440576,-0.004584839,-0.08756495,0.067767,-0.014968586,0.0728831,-0.065427296,-0.07064977,-0.04926803,-0.020008553,0.03170069,0.072654165,0.026167013,0.0021374729,-0.029787354,0.11422819,-0.0059061446,0.027315,-0.021710508,0.05952857,-0.016979316,0.014735,0.058229238,-0.010296166,0.015437804,-0.010406387,-0.0195251,-0.030315584,-0.05411809,-0.07842032,-0.06404923,-0.10456111,0.021570014,-0.015203071,0.08066806,0.030008359,-0.05931589,0.045552123,0.0855774,-