roviding any service or class of service;\n(i) abstaining from working for or employing any person or class of person; or\n(j) abstaining from doing any other act which may lawfully be done.\n(2) Any person who with intent to further any designated boycott—\n(a) by word of mouth publicly; or\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 16','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.0089959465,0.057814285,0.03569421,-0.055691216,0.022371875,0.03431474,0.09156205,0.006173747,-0.02956482,0.06625518,0.086976446,-0.004460171,0.044638928,-0.061456278,0.03133838,0.006673753,0.034780413,-0.048125543,-0.1051259,0.06559021,0.08128882,0.07633964,-0.030256853,0.07748715,-0.097441524,-0.026025686,0.01973006,-0.022740202,0.07372148,-0.044586644,0.038414836,0.03529391,0.010677319,0.08980138,0.012850879,-0.011017673,0.059828363,-0.073127,0.018580629,-0.1112909,0.063943155,-0.04599245,-0.03386294,-0.1352307,0.054168902,-0.04017505,0.028709678,-0.0014727507,-0.058991715,-0.044043254,8.336338E-4,-0.042347677,-0.0142504405,0.026120672,-0.0026196167,-0.07404976,-0.0310175,-0.031044608,0.05331232,-0.0030026794,0.00913042,-0.031100148,-0.05557858,0.023137035,0.022058655,-0.102741435,0.0037826814,-0.01170888,-0.022471154,0.09935314,0.095077015,-0.10119382,0.061073102,0.034306724,-0.015105017,-0.07313695,0.05522475,0.008959578,0.0040078745,-0.05137587,-0.05382098,0.027366107,0.0549169,-0.04943742,-0.02163536,-0.08365074,-0.05117874,-9.6482155E-4,0.16025783,-0.023240963,-0.061214957,0.0016515859,0.1097702,0.032238275,-0.0029720597,-0.03054996,0.052369505,-0.09509837,0.024536187,0.09963604,0.005961342,0.012508715,-0.06497595,-0.014865635,0.019919487,-0.081715204,-0.01054111,-0.060617935,-0.04448055,-0.0035340202,-0.06909752,-0.0034594298,0.013490507,-0.036816258,-2.4857308E-4,-0.0021685082,0.02521861,-0.009351587,0.02874561,-0.0062278635,-0.051897496,0.020186368,0.023432406,-0.03678601,-0.04204808,-0.029375805,-0.063873835,3.99