me office bearers as the unlawful society;\n(b) having a name similar to that of the unlawful society; or\n(c) having substantially the same membership as the unlawful society, such society shall be\ndeemed to be an unlawful society.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 19','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.0233678,0.05549228,0.02788131,-0.025591534,-0.032750096,-0.01238226,0.02685356,-0.06742031,-0.004149459,0.0840899,0.075630374,0.0080059515,0.07956895,-0.050335784,-0.00975692,-0.012423106,-0.04666719,-0.021934457,-0.078687675,0.11797795,0.122226745,0.080002725,0.002600636,0.04456004,-0.038512256,0.01563132,-0.039696943,-0.0373569,0.027870024,-0.021989565,0.009427812,-0.038444847,0.018425584,0.080860294,-0.0041480623,-0.004975687,0.11835966,-0.039770946,0.05456993,-0.086590044,0.0021395017,-0.042634413,2.1377245E-4,-0.1321845,0.0012521966,0.049749795,0.010536188,0.036003303,-0.10022863,-0.0901497,-0.003915851,-0.051558156,-0.010785851,0.09787683,-0.008724039,-0.074046806,-0.030319957,-0.025161594,0.03682135,0.029732,0.0024647512,0.08184129,-0.040911037,0.0039574495,0.061260793,-0.0985508,0.0681555,0.023197442,-0.00568309,0.096475065,0.066482194,-0.10825772,0.11450988,-0.04040987,-0.06047486,-0.036493342,0.0042367866,0.028533518,-0.004707159,-0.06270025,0.030768644,0.057799198,0.08187575,-0.005596664,0.020173766,-0.035867613,-0.056368984,0.0051442077,0.11438252,0.010024298,-0.064248726,0.03525998,0.12817672,0.017443113,0.08242309,-0.044196695,0.04734813,-0.064029716,-0.013022453,0.061898515,-0.013283368,0.009010658,-0.10050291,-0.032041892,0.03566763,-0.059568077,-0.013474487,-0.03867951,-0.07193607,-0.0041130786,-0.034811847,0.0209681,-0.033057913,-0.095805556,0.03328427,0.0042236927,0.026838811,0.07692657,0.011098864,-0.024500255,-6.0221826E-4,-0.031215746,-0.03888154,-0.035316344,-0.008564488,0.0038985924,-0.046332788,-1.4022664E-33,-0.022776129,0.0029547024,-0.064986505,-0.027142