e cause to believe to belong to\nany unlawful society or to be in any way connected with the purpose of the meeting.\n(2) For the purposes of this section, “peace officer” means any magistrate or any police officer not\nbelow the rank of assistant superintendent of police.\n63. Disposition of property of unlawful','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.06859982,0.05658049,-0.06773162,-0.05951917,-0.06349505,2.6105696E-4,0.05808752,-0.06709338,0.00517095,0.056259308,0.08519625,-0.022229282,0.042943325,-0.005834364,0.03437177,-0.042949628,-0.04426073,0.002189648,-0.043836124,0.09499214,0.095557705,-0.018714106,0.0030935504,0.025528768,-0.047653563,0.006173838,-0.046766385,-0.0055546607,0.02672736,-0.04070758,0.0108676655,0.0036241154,0.05131163,0.10563832,0.031593867,0.011022093,0.122712746,0.0041421168,0.05398797,-0.04070511,-0.010335319,-0.018273337,0.023526741,-0.12425003,0.018217223,0.017651811,0.01353259,0.04570847,-0.109058365,-0.11115491,2.5972424E-5,-0.043736134,0.023890596,0.07312134,-0.05902135,-0.02341073,-0.018469516,-0.036345273,0.01241689,-0.049369,0.02566877,0.060650714,-0.0755016,-0.015789194,-0.008517203,-0.01651011,0.014014983,-0.0012477632,-0.012171366,0.015175957,0.020222781,-0.06007168,0.049506765,0.036277786,-0.055218935,-0.0492528,0.034153868,0.0033653886,0.0051116715,-0.0994243,0.0113347825,0.085606255,0.08055502,0.0047672126,-0.01287153,-0.0019078752,-0.082051955,0.0359034,0.0540034,-0.010336668,0.0022112152,0.017729592,0.10305282,-1.69746E-4,0.08212576,-0.036508393,0.070923954,0.004258878,0.006154088,0.06095688,-0.035626877,0.031877536,-0.05322449,-0.04721995,0.06767346,0.020666115,0.052874807,0.010044926,7.5203826E-4,-0.0114505235,-6.878898E-4,0.03704491,-0.07396054,-0.032401018,0.025402356,7.322408E-4,-0.03220371,0.069382936,-0.035109594,-0.05125,-0.034577157,0.045442626,0.012209232,-0.043558937,4.2291245E-4,0.0011705237,-0.013432394,-3.5588254E-34,-0.07117425,0.035540547,-0.084400