able to forfeiture under any law relating to the\ncustoms commits a felony, and each of them is liable to imprisonment for five years.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 24','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.056340307,0.049894035,-0.030933702,-0.04486554,-0.014729874,0.060679886,0.10380232,-0.06385886,0.005793627,-0.0066227727,0.054063234,-0.019892473,-0.0018788789,0.009159734,-0.01629576,-0.049975496,-0.037031423,0.01170654,-0.077811174,0.06535596,0.08180392,-0.0020849314,-0.011259443,0.009894522,-0.047561936,-0.015408625,-0.04094032,9.739013E-4,0.038588442,0.0066189696,0.033841167,-0.036413617,0.03289961,0.10429662,0.009999078,-0.04059149,0.12610339,0.0010079603,0.01824572,-0.011460475,0.007704548,0.025048174,-0.045528766,-0.00897405,-5.71412E-6,-0.046026375,-0.038966432,0.019275986,-0.07322394,-0.12745695,-0.04270893,0.015528998,0.014833811,0.12347937,-0.008356222,-0.11389497,-0.00926112,-0.022770325,0.009358388,-0.025124984,0.0107905315,0.022303142,0.072525434,0.012950177,-0.0059813214,-0.018475916,-0.008468008,-0.026153876,0.004137505,0.030881211,0.00134444,-0.0751984,-0.045275558,-0.017266192,-0.050817154,-0.04750174,-0.015084855,0.059508186,0.04023313,-0.074711815,0.0023155732,0.09523646,0.02213305,-0.0214905,-0.0640369,-0.042357378,-0.040292367,0.04602321,0.10440248,0.036654066,-0.034153976,0.05293456,0.0909843,-0.03039872,0.011170297,-0.040324997,0.054112338,0.03538849,-0.024992008,0.028002048,-0.03431849,0.050162483,-0.045212474,-0.01594261,-0.038146116,0.010460518,-0.013949519,-0.07880035,-0.08773257,-0.017916912,-0.006306658,0.047978923,-0.043924093,-0.042951472,0.021647735,0.098453104,-0.09367439,0.06244374,0.014673285,0.014716227,0.02087469,-0.012100536,0.014511896,0.03388295,-0.026106259,-0.041780837,-0.006577384,5.307895E-35,-0.027529785,0.016146077,-0.1148086,0.051456224,0.03080999,0.04051805,-0.07649165,0.009827364,0.051456444,0.081891924,0.0136915045,-0.033737507,