person who, knowing a woman or girl to be an idiot or imbecile, has or attempts to have unlawful\ncarnal knowledge of her under circumstances not amounting to rape, but which prove that the offender\nknew at the time of the commission of the offence that the woman or girl was an idiot or imbecile,\ncommits a felony and is liable to imprisonment for fourteen years.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 33','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.09357472,0.089495085,-0.035036087,0.058971163,-0.018324621,0.029084468,0.1239085,0.062187858,0.0045721685,0.0122034885,0.116576694,-0.064934835,0.083755605,0.010628402,-0.07817207,-0.044817597,0.044349216,0.060053483,-0.034386512,0.107284866,0.073884524,0.03458991,0.02796529,0.011292779,-0.021910278,0.02261709,-0.0125439465,-0.017394345,-0.055103533,-0.018293597,0.025562799,-0.023529824,0.009530549,0.040215824,-0.012497182,-0.009576589,0.03815642,-0.007847344,0.020521447,-0.028762434,0.026156226,0.0020608474,-0.011733705,-0.013948747,0.019571265,-8.5081294E-4,0.0025839745,0.074787,-0.120034076,-0.0752897,-0.02595228,0.020420322,0.042777855,0.13008524,-0.06092525,-0.09607913,9.5392566E-4,0.06024146,-0.056892782,0.11611637,0.0041479524,0.037505187,-2.2938446E-4,-0.004982145,-0.024237564,-0.03431205,0.021040311,-0.032380037,-0.0040341313,0.05940827,0.0674568,-0.020344697,-0.029160568,-0.030464102,0.045619074,0.0213991,-0.008076437,0.08132763,0.011055512,-0.051479165,0.026904035,-0.008856584,0.051905584,-0.15620649,0.0057970705,-0.13487132,-0.026137086,0.029167186,0.09017721,0.023179734,0.08890421,-0.052102298,0.07612826,-0.05733184,0.095392786,0.033611085,-0.047301944,-0.098109044,-0.012564959,0.04820023,-0.027272651,-0.006225946,-0.041248202,-0.01455563,0.083497465,-0.019152513,0.015067379,-0.007863517,-0.075704336,-0.034653347,0.004992235,0.0030311816,0.11033427,-0.02314072,0.034128062,0.031935923,-0.053852137,0.06677099,0.0996222,-0.06423705,0.0502989