oth such fine and\nimprisonment.\n163. Betting houses\n(1) Any house, room or place which is used for any of the following purposes—\n(a) for the purpose of bets being made in it between persons resorting to the place and—\n(i) the owner, occupier or keeper of the place, or any person using the place;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 40','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[0.008399291,0.034460943,-0.047654416,-0.113913916,-0.038383875,0.025710471,0.11120586,-0.049668007,-0.048967402,0.03866687,0.060587198,-0.058427565,0.055771206,-0.025959186,0.016506827,-0.04001559,0.0071986117,-0.014290325,-0.03359889,0.11218126,0.031863376,-0.047539294,-0.05619742,0.0111407265,-0.03376294,-0.017009886,0.013358263,0.07610382,-0.02434603,-0.01135221,0.0070322296,-0.019997803,-0.03390956,0.07770316,0.040628567,-0.0032782918,0.019036157,-0.057991408,0.004841878,-0.053317063,0.028217243,0.021028504,-0.024104862,-0.016622948,3.39067E-4,0.055707466,-0.06860022,-0.0111419335,-0.039037086,-0.012272363,-0.002181616,0.06296991,0.07144447,0.07875439,-0.044231135,-0.042062923,0.012178233,0.06748703,0.022210304,-3.0415913E-4,0.048470143,-0.0013028049,-0.03751923,-0.038816392,0.02003602,-0.06550319,-0.007451925,-0.019096958,-3.1732462E-4,0.044948857,0.04241036,-0.078898974,-0.066626005,-0.022554494,-0.02320558,0.0059417435,-0.04561593,-0.00171051,0.034516133,-0.06911193,-0.02603468,0.032741264,0.04062847,-0.07500336,-0.045891915,-0.02394533,-0.08703012,0.07384398,0.10187541,-0.015006454,-3.4455932E-4,-0.019989625,0.118432775,-0.0155618545,0.12246442,0.020872736,0.01469029,-0.08598884,-0.027616087,0.08661326,-0.0101367915,0.029677596,0.04434131,0.0021373478,0.046509348,0.038964752,-0.022692462,0.028618796,-0.034565248,0.0059736804,-0.036419045,0.047293145,0.027894333,0.038055696,0.04343391,0.08428438,-0.04734715,0.049709883,0.017921785,-0.0041284873,0.05834521,0.075203516,0.016505465,0.016074337,-0.0027133778,-0.05