ct 1 of 2014]\n167. Idle and disorderly persons\nAny person who—\n(a) being a prostitute, behaves in a disorderly or indecent manner in any public place;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 41','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.02415728,0.017797789,-0.013465252,-0.009098522,-0.055286314,0.0035081487,0.07453788,-0.06886005,-0.013984445,-0.0104465,0.08302152,0.0035221076,0.103631824,-0.06653789,-0.0120079145,-0.010774158,-0.0036983578,-0.031492233,-0.04825663,0.06162522,1.07348205E-4,0.020039959,-0.003666654,0.031193798,-0.09430093,-0.03557446,-0.033465456,-0.053581588,-0.06853311,-0.036768932,-0.011316932,0.022359163,-0.030057399,0.033122484,-0.014272687,0.06777871,0.029535936,-0.015895143,-0.026560877,-0.0565399,-0.013507351,0.05102235,0.032436278,0.04097994,-0.04928235,0.004939803,-0.04202122,0.054044683,-0.08583552,-0.064875565,0.043757115,0.011472951,0.05295892,0.078415,-0.024365999,-0.027106686,0.021953193,-0.013522222,-0.014398514,0.028760647,0.04937387,0.028385524,-0.059016682,-0.06590229,-0.02539366,-0.051612478,0.00964539,0.040434435,0.0032247405,0.052176796,0.016933478,-0.070922956,-0.06076027,0.06916859,0.023629455,-0.06462469,-0.057312224,-0.029824581,0.020560648,-0.06874577,-0.07602573,-0.046787072,0.058669746,-0.014587278,-0.042446394,-0.019022075,-0.012772349,0.02860036,0.10459301,0.046745982,0.05579836,-0.059681363,0.14003228,-0.053869907,0.012863413,0.03336648,-0.055209562,0.02142827,-0.027873171,0.037923284,0.06602576,0.022795502,-0.02910422,0.032309514,0.071598865,0.075660504,0.008251054,-0.10538035,-0.04304368,-0.049505334,-0.05779241,0.05105698,0.030865848,-0.07938807,-0.016433442,0.008931653,-0.050010674,0.031961568,0.07391874,-0.00804645,0.05418795,0.011180746,-0.025838332,-0.03843408,-0.083782345,-0.13066335,0.049985964,-9.970134E-35,-0.06431853,0.07428853,-0.07738614,0.04020193,0.07620017,0.035473853,0.006539807,0.026630504,-0.022841437,0.015635407,0.045085963