oral or social duty to publish it to the person to whom\nthe publication is made or has a legitimate personal interest in so publishing it;\n(b) if the matter published is in fact a fair report of anything said, done or shown in a civil or criminal\ninquiry or proceeding before any court; except that if the court prohibits the publication of\nanything said or shown before it, on the ground that it is seditious, immoral or blasphemous, the\npublication thereof shall not be privileged;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 45','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.06659978,0.050090186,-0.110231094,-0.029215703,-0.0056754895,0.016391186,0.07329664,-0.016343072,-0.0013867335,0.04435402,0.06651248,0.0358897,0.050717134,0.07525899,0.009134788,9.124849E-4,0.017209982,-0.008766588,-0.12065956,0.067638636,0.081429586,0.055899326,0.016263755,0.031737763,-0.012013136,-0.04589388,-0.005838256,-0.081431374,0.04068391,-0.008776393,0.0029589096,-0.0018034045,0.001483933,0.043806396,0.0010578698,0.03843202,0.10901106,-0.038921818,0.06777462,-0.04323349,0.021995831,-0.017053027,-0.05898357,-0.1623429,0.041193113,0.002271902,0.02463391,0.09849993,-0.10667955,-0.05217065,0.02670988,-0.06053833,0.021209525,0.04490131,-0.016840242,-0.08772359,-0.0702572,-0.014166916,-0.002532969,-0.0043585617,-0.039053757,0.058021694,-0.1008793,0.024021778,0.014383334,-0.028694928,0.036383748,0.01299296,-0.07676036,0.028675314,0.06318966,-0.032206528,0.037599035,0.07107881,-0.05585774,0.023131637,0.08658681,-0.025922574,-0.019309333,-0.060173873,0.053538114,-0.0018802894,0.081814475,-0.035724826,-0.019916989,-0.08409542,0.051075432,0.039448846,0.054740652,0.04764968,0.069037125,-0.006746963,0.14925759,0.0015221253,0.013454132,-0.020657469,-0.008571107,-0.022292515,0.0036014474,0.06416809,-0.023730379,0.0054720007,-0.0491686,-0.039644282,0.08798415,-0.0033237902,0.026389677,-0.054121368,-0.052207287,0.009112415,-0.045421936,0.0