r of being a party to the murder of another, and\nthe court is satisfied that he or she was suffering from such abnormality of mind, whether arising\nfrom a condition of arrested or retarded development of mind, or any inherent causes or induced\nby disease or injury, as substantially impaired his or her mental responsibility for his or her acts\nand omissions in doing or being a party to the murder, the court shall make a special finding to the\neffect that the accused was guilty of murder but with diminished responsibility.\n(2) On a charge of murder, it shall b','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.054903552,0.062589765,-0.023789013,-0.04882574,-0.034354657,0.026973596,0.08521326,-0.03839778,0.03527231,0.09780814,0.14710379,-0.04974889,0.015537407,-0.009040703,0.007929184,-0.0098302495,0.012331219,-0.06539756,-0.07707292,0.10522677,0.09556926,0.025054691,0.048040748,-0.0098485295,-0.06294398,-0.0070064105,3.41574E-4,-0.027824666,0.034172174,-0.032649837,-1.0388634E-4,-0.029079568,0.031035729,0.07055526,-0.07185741,0.039741307,0.0794197,-0.002957584,0.014234481,-0.06963775,0.012782814,0.009492899,0.013819214,-0.10330865,-0.008871484,-0.0032589044,-0.004015222,0.06073763,-0.103633106,-0.10464556,-0.05961319,0.0060483674,0.005340256,0.06804712,-0.0023775618,-0.058553338,-0.0011017408,-0.0809634,0.04955035,0.013003774,-0.027802195,0.04476108,-0.005391174,0.012280301,-0.0344497,-0.093661234,0.013415362,0.036169212,-0.029884087,0.072063014,0.04654434,-0.066245675,0.053998098,0.011582907,-0.045745064,0.023657173,0.023595098,0.019919854,-0.007454224,-0.09623465,0.016763978,0.024678886,0.1018419,-0.034983,0.00660027,-0.07024329,-0.02651638,-0.0039906125,0.11889752,0.0417444,0.0038294934,0.03587321,0.06291201,-0.0023233679,0.039899305,-0.021124367,-0.012328773,-0.06709281,-0.06795981,0.061126437,-0.0010208858,0.058690473,-0.08295044,-0.014741178,0.03713658,0.007804649,0.048157837,-0.074022345,-0.094943196,-0.006