three years or more, attempts to commit\nmurder is liable to imprisonment for life.\n[section 205 amended by section 1(2) of Act 8 of 2007]\n206. Accessory after the fact to murder\nAny person who becomes an accessory after the fact to murder commits a felony and is liable to\nimprisonment for seven years.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 50','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.011114295,0.056086425,-0.08457147,0.007619801,0.061412074,0.046167046,0.10343798,-0.02959932,-0.030461732,0.05475606,0.1619402,0.001230664,0.02582887,0.029912349,0.029724712,-0.06463615,-0.022674523,-0.03187655,-0.10208195,0.16319522,0.06724619,0.0014582213,0.076638505,-0.013945018,-0.091869004,-0.0155226085,0.011239949,-0.03145882,-0.005889173,0.05169021,0.040619988,-0.0077446136,0.0033818542,-0.014778904,-0.026972221,0.0072804596,0.034977417,-0.027538832,-0.029279817,0.015896235,-0.009537319,-0.004670026,-0.029778888,0.025087269,-0.016940918,-0.118354894,-0.075827345,-0.04416907,-0.003185357,-0.07143616,-0.0797562,0.0017993405,-0.03600019,0.04820427,0.0014104705,-0.052796416,-0.013111074,0.07750363,-0.020864615,-0.021258697,0.008312058,0.03560274,0.041691747,-0.025675746,0.05944117,0.01371995,-5.058314E-4,-0.053492952,0.06617928,0.12750527,0.018733965,-0.0821632,-0.046142798,0.08773948,-0.08377463,0.033582926,0.027942134,-0.0032621035,-0.02124457,-0.015221045,-0.016023444,-0.019994533,0.05668717,-0.06026895,-0.014505714,0.0017454275,-0.039433148,-0.005217544,0.09666235,0.014583854,0.024476286,-0.0022705866,0.075466596,-0.0888716,0.031971026,0.0598373,-0.02595712,-0.04446964,-0.11067161,0.006679405,6.981295E-4,-0.045113333,-0.12894759,0.029356603,0.05473499,0.030642688,-0.12151469,-0.06293508,-0.046012055,-0.015104005,-0.0013933197,0.05121248,0.023382548,-0.030117918,0.03630571,0.08229429,-0.047657266,0.038509544,0.06299555,0.006995459,0.031412605,0.03295528,0.034312114,0.04851338,-0.02472158,-0.047116727,-0