uses the safety of any such person\nto be endangered,\ncommits a felony and is liable to imprisonment for life.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 52','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.01227835,0.035073366,-0.074209794,0.061142426,0.08651617,0.06415051,0.11823179,0.06928216,-0.049498342,0.009770005,0.117131844,0.0032961871,8.864586E-4,0.030093582,-0.03946749,-0.002754426,0.059037734,-0.009776595,-0.10268416,0.08354812,0.0412993,0.004981757,-0.047379665,0.049754106,-0.10444671,-0.041548375,0.032893565,-0.046546627,-0.030131266,-0.008751823,-0.050893914,-0.054949578,0.010325879,0.042735696,-0.0023301619,-9.964612E-5,0.047582872,-0.039629273,0.013303614,-0.049911853,-0.05677654,-0.026934734,-0.05487114,0.031717572,-0.012597138,-0.07076059,-0.028248725,-0.048823785,-0.019900726,-0.06438107,-0.008654041,0.024390358,0.017453965,0.09614948,-0.03002407,-0.10153879,-0.057683494,0.049106073,-9.996104E-4,0.08748072,0.018053873,0.0244131,0.0013616035,-0.029185662,-0.01610324,0.0032932132,-0.028006637,0.028519886,0.09415411,0.13081585,0.052712318,-0.12598643,-0.10549774,0.03894134,-0.0024711092,-0.040547986,-0.01937317,0.031126402,-0.0060826987,0.012218729,-0.024285153,-0.025832852,0.03371861,-0.09467259,-0.015141434,0.05313429,-0.037853047,0.05970138,0.1200121,0.028970996,-0.020959891,-0.046392485,0.11611379,0.0052291555,0.023107275,-0.03668572,-0.031264417,-0.04941661,-0.004527427,0.021032432,0.02742252,0.033229735,-0.03861265,0.06663383,0.025550293,0.015917875,-0.026165623,-0.06650575,-0.018747529,-2.055141E-4,0.091691606,0.020593448,0.045367364,-0.011590713,-0.049346026,0.04859295,-0.12444542,0.03688577,9.0530084E-4,0.03293566,0.030705314,0.030030861,0.07603962,0.053970065,-0.051818457,-0.15398726,0.04503511,2.2715596E-33,-0.026265489,0.016585032,-0.06797235,-0.027496364,0.04710984,-0.010374689,-0.102407604,5.944027E-4,0.046611052,0.08097775,-0.0036386806,-0.066285245,0.057222664,0.006368985