her’s life, if the performance of the operation is reasonable, having regard to the patient’s state at\nthe time, and to all the circumstances of the case.\n225. Excess of force\nAny person authorised by law or by the consent of the person injured by him or her to use force is\ncriminally responsible for any excess, according to the nature and quality of the act which constitutes the\nexcess.\n226. Consent\nNotwithstanding section 225, consent by a person to the causing of his or her own death or his or her own\nmaim does not affect the criminal responsibility of any person by whom such death or maim is caused.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 53','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.046295952,0.091406375,-0.06227665,0.021309618,0.045519356,0.015496945,0.018564932,0.018097378,-0.0146153765,0.14596811,0.11112071,-0.023855077,0.011015952,-0.02044579,-0.045862265,-0.04535985,0.08057869,-0.045294397,-0.11300192,0.11013838,0.025078831,0.030785317,0.11123604,0.030905684,-0.09435922,0.0025992435,-0.009683927,-0.024670795,0.083704405,-0.018175079,0.024762463,-0.0053918906,0.039680343,-0.01420493,-0.06572325,0.011262717,0.029502627,-0.04014547,-0.0048652976,0.037965786,0.08476934,0.0040527554,-0.017998233,0.031749,0.07179353,0.032768793,-0.022958755,0.012515796,-0.023925912,-0.023784654,-0.048071187,-0.03358601,-0.032373786,0.08407778,-0.07890608,-0.15776587,0.035250027,-0.038154796,-0.008042734,-0.028967293,-0.057017278,0.07315915,4.3984334E-4,-8.2108343E-4,0.027962046,-0.057806287,0.08525911,-0.0211992,-0.014320196,0.115187354,0.07603644,-0.06217009,0.026518984,0.049474537,-0.039891623,0.016417537,0.0049123405,0.0026450546,-0.027505677,-0.05466183,0.014385701,0.009967262,0.072698206,-0.03759829,-0.0028718126,-0.058431637,-0.011021909,-0.04907727,0.11958966,0.024533156,9.844921E-4,0.0060855513,0.124783024,-0.01811685,0.003511211,0.011384635,-0.074717075,-0.061753135,-0.109138295,-0.03873149,