ucts any person engaged in the lawful execution of process, or in making a\nlawful distress, with intent to rescue any property lawfully taken under such process or distress; or\n(e) assaults any person on account of any act done by him or her in the execution of any duty imposed\non him or her by law,\ncommits a misdemeanour.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 55','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.10043476,0.08084642,-0.063478105,0.007851921,0.008672753,0.030755209,0.043426722,0.0036902628,-0.002766583,0.10566993,0.107933186,-0.029767774,0.04830381,-0.062567025,-0.0714578,-0.059941262,0.030736022,0.06758062,-0.02798878,0.038181476,0.022437777,0.009889988,0.0018368463,0.0041988315,-0.08528188,6.105727E-4,-0.015887091,-0.021591522,0.049600586,-0.038598206,0.04531896,-0.008545694,0.0027687142,0.08164704,-0.020189054,-0.020475706,0.08294308,-0.021064825,0.058717392,0.0046880124,0.07509178,-0.04063271,-0.0028649878,-0.037122007,0.016109943,0.008837443,-0.0679156,0.032518595,-0.068910666,-0.1023733,-0.042922642,-0.010986519,-0.03662817,0.102103956,-0.017104931,-0.09702107,-0.0033616726,-0.011344758,0.09637544,-0.045345534,0.043017462,0.041108545,-0.056062337,0.04932656,-0.0020135434,-0.034030475,0.008662376,0.013559662,0.009206868,0.11381695,0.019907614,-0.12633574,-0.063288294,0.062602974,-0.035955686,0.02277982,0.01092707,-0.02935281,-0.03172349,-0.07556574,-0.0075685577,0.066915214,0.029492982,0.0032567938,0.01517793,-0.054491892,-0.012533321,-0.0061140666,0.14804618,-0.03564578,5.245861E-4,-0.004655413,0.08963409,-0.02229346,0.04127455,-0.015381802,0.01199617,-0.04627181,-0.07420413,0.082372524,0.0020439897,-0.028708769,-0.08059659,0.016808016,-0.05217347,-0.07058873,-3.5593045E-4,-0.06197772,-0.03500057,-0.012923409,-0.069793686,-0.008081351,-0.07598648,-0.07385216,0.026447827,0.04612973,-0.00930142,0.030097919,0.015882418,-0.0046306183,0.01700209,-0.009635709,-0.038872052,-0.023975