or threatens to use a deadly weapon or causes death or grievous\nharm to any person;\n(b) organises the stealing of the animals mentioned in paragraph (a) of this subsection in the\nmanner provided in that paragraph; or\n(c) without lawful excuse or authority, the proof of which shall be on him or her, is found in\npossession of any of the animals mentioned in paragraph (a) of this subsection which is\nproved to have been stolen in the manner provided in that paragraph,\ncommits an offence termed cattle rustling and is liable on conviction to imprisonment for life.\n(2) In this section, “deadly weapon” has the meaning assigned to it under section 286.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 60','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.06722729,0.09790698,0.042404074,0.0335007,0.089180276,0.010357771,0.054495662,0.021498404,0.0123607945,0.012990339,0.0920598,-0.037870917,0.057955876,-0.029506702,0.01517401,-0.018944623,-0.011124384,-0.030157523,-0.033047162,0.018148521,0.073012926,0.03991976,0.013988268,0.0050901365,-0.026390625,-0.038936682,-0.0139646055,0.091962226,-0.029497072,0.00480975,-0.026627189,-0.04120659,0.015065493,0.04760132,-0.055224087,0.0065140724,0.09856099,-0.1090203,0.042843398,0.036614694,0.007168118,-0.0527621,-0.055886634,0.0074861073,-0.027742378,-0.0038890063,-0.060318008,0.01336451,-0.023781765,-0.04855919,-0.05042672,0.011843898,-0.012124054,0.100789286,0.0023498961,-0.09081371,-0.025155745,-0.015387284,0.062620096,-0.013077268,0.017577736,0.1018701,0.057235546,0.021369401,0.0105202,-0.10480122,0.020638099,0.0012853314,0.008515548,0.04502976,0.032856613,-0.068111375,-0.07304771,0.022945413,-0.052721035,-0.0041282233,0.007896314,0.06525797,0.05326196,-0.11588645,-0.03217739,0.04443538,0.033271175,-0.07601931,0.0055198935,-0.021620195,-0.05015439,-3.218905E-4,0.0057749925,-0.058541548,-0.04519713,-0.08751146,0.07707988,-0.008254621,0.051626932,-0.05676666,0.005499177,0.02