ny such offence or on the disposal of any property of the accused person or the suspected person\nor a person associated with the offence or the suspected person for the purpose of ensuring the\npayment of compensation to any victim of the offence or otherwise for the purpose of preventing\nthe dissipation of any monies or other properties derived from or related to the offence.\n(2) For the purposes of this section, the restriction on the operation of any bank account or dis','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.028151028,0.06507973,-0.019458132,-0.07286996,-0.01634884,-7.076925E-4,0.04434345,-0.02645141,0.003947856,0.072868414,0.09705192,-0.023067713,0.052327894,-0.020070232,0.012620909,-0.05247302,-0.052048985,0.0026092841,-0.0079554105,0.065686144,0.13434322,-0.024188502,0.009851102,-0.015560207,8.1747567E-4,0.006792917,-0.035303153,-0.014135052,-0.011137611,-0.07559901,0.07171621,-0.016017484,0.033939265,0.017893292,0.0047466536,0.013505494,0.053244993,-0.02245781,0.021866973,-0.039755553,0.027255856,-0.0424896,0.019176243,-0.12121898,6.6660315E-4,-0.02194152,0.04332518,0.03650933,-0.0676487,-0.03672279,-0.010853528,0.02629493,0.019523744,0.06712058,-0.036577087,-0.122278996,0.025945336,0.018803528,0.0515255,-0.0151763465,0.050930977,0.08495712,-0.03697277,-0.03475695,0.015970217,-0.071720995,-0.015076394,-0.013279407,0.010604471,0.06776531,0.06686439,-0.08999043,-0.018674204,-0.0232725,-0.03318946,0.047609475,-0.007647157,0.03327747,-0.025728248,-0.07896902,0.0068412945,0.02859,0.07449924,-0.034847025,0.0032406158,-0.035495516,-0.06329936,0.039010737,0.074207656,-0.06335353,0.042785414,-0.008421619,0.100632355,0.011665463,0.056251995,-0.06795203,-0.0027151122,0.0049174353,0.033640277,0.034032047,-0.001915987,0.04239524,-0.035963953,-0.023229713,0.12069325,0.0021939047,0.119655505,0.020347001,-0.014158296,-0.02945055,-0.0021198872,0.0830235,-0.010746406,0.0028248702,0.07037667,0.016771464,-0.06471964