ailway works\nAny person who—\n(a) wilfully damages, injures or obstructs any work, way, road, building, turnstile, gate, toll bar,\nfence, weighing machine, engine, tender, carriage, wagon, truck, material or plant, acquired for or\nbelonging to any railway works;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 77','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.04270748,0.09667708,0.06819759,0.021469854,0.004346539,-0.054749902,0.0035471942,-0.012655944,-0.016669437,0.029237082,0.06487227,-0.043427043,0.03331309,-0.0010442982,-0.06719525,-2.9081004E-4,-0.036579937,0.015808625,-0.0368763,0.10623567,0.0832345,0.03648815,-0.054812364,-0.0030632364,0.0058078323,-0.012079873,-0.04862381,0.03450933,0.008238804,-0.043109734,-0.003919652,0.010277003,-0.022811936,0.054383002,0.07926486,0.022009352,0.04281538,0.0076989704,0.046900388,-0.072813414,-0.0143078165,-0.0018626023,-0.046500217,-0.0027628362,0.021359665,0.028785354,0.028269654,0.026756886,-0.056014616,-0.010848485,0.028333835,-0.014911419,-0.0098931845,0.07427506,-0.029624533,-0.06975606,-0.0030326394,0.05160043,-0.04440491,0.0063502965,0.047591448,0.02977959,0.005724345,-0.007977057,0.028498262,-0.0345419,5.9891096E-4,-0.07985137,0.024619944,0.11583262,0.055764787,-0.06483143,-0.037683625,-0.041991826,0.015930371,0.042816345,-0.072827585,0.04522161,-0.005694003,-0.12545595,-0.018346727,0.01250013,0.034196015,-0.04946348,0.025960824,-0.07670136,-0.045314066,-0.005080355,0.13541871,0.00921505,0.033499565,-0.0353498,0.0319944,0.010317713,0.07062467,-0.03331298,-0.010506062,-0.033851538,-0.05551565,0.113721214,-0.006846029,0.007583782,-0.09377624,0.0037249872,0.014108913,-0.008427529,-0.07325148,-0.02149044,-0.062499944,-0.042874284,0.042887334,-0.0013680882,0.07031584,0.020821435,-0.015524187,0.010500522,0.0148303425,0.054354582,0.039904855,-1.8528921E-5,0.05068357,0.0036896425,-0.038664203,-0.028587705,-0.03504351,-0.10116717,0.048483927,7.932127E-34,0.030065