e;\n(b) “counterfeit coin” means a coin not genuine but resembling or apparently intended to resemble or\npass for a genuine coin, and includes a genuine coin prepared or altered so as to pass for a coin of a\nhigher denomination.\n363. Counterfeiting coin\nAny person who makes or begins to make any counterfeit coin commits a felony and is liable to\nimprisonment for life.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 81','a3c38d59354eaa9fbab7ca0a06d78b5091df54b62bee5a04def9ec8a45bf8770','Penal Code Act','General','[-0.084218726,0.08577753,-0.073966436,-0.046346158,-0.021623025,-0.0073105698,0.0541664,-0.016646843,0.03845481,0.030348249,0.050029982,-0.032118015,0.04747527,-0.014886729,-0.0053785387,-0.07127498,-0.039973475,-0.036779955,-0.018317092,0.068742365,0.06834752,-0.03231502,0.012026535,0.017841231,-0.0015240021,0.08480398,-0.011646772,0.011803452,-0.005108279,0.0030894119,0.020678166,0.08985642,-0.021488566,-0.025934309,-0.038743537,-0.03589272,0.020790594,0.06655716,0.060324013,-0.08389012,0.035255406,-0.080596805,-0.013150848,-0.0913312,0.010556329,0.004853718,-0.0025630547,0.07508984,-0.06407946,-0.02830994,0.055774655,-0.025012553,0.012593929,0.057135027,-0.038123805,-0.08407946,-0.0105172,0.044963587,0.025974145,0.013542529,0.04976423,0.04728911,-0.019683411,0.0026640336,0.023862807,0.012350691,-0.004877692,-0.016021915,-2.4203565E-4,0.05215144,0.099299684,-0.09131535,0.014543042,0.03705845,-0.0606294,-0.003350327,0.09490214,-0.027745662,-0.03135214,-0.04050279,-0.04438596,0.017549412,0.08603213,-0.09930461,0.011353003,-0.06572681,-0.08873274,0.04335875,0.042795446,-0.09952682,-0.008517027,0.015495805,0.10823265,-0.008157941,0.08532082,-0.015100287,0.033746287,0.044785798,0.041283824,-0.0015112207,0.0060046194,-0.017832575,-0.053328495,0.020207185,0.11695731,0.05934836,-0.039885208,0.0035481607,2.1608209E-4,-5.9924758E-5,0.0087587265,0.0715168,0.065953895,0.0025953709,-0.021439688,0.049618967,-0.091961384,0.024841283,-0.035491064,0.053164683,0