ns of police officers above the\nrank of assistant superintendent of police;\n(d) to determine the terms and conditions of service in the force;\n(e) to hear and determine appeals from decisions of the police council;\n(f) to determine, by statutory order, the ranks, precedence, command and seniority of the force;\n(g) to empower the force to perform the services of a military force.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 4','7fb225a86eeeb778016f2e266ca51c84753f2e5c72cfae7a53cf6a3117a6330c','Police Act','General','[-0.090983465,0.044218067,-0.022268333,-0.0038324362,0.013748965,0.03679231,-0.0287525,-0.029876541,-0.025934339,0.12365992,0.026931355,-0.049229935,-0.001999697,-0.018644841,-0.023992566,-0.037467863,0.037227698,-0.05160361,-0.1279148,0.047183268,0.06419209,9.030585E-4,0.0742684,-0.020189991,-0.1782302,-0.030862521,-0.095932074,-0.050836604,-0.026829194,-0.06709795,0.048820265,0.014647701,0.11714573,0.024053581,-0.059769336,0.0058408743,0.11047935,-0.018423572,0.08195085,0.049417637,0.059566382,-0.02243999,0.0053435164,-0.016667958,0.043783896,0.02911242,0.10223523,0.02586681,-0.07215176,-0.019925596,0.01044632,-0.0014891053,-0.08047153,0.011960316,0.015706241,-0.06644947,-0.012952876,-0.07990212,0.06211975,-0.00558376,-0.04609229,0.033994805,-0.068383925,0.04961314,0.05020504,-0.11611244,-0.017823637,-0.020008031,-0.05320289,0.040534053,-0.014017113,-0.0637993,0.026642185,0.0436086,-0.0138483755,0.045063213,0.05335023,0.021672212,-0.008069046,-0.093610145,0.043979406,0.05286711,0.08457359,0.03182001,0.015981909,-0.01951291,-0.0459015,-0.09767936,0.036181018,0.0044702967,0.065573975,9.6719444E-4,0.055437267,-0.0018276458,0.001579916,-0.006618451,0.019877091,-0.039088387,-0.043259557,0.024618553,-0.009335559,-0.045908768,-0.06300927,-0.03180486,-0.086442925,0.011059409,-0.05223378,-0.009412371,-0.024249757,0.04839007,-0.046623696,-0.010624206,-0.09724367,-0.013983321,0.055528566,-0.011426207,-0.08555143,0.022387695,0.021608815,0.0109793935,