obey all lawful directions in respect of the execution of his or her office issued by a\ncompetent authority;\n(c) be taken to be on duty at all times;\n(d) be willing to serve in any station to which he or she may be assigned;\n(e) promptly obey and execute an order or a warrant lawfully issued by a competent authority;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 8','7fb225a86eeeb778016f2e266ca51c84753f2e5c72cfae7a53cf6a3117a6330c','Police Act','General','[-0.063343145,0.091851175,-0.0066121076,-0.020193882,-0.032951556,-0.010717262,0.0319699,-0.031379294,-0.09522977,0.1045176,0.045213263,-0.02684839,-0.009097563,-0.011227615,0.016690053,-0.07185104,0.082303144,-0.02212327,-0.16556057,0.05998125,0.07629537,-0.0028966076,0.024679227,0.019370658,-0.091957375,-0.035691626,-0.0895236,-0.0049790638,0.03042336,-0.03934331,0.04640015,-0.0014894386,0.07891959,0.063067496,-0.053034753,0.048986923,0.066096514,-0.03246808,0.07930793,0.039026756,0.052343257,-0.05458463,-0.009368707,-0.005722443,0.024712242,0.009393475,0.066596836,0.01616745,-0.0812375,-0.038454905,-0.008526938,0.021542026,-0.06926065,0.03264744,-0.009423782,-0.06559434,0.009807184,-0.100006446,0.048751388,-0.044675227,-0.06616093,0.013031398,-0.030961083,0.022312842,0.055354275,-0.098164506,0.01892317,-0.054599088,-0.038225137,0.031798087,-0.03346047,-0.039382447,-0.033396047,0.11227609,-0.035110246,-0.01912942,0.04750912,-0.036765505,0.023125546,-0.06355874,0.036083072,0.02954496,0.031336278,0.04622106,4.19072E-4,-0.06963551,-0.0054806583,-0.036777306,0.097023964,-0.018203856,0.015104465,0.040865626,0.08904703,-0.015795117,-0.023370594,-0.04550964,0.030800298,-0.03363545,-0.06721683,0.048426006,0.01627605,-0.04600239,-0.04671392,0.010435366,-0.072633505,0.04015588,0.0026378771,-0.0027232412,-0.056223765,0.06817147,-0.041880235,0.01928334,-0.07467925,-0.03764667,0.046048395,0.043559358,-0.09647476,0.08168868,-0.01072733,4.3270882E-4,-0.014886975,-0.00830226,0.050530244,-0.033884272,0.047787704,-0.01