the rank of corporal to make\nthe search; and he or she shall deliver to that officer an order in writing specifying the place to\nbe searched and, so far as possible, the thing for which search is to be made, and that officer may\nthereupon search for that thing in that place.\n(4) The provisions of the Magistrates Courts Act as to search warrants shall, so far as may be, apply to a\nsearch made under this section.\n(5) Copies of any record made under subsection (1) or (3) shall immediately be sent to the nearest\nmagistrate empowered to','7fb225a86eeeb778016f2e266ca51c84753f2e5c72cfae7a53cf6a3117a6330c','Police Act','General','[-0.085350774,0.015588747,-0.033449356,-0.011427587,0.042935465,0.054225482,0.01990875,-0.008938371,-0.008435577,0.007865497,0.13345078,0.05629352,0.010116943,-0.034037426,-0.014854465,0.011650079,0.021955851,-0.02480235,-0.03556892,0.06972012,0.07274873,-0.024245726,-0.015250672,-0.027716221,-0.08130616,-0.0411054,-0.0063078566,-0.067083016,0.053687226,0.022277245,0.06925929,0.049054466,0.045865454,0.10654055,0.06313146,-5.3235015E-4,-0.00854144,-0.053278223,0.0472824,-0.016061205,-0.07109949,-0.08105034,0.0062468275,0.012432504,0.0036188262,-0.01921464,0.022469748,-0.008246744,-0.08178266,-0.087897256,-0.072011,0.04176905,-0.05438478,-0.02430588,-0.10163732,-0.08715187,0.022028815,-0.024078652,0.03274042,-0.03778295,-6.897482E-4,0.10872438,-0.012562104,-0.0046387296,0.041315813,-0.0026972585,-0.017550157,-0.023104036,0.07732614,0.048840426,0.013343377,0.019396298,-0.039368097,0.093521185,0.031863146,-0.053626824,0.020864286,-0.06645648,-0.014037079,-0.10277457,-0.0076007443,0.04389306,-0.042220253,0.012923423,-0.07497952,-0.050284825,-0.023268484,0.020496365,0.10438594,-0.029483143,0.049646758,-0.07232508,-0.07696864,-0.06454971,0.021880925,0.0027790105,-0.036712885,0.0077845016,0.037841346,-0.021848446,0.048993617,0.07806438,-0.049543887,-0.049333885,-0.060632747,0.01246529,0.030224362,-0.036267474,0.00908732,-0.05292903,0.04118697,1.5011