 or not, for amplifying, broadcasting or reproducing\nany music or speech or any other sound.\n(2) For the purposes of this section, a “public place” includes any highway, public park or garden,\npublic bridge, road, lane, footway, square, court, alley or passage whether a thoroughfare or not\nand any open space to which, for the time being, the public have or are permitted to have access by\npayment or otherwise.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 14','7fb225a86eeeb778016f2e266ca51c84753f2e5c72cfae7a53cf6a3117a6330c','Police Act','General','[-0.026500916,0.006868582,0.015077367,-0.08647618,-0.02060351,0.037081532,0.04440621,-0.0465147,-0.005725433,-0.007202834,0.07611579,-2.9559576E-4,0.037379663,-0.057053424,0.05353293,-0.023731964,0.06094744,-0.026459586,-0.007999774,0.052256,0.12277515,0.1074896,-0.013066875,-0.0023197553,-0.10279762,-0.01677055,-0.0026069945,0.08205974,0.059140302,-0.05925287,0.089900896,0.020549487,0.13706914,-0.0072639645,0.013857815,-0.013817839,0.084142655,-0.04586135,0.0022469887,0.0070380536,0.005646098,-0.0790707,-0.03338427,-0.0037334203,-2.449431E-4,-0.008877241,0.068765596,0.010817601,-0.020346735,-0.16468844,0.03982653,-0.0076313345,0.032071944,0.004865035,-0.08317305,-0.0825258,-0.03187333,0.038866073,0.0027040106,0.015367324,-0.049931437,-0.005250529,-0.016153812,0.009827781,0.02167045,0.0032401262,-0.034220472,-0.0136928335,0.083525285,0.036092553,-0.0016386396,0.057336483,0.004031831,0.04319313,-0.08234836,-0.019929076,-0.04044822,-0.047543567,0.035605326,-0.025873253,-0.012305288,0.046955694,0.042798657,-0.033964522,-0.048530363,-0.04203338,-0.068660595,0.052893918,0.016430551,-0.049126126,-0.023226669,-0.004518345,0.065446146,0.005215851,0.029451042,-0.03202041,0.01949106,-0.066649646,-0.02554517,0.058614083,-0.02977102,0.08290306,-0.045121703,0.02116928,0.07526859,-0.0071621677,-0.03675184,0.03310576,-0.07737188,0.067818806,0.09486572,-0.06164851,0.008527593,-0.08731983,0.050114457,0.05309866,-0.048253264,-