edience to a warrant issued by a court of\ncompetent jurisdiction.\n(2) In a suit instituted against a police officer for an act referred to in subsection (1), the court shall\nenter judgment in favour of that police officer—\n(a) on the production of a warrant containing the seal of a court of competent jurisdiction\ntogether with the signature of a judge, magistrate or registrar of a court; and\n(b) on proof that the act complained of was done in','7fb225a86eeeb778016f2e266ca51c84753f2e5c72cfae7a53cf6a3117a6330c','Police Act','General','[-0.04629298,0.061595622,0.03536518,-0.010246337,-0.017032623,-0.04979178,-0.014008899,-0.016226161,-0.0069756717,0.06859705,0.11883978,-0.01523442,0.043047164,-0.043050688,-0.0027415715,-0.006219524,-0.00865532,-0.033156194,-0.053910673,0.08065879,0.078593716,0.053817645,0.019753728,-0.0049009,3.983203E-4,0.026066799,-0.02088017,-0.03784646,0.053399127,-0.07629878,0.052642375,0.044905458,0.010649451,0.010800367,0.0057347063,0.049666036,0.08939389,-0.066991955,0.04558704,-0.03977651,0.074282624,-0.03427717,-0.016183069,-0.102161005,8.696314E-4,0.020442698,0.08386049,0.050902393,-0.055184476,-0.017125545,0.015125939,-0.05859893,0.024506329,0.08649312,-0.03564361,-7.854008E-4,0.043200806,-0.018089345,0.032912422,0.013674639,0.053643838,0.039795127,-0.0688871,-0.04168378,0.045741986,-0.112677716,0.028299969,-0.03933208,-0.024768874,0.039394617,0.16379221,-0.06059827,0.034988552,0.012787676,-0.07042893,0.016109757,0.046235986,-0.06591953,-0.040597394,-0.057281595,-0.047712315,0.013160943,0.0598682,-0.10816304,0.01864599,-0.079043366,0.0051107253,0.056041323,0.10144229,-0.052587427,0.056352492,0.015541371,-0.039051753,-0.01826332,-0.009747932,-0.040757928,0.06018806,0.018039837,0.011702825,0.047821753,0.026353775,0.031545434,-0.032734264,-0.017401837,0.046195038,-0.04897243,0.0026876628,0.06289536,-0.022203645,0.009375853,-0.06913172,-0.01866262,-0.0021274313,0.07829981,0.038662873,0.05045164,-0.03401954,0.022186335,-0.016999368,-0.0772