cers;\n(c) a force political officer;\n(d) a police legal officer;\n(e) two other members appointed by the chairperson of the police council.\n(2) The quorum of the police council appeals court shall be five members, including the chairperson.\n(3) The police council appeals court shall be the highest appellate','7fb225a86eeeb778016f2e266ca51c84753f2e5c72cfae7a53cf6a3117a6330c','Police Act','General','[-0.042972434,0.050480954,-6.9592317E-4,-0.0772122,-0.042581547,0.013619536,0.0045731245,-0.05519106,-0.028373422,0.10842925,0.0646018,-0.073554024,0.0054275105,0.0038767778,0.020552292,-0.030991979,0.0135827,0.016194122,-0.08406135,0.047708254,0.091482505,0.016709134,0.075914994,-0.030472748,-0.13942459,-0.0612054,-0.059217937,-0.039956756,0.002599196,-0.08115528,-0.021746635,-0.013975727,0.047458496,0.02811058,-0.0994973,-0.013037392,0.12209256,-0.01573507,0.05158643,-0.04536341,0.041621782,-0.005865976,0.030123798,-0.0956475,0.018072799,-0.011737018,0.061805964,-0.025620705,-0.11737511,-0.08712175,-0.03748496,-0.015550947,0.010699877,0.09740187,-0.05139835,-0.058683846,0.018827474,-0.026092455,0.09086499,0.00360679,-0.06819337,0.016832836,-0.059800997,0.010322436,0.008225319,-0.11106783,0.01767024,-0.014494447,0.02541865,0.029628444,0.07505956,-0.08347184,0.035547618,0.017201873,-0.045709543,0.06873685,-0.008299856,0.0078899,0.05076052,-0.025648177,0.017671818,-0.0016315769,0.0965823,0.0068433858,0.067785844,-0.053456336,-0.016025925,0.006858497,0.03247446,-0.014803019,0.06700398,0.051654167,0.057447843,-0.019406416,0.025812395,-0.012583138,0.05164486,-0.030809782,-0.0044916323,0.020180957,0.011526191,-0.017665135,-0.095035166,-0.002116169,0.07777419,0.050821908,0.030435676,-0.043620218,-0.04626618,-0.0056864447,-0.067917325,0.029086852,-0.07202369,-0.008896094,0.07989981,0.03392188,-0.018678961,0.056102797,0.0057478854,-0.022109365,-0.019836865,0.028665412,-0.020960374,-0.07107107,0.03685883,0.011356951,0.0027180917,5.828888E-34,0.035545323,0.020369262,-0.080539435