ections\n(1) and (2).\n(4) Any person who assists, procures, persuades or attempts to assist, procure or persuade another\nto desert the force commits an offence and is liable on conviction to the same punishment as the\ndeserter.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 20','7fb225a86eeeb778016f2e266ca51c84753f2e5c72cfae7a53cf6a3117a6330c','Police Act','General','[0.008516064,0.007188148,-0.012732448,0.07154273,0.035069868,0.078674905,0.026502771,-0.1307033,0.01930618,0.0148878265,0.1821934,-0.063893065,0.049243275,-0.026443291,0.026965946,-0.09729078,0.012597604,-0.05174009,-0.065999165,0.014976461,0.06861772,-0.0452855,0.03250836,0.061658766,-0.08662709,-0.045443427,-0.031248724,-0.050964333,-0.008467998,-0.04609524,-0.0051967204,0.001523453,0.038238954,0.021886498,0.027482929,0.05228549,0.09132594,-0.02316219,-0.05315428,0.0037340617,-0.006070351,0.009932627,-0.0036680643,0.015148559,0.026615057,-0.06254982,0.024917793,-0.04352672,-2.503606E-5,-0.072602145,0.0037631958,0.06598164,-0.009956753,0.07676201,-0.044921305,-0.0388466,0.01869821,-0.032159872,0.011465893,-0.046111353,0.00590014,0.040195428,0.011085094,-0.015572087,0.05326065,-0.032668337,-0.029966274,-0.03856537,0.052775044,0.08283528,-0.034214783,-0.048155073,-0.05612785,0.053314652,-0.038146995,0.0039062481,0.014638275,0.047677472,0.015539879,-0.07037892,-0.007664454,0.095746756,0.010002065,0.0024714533,-0.03108652,-0.0696602,-0.04132926,0.031452738,0.14216755,-0.0049338383,0.023309316,-3.740517E-4,0.02494054,-0.046257023,0.04549489,-0.06073402,0.021350373,-0.011512772,-0.010458873,0.041381355,0.016128393,-0.0040490073,-0.07356893,-0.024219682,0.0055227145,0.040756058,-0.021565596,-0.07489544,-0.11705514,0.0104744695,0.038317017,-0.008816789,-0.036169015,-0.012341034,0.08269983,0.09940883,-0.10002127,-3.6652003E-5,-0.023989426,-0.0118939895,-0.012706625,0.038629167,0.08023054,0.020169996,-0.03634336,-0.04839199,0.025269449,6.419974E-33,-0.01727749,-0.030293733,-0.083124064,-0.024755985,0.