er; or\n(c) fails to use utmost exertion to avert any danger to himself or herself or others whom he or she is\ncharged to protect.\n28. Penalty for disciplinary offences\n(1) Where no penalty for any offence is provided in this code, a police court may impose one or more of\nthe following punishments in accordance with this Act—\n(a) dismissal;\n(b) discharge since the police officer has ceased to be or is unlikely to become efficient;\n(c) demotion or reduction in rank;\n(d) stoppage, withholding or deferment of increment in salary scale;\n(e) fine not exceeding one-third of the defaulter’s salary;\n(f) recovery of the cost or part of the cost of any loss or damage caused by default or negligence;\n(g) imprisonment in police custody;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 30','7fb225a86eeeb778016f2e266ca51c84753f2e5c72cfae7a53cf6a3117a6330c','Police Act','General','[-0.0749771,0.092550576,-0.069417626,0.036539156,0.10036417,0.07130844,0.055260163,0.014943131,0.026835827,0.09750287,0.13817522,-0.09096302,0.046094377,-0.011988801,-0.034309074,-0.0748353,-0.012043813,0.024994113,-0.1275476,-0.020324925,0.049647827,-0.019052548,0.007467393,0.052440405,-0.059515625,-0.026651751,-0.020396242,-0.005501676,0.036477488,-0.033787988,0.024178278,0.004730388,0.011036373,0.011314524,-0.047083706,-0.050228123,0.03829258,-0.008980602,0.0029016803,0.0026414085,0.09905424,-1.01862846E-4,-0.052854627,-0.07109144,0.01964616,0.003291031,0.023210451,0.062927045,-0.087040655,-0.07841207,-0.022193406,0.027115688,-0.062595345,0.05473995,-0.02493886,-0.11654382,0.0073159533,-0.056766264,0.030038338,0.010643833,-0.046372935,0.020608913,-0.0132414475,-5.0673855E-4,0.00945522,-0.07037191,0.019059721,-0.004024405,0.013115484,0.15051846,-0.006418499,-0.12288577,-0.009914121,-0.0014988772,-0.063196704,0.03907231,0.006255332,0.014146944,-0.023380866,0.014075034,0.02141741,-0.05806186,0.050340798,-0.030489089,-0.029214373,-0.109406106,0.02427557,-0.02695115,0.14462996,-0.010737915