 “insane”; to provide for the duration \nof probate and letters of administration and execution of wills of \ndeceased persons; to enhance penalties for certain offences and to \nprescribe penalties for contravention of the Act; and to provide \nfor related matters. \nDare oF Assent: 10th April, 2022 \nDate of Commencement: 31st May, 2022 \nBE IT ENACTED by Parliament as follows— \n5','3f4ecb051c61361609a3d1589bada489dbe63ee5cc0527792039f65db89d3202','Succession (Amendment) Act, 2022','General','[-0.05437237,-0.0240899,0.026777482,-0.13154534,-0.032985605,0.06199237,-0.10536274,-0.022112418,-0.0031164074,0.06409,0.026898392,0.046682045,-0.017921703,-0.030368268,0.032527477,0.023137504,-0.042571105,0.01917959,-0.050805032,0.09900754,0.14850593,0.022520266,0.011544924,0.036093645,-0.026458949,-0.026260355,-0.032756016,-0.042890046,0.023594463,0.0033628775,0.045095984,-0.0052871695,-0.026351523,0.0077977777,-0.042197727,-0.054757025,0.03395027,-0.028210325,0.003122344,-0.052884378,0.033121582,-0.04298347,-0.014546244,0.008764126,0.049392637,0.020016195,-0.07073859,-0.040166967,-0.014214773,-0.027621668,-0.025658747,-0.026050625,0.04938872,0.10230785,-0.040612955,-0.011972762,0.018356692,-0.07546309,0.020130362,0.0016718197,-0.0036238825,0.012925491,-0.01701085,-0.08546957,-0.030120065,-0.011517068,0.05046049,-0.042557877,0.0028271268,0.061429385,-0.07459956,-0.0077969157,0.039703656,0.091225974,-0.082724094,-0.014225482,0.0020632315,0.07965433,-0.071516715,-0.1310832,-0.030809289,-0.004147254,0.06653281,-0.02478012,-0.009488734,-0.049998637,-0.057566352,-0.06005921,1.023548E-4,0.07486782,-0.03710546,-0.056380577,0.10353344,0.031008534,0.0050040553,0.050362114,0.005404125,-0.08585221,0.07804533,0.0029599608,-0.057353098,0.029555764,-0.033946257,-0.04128006,-0.048258476,-0.020118492,-0.07861127,-0.08582269,-0.0112295775,-0.03778278,-0.022291305,-0.07598816,0.0011289393,-0.009789631,0.02468902,0.09801704,0.0025869706,0.023685778,0.0955232,-0.06424055,0.0797991,0.0890154,-