the lineal descendants shall receive 75 percent: \nand \n(iv) the customary heir shall receive 1 per cent: \nof the whole of the property of the intestate. \n(b) \n(c) \nwhere the intestate leaves no surviving spouse or \ndependent relative under paragraph (a) (i) or (ii) \ncapable of taking a proportion of his or her property \nthe— \n(i) lineal descendants shall receive 99 percent: \nand \n(ii) | customary heir shall receive | percent;” \nwhere the intestate is survived by a spouse. a \ndependent relative and a customary heir but no lineal \ndescendant— \n(i) the spouse shall receive 50 percent; \n12','3f4ecb051c61361609a3d1589bada489dbe63ee5cc0527792039f65db89d3202','Succession (Amendment) Act, 2022','General','[-0.030362707,1.2225032E-4,0.006405998,-0.11496276,-0.042171307,-0.019639526,-0.027385017,0.04038445,-0.041065242,0.04603857,0.0650643,-0.03930747,0.03609271,-0.030228443,0.0012556977,0.04610028,0.008322934,0.040742315,-0.15040483,0.087451674,0.08020088,-0.0059323427,0.032862585,0.003394506,0.0553278,-0.03497922,-0.018919142,-0.018937238,0.08681661,-0.052215014,-0.020747067,-0.05603452,0.028588193,0.020518431,-0.008947915,-0.041693248,0.032869257,-0.03615512,0.023431199,0.061657894,0.03665794,0.04164827,0.015581408,0.060224485,0.016336376,0.016014457,-0.09854748,-0.054441307,0.0135928085,0.08046304,-0.021257505,0.029056948,0.04827903,0.20852922,-0.037902646,0.0011169523,0.0368681,-0.07126883,-0.05400749,-0.040127873,0.028844832,0.058641024,-0.0070259906,-0.088861294,-0.038561933,-0.07125509,0.04950084,-0.050684907,-0.03451032,0.024420405,-0.012000304,0.001664623,-0.045789905,0.05268131,-0.056548733,-0.0035673738,0.050100382,0.05739028,-0.09905887,-0.104740046,-0.02841619,0.009169274,0.049097195,-0.06527409,-0.0049848673,-0.028533842,-0.04628935,-0.035596006,0.034193262,0.05960861,-0.0028395974,-0.020168604,0.12622745,-0.031594753,0.11579898,0.109056905,-0.040661097,-0.1379538,-0.0063410406,-0.0065186326,-0.07106092,-0.013726622,0.0074297604,0.0030247816,-0