use, lineal descendant or child may be entitled \nunder section 27.” \n17. Replacement of section 30 of principal Act \nThe principal Act is amended by substituting for section 30, the \n» following— \n“30. Separation of spouses \n(1) A Surviving spouse of an intestate shall not take \nany interest in the estate of the intestate if, at the death of the \n15','3f4ecb051c61361609a3d1589bada489dbe63ee5cc0527792039f65db89d3202','Succession (Amendment) Act, 2022','General','[-0.05031076,-0.009409457,0.02618149,-0.113276675,-0.058614057,-0.004723847,-0.01607564,-4.0415124E-4,-0.0465652,0.02849227,0.04041549,-0.05240016,0.048137493,-0.022395171,0.031596754,0.0067009856,-0.00513246,0.06695084,-0.104433015,0.08190543,0.10522403,0.008841691,-0.0032449104,0.014588856,0.06405471,-0.03023662,0.0017422594,-0.008535955,0.079911545,-0.052466244,0.055227764,-0.08625779,0.01881229,0.04914466,0.036434405,-0.044790782,0.019228436,-0.021120762,0.044734295,0.021084614,0.046361867,0.017125601,0.024613705,-0.008672526,0.0017439444,0.036234066,-0.059190307,-0.097188324,-0.004446332,0.032629725,0.020077473,0.010058447,0.047074914,0.2008139,-0.044573445,0.0044447803,0.036161475,-0.03428919,-0.04017987,-0.040212147,0.026837725,0.040934466,2.9609315E-4,-0.07480853,-0.032763496,-0.07023956,0.06729095,-0.039785907,-0.0016222137,-0.0068427376,0.0011011127,0.004353162,-0.041783217,0.07106156,-0.043631252,0.009452358,0.009408244,0.05832037,-0.07635585,-0.124346666,-0.019793756,0.022424344,0.0071355402,-0.052267373,0.0072298287,-0.025791189,-0.07028965,-0.065129355,0.014983149,0.06271782,0.033867422,-0.020394122,0.14062843,-0.01993763,0.093378596,0.0553808,-0.032289207,-0.14574304,0.033604465,0.033177875,-0.082856886,-0.0068029854,-0.02155322,0.012356638,-0.06458627,-0.016295735,-0.10646553,0.015529566,-0.033953115,-0.020368341,0.0077230916,-0.090434924,-0.010193896,0.056020025,0.0076234983,0.045660503,0.05212089,0.009576054,0.044191353,-0.123712085,0.0070826886,0.01456183,-0.03690323,0.011380904,0.0