 substituting for section 179, the \ntollowing—. \n“179. Property transferable by gift made in contemplation of \ndeath \n(1) Subject to sections 26. 29 and 36 (6). a person may \ndispose. by gift made in contemplation of death. any movable \nproperty which he or she could dispose of by will. \n(2) A gift is said to be made in contemplation of death \nwhere a person who is ill and expects to die shortly of his or her \n28 \naa\nn','3f4ecb051c61361609a3d1589bada489dbe63ee5cc0527792039f65db89d3202','Succession (Amendment) Act, 2022','General','[-0.08226084,0.062168926,0.015170035,-0.12059037,-0.056477983,0.021224633,-0.02162333,0.011852454,-0.0055255424,0.06592703,0.08017375,0.023673816,-0.006179802,-0.07160027,-0.0043137493,0.048478376,0.014828933,0.0474085,-0.082192466,0.11284783,0.13733248,0.006497336,0.022437852,0.00781534,0.03812103,0.04825358,-0.030127691,-0.0029970084,0.05474179,0.015177394,0.018529294,-0.009223351,-0.07117885,0.004937507,0.002244162,0.021225996,0.048861623,-0.0037469175,0.0018908705,-0.013553365,0.030281926,0.029869003,0.018671148,0.034096874,0.04471664,0.011394246,-0.04775609,-0.04919308,-0.016091952,0.01788778,0.0028315408,-0.022710528,0.04068648,0.17401272,-0.013038441,0.0022730655,0.007073463,-0.0698536,-0.03257639,-0.01706283,-0.028463027,0.025176778,-0.046330437,-0.10528551,-0.097554766,-0.047391903,0.0834865,-0.08365325,-0.008511013,0.013358885,-0.0021826315,0.02911583,0.007956111,0.09205538,-0.06478254,0.026929831,0.034102798,0.06023483,-0.08491711,-0.11714097,-0.011452789,0.013457663,0.03546459,-0.06436164,-0.024848117,0.006778011,-0.04760064,-0.066752,0.017134456,0.073305674,-0.014267944,-0.07390926,0.16044049,-0.012769858,0.026444077,0.037857328,0.0020939189,-0.115745634,0.004134341,-0.0016634344,-0.084136784,-0.02231179,-0.0015557853,0.025885945,-0.056481503,-0.021573115,-0.13740757,7.947286E-4,0.0057527926,-0.013245611,-0.03726511,-0.105010025,0.01933992,0.038826574,0.0062624197,0.048398286,0.021539925,0.007236909,0.011974419,-0.0