e \ndeceased person.” \nReplacement of section 311 of principal Act \nThe principal Act is amended by substituting for section 311, the \nfollowing— \n“311. Procedure in respect of share of minor in intestacy \n(1) Where a person entitled to a share in the distribution \nof the estate of a deceased person is a minor, the executor or \nadministrator shall deliver the share of the minor to the guardian \nof the minor. \n(2) The guardian of the minor shall manage the property \ndelivered to him or her under subsection (1) in a prudent manner \nand shall— \n44','3f4ecb051c61361609a3d1589bada489dbe63ee5cc0527792039f65db89d3202','Succession (Amendment) Act, 2022','General','[-0.028549545,0.042795278,0.015946494,-0.10172703,-0.06730176,-0.013841262,-0.057647534,-0.011228051,9.054508E-4,0.06489556,0.07806801,-0.002127678,-0.010609026,-0.05820602,-0.008913415,-0.004335159,0.02829318,0.1155411,-0.08236476,0.10270699,0.10547928,0.057794113,-0.01882004,0.04095531,0.108925134,0.022553692,-0.012097156,-0.04057598,0.0035148598,-0.056753233,0.039113656,-0.08501842,0.009034107,-0.038874365,0.06342194,0.029981622,0.0063089305,-0.018871283,-0.024494756,-0.03810109,0.010196865,0.04734381,0.016512262,-0.023297507,-0.016558615,0.030887328,-0.07814942,-0.08080659,0.054700084,0.02956254,0.023654,-0.0028759434,-0.012735587,0.17186245,-0.043826543,-0.03845256,0.030415997,-0.02473989,-0.02805511,-0.042717814,0.011185748,0.059432387,0.027040157,-0.052010953,-0.011337133,-0.06503588,0.09333848,-0.07848096,-0.0061309473,0.04989626,-0.029276151,0.007940133,0.010534072,0.05358658,-0.04686512,0.03562517,-0.010951345,0.043086275,-0.017059984,-0.08843968,-0.0022467317,0.028833596,0.032926258,-0.018789122,0.041003425,-0.0017764914,-0.056744706,-0.03510356,0.053301286,0.056641724,0.031831663,-0.004187464,0.12976308,-0.05386962,-0.003771392,0.046287782,-0.04013206,-0.09154121,0.02369131,0.023305807,-0.07597077,0.017537238,-0.0142756365,-0.052831396,0.03188336,0.030210078,-0.06509867,0.012564347,-0.02143