eceased leaves movable property in Uganda, succession to the property shall, in the absence of\nproof of any domicile elsewhere, be regulated by the laws of Uganda.\nPart III – Consanguinity\n15. Kindred or consanguinity\nKindred or consanguinity is the connection or relation of persons descended from the same stock or\ncommon ancestor.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 3','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act #U2014 Chapter 268','General','[-0.05149349,0.05398774,-0.030103505,-0.02595469,-0.037940852,-0.018434431,8.019219E-4,-0.06967365,0.009825201,0.036662195,0.10224693,0.014428107,0.053102117,-0.012670926,-0.00682696,-0.002936392,-0.020364022,0.020265525,-0.13456233,0.10246554,0.018689072,0.017981518,-0.0060935887,-0.024392141,0.055813547,-0.019710375,-0.012340558,-0.020458793,0.12591507,-0.02448734,0.04708144,0.058593966,-0.046588097,0.049263056,0.0045794626,0.02026998,-0.040866327,0.061388012,0.06497645,-0.03624761,0.024185423,-0.0471817,0.07860699,-0.070884846,-0.03662959,0.015802631,0.014959592,0.009950239,-0.03757497,-0.028465718,-0.06603165,-0.036370732,-0.010718467,0.15746072,-0.020884745,0.034792945,-0.019944146,-0.031024188,-0.039446596,0.038918063,0.03604077,0.07634607,-0.0523539,-0.052624807,0.009339083,-0.08335809,0.08368696,0.048961397,-0.009907796,0.03708059,0.12940836,-0.03163485,-0.01763304,0.09480316,-0.03999254,-6.706121E-5,0.041589875,0.009327353,-4.3900436E-4,-0.08925961,-0.06531631,0.09554772,0.06580015,-0.09151787,-0.004293308,-0.06200909,-0.032772314,-0.029927032,0.050534166,-0.0048834113,-0.042558096,0.03350853,0.12083799,-0.042851016,0.07316235,-0.025239255,0.05698934,0.0029094222,-0.011555282,0.09540728,-0.06369091,0.008240888,-0.040460955,0.026652632,0.010992075,-0.005952791,0.018550592,-0.02436409,5.150813E-4,-0.008021783,-0.05227112,-0.033500805,-0.005839571,0.019204611,0.0024256324,0.044019032,-0.04339146,-0.001005864,0.09261745,-0.08013143,-0.06281897,-0.01469779,-0.0