ed nor attested;\n(b) the will may be written wholly or in part by another person, and signed by the testator or\ntestatrix, and in that case it need not be attested;\n(c) if the instrument purporting to be a will is written wholly or in part by another person,\nand is not signed by the testator or testatrix, it shall be considered to be his or her will if\nit is shown that it was written by the directions of the testator or testatrix, or that he or\nshe recognised it as his or her will; but if it appears on the face of the instrument that the\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 14','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act #U2014 Chapter 268','General','[-0.09588755,0.06850249,-0.040310226,-0.057899103,-0.0634372,-0.0045680325,-0.005310359,-0.01591221,0.020462915,0.022792712,0.042742845,0.03934046,0.06819225,0.033892907,-0.020377144,0.028268969,-0.015212701,0.022601884,-0.0742554,0.06996451,0.08403201,0.010422755,0.020997915,-0.014151074,-0.011066603,-0.045374554,-0.02429074,-0.04778588,0.08550564,0.04696272,0.028398162,0.07474018,-0.033712756,0.012072593,0.0733212,0.018125985,0.036322847,-0.035353348,0.025152655,0.0128084775,-0.020158045,-0.040426448,-0.015752114,0.0603017,-0.0038049442,0.014672869,-0.0037546533,-6.567087E-4,-0.04046958,0.028456716,1.2778335E-4,-0.043026425,0.041449044,-0.04866794,-0.037336905,-0.0194953,-0.050220087,-0.05224882,0.005232397,-0.073786914,-0.046824645,0.015890345,-0.043256328,-0.036497362,0.0051658717,-0.030590655,0.03769054,-0.0019937814,-0.06807859,-0.039567374,-0.019002812,-0.008189175,0.06502939,0.054011945,-0.0659592,-0.014053481,0.055698704,-0.034692522,0.006640221,-0.1376539,-0.03159003,0.079003535,-0.0067173834,-0.031069098,-0.06150093,-0.023885962,0.063294016,0.039918393,0.12686127,0.10931547,0.008616152,-0.087186895,0.044910967,-0.034207687,0.059670474,-0.010352909,0.057785373,-0.035897825,-0.01995612,0.012681601,0.001850176,-0.029463606,-0.04532752,0.021625208,0.