hall be retained in\nthe form in which the testator or testatrix left it, although it may be of such a nature that its value is\ncontinually decreasing.\n131. Sale and investment of proceeds of property bequeathed to two or more persons in\nsuccession\nWhere property comprised in a bequest to two or more persons in succession is not specifically\nbequeathed, it shall, in the absence of any direction to the contrary, be sold, and the proceeds of the\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 25','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act #U2014 Chapter 268','General','[-0.059228327,0.08421978,-0.04199304,-0.031126624,-0.06638641,0.0029163437,0.0071588396,-0.008944561,0.07187834,0.08325141,0.030901784,0.021884397,0.04857872,-0.014705023,-0.023406573,-0.013631765,-0.049593274,-0.032213874,-0.070342004,0.07285526,0.10300077,0.01453942,-1.3600088E-4,0.021449294,0.05838466,-0.06275675,-0.08863497,-0.07174608,0.06380187,-0.02037188,0.020856814,0.016972115,-0.105773665,0.03845556,0.017381484,0.007417076,-0.001943284,-0.013391925,0.0037854593,-0.0020520315,0.0960334,-0.006631679,-0.024386764,-0.015241643,-0.0106417285,0.015659956,0.034241803,0.025732458,-0.06554478,-0.0029922284,0.024489587,-0.023457706,-0.00751148,0.104555756,-0.056107022,-0.047063336,0.054465733,-0.08836605,-0.018381437,-0.070250295,-0.020446973,0.03191639,-0.045735832,-0.055043895,0.018105594,-0.025276573,0.06638962,6.8300425E-5,-0.06843761,0.033376947,0.12084332,-0.04451578,0.029042674,0.064060844,-0.021247016,0.00157762,0.048271872,-0.048322376,-0.07314219,-0.050498996,-0.0111365,0.022077061,0.017375952,-0.09673307,-0.037183575,-0.035500877,0.036798544,-0.026056565,0.1059657,0.031031214,-0.010764503,-0.101153456,0.04513511,0.030792745,0.009429766,-0.01686991,0.07218208,-0.0265282,0.008851289,0.003528865,0.013277689,-0.02469778,-2.7266262E-7,-0.019034902,-0.015870862,-0.0030159412,-0.07872971,-0.051279824,-0.008098446,-0.018102754,-0.14202598,-0.0456708