153. Stock in joint stock company\nIn the absence of any direction in the will where there is a specific bequest of stock in a joint stock\ncompany, if any call or other payment is due from the testator or testatrix at the time of his or her death\nin respect of the stock, the call or payment shall, as between the estate of the testator or testatrix and\nthe legatee, be borne by the estate; but, if any call or other payment shall, after the death of the testator\nor testatrix, become due in respect of the stock, the call or payment shall, as between the estate of the\ntestator or testatrix and the legatee, be bome by the legatee if he or she accepts the bequest.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 28','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act #U2014 Chapter 268','General','[-0.041048083,0.074514076,-0.10442867,-0.035562865,-0.063541204,0.007271639,0.04130749,-0.06541076,0.017226469,0.04031406,0.09606058,-0.0066886605,0.018164383,0.016217355,-0.012730171,-0.015295178,0.01635946,0.0049552196,-0.00864635,0.074467026,0.055263486,-0.008274184,0.013292309,0.029123144,0.023416653,-0.084962346,-0.03516084,-0.026563155,0.04370217,-0.063124165,0.012892024,0.06501434,-9.066302E-4,0.035683073,0.054845303,0.016849628,0.03332703,-0.020607656,0.008169266,0.016837975,0.075754926,-0.007948032,-0.009186092,0.0060996288,-0.064457,-0.0073982365,0.06533795,0.0057522743,-0.046347838,0.0056386613,-8.9346914E-4,0.015835846,0.03873771,0.06062666,-0.09733018,-0.051287554,0.022977307,-0.055048246,-0.011613,-0.021109642,0.036037482,0.012929241,-0.021101678,-0.021520704,0.08670178,-0.07074585,0.012680287,0.024865959,-0.09604167,0.06957707,0.05415771,-0.06463397,-0.0120702945,0.036052093,-0.06601431,0.029396787,-0.02865841,-0.01357373,0.05139418,-0.09143409,-0.06338418,-0.027517466,0.0060770107,-0.059082787,-0.036870286,-0.0069453064,0.04735999,0.010107103,0.13463672,0.010538381,0.063813485,-0.04723395,-0.0039075166,-0.019729832,0.05806