utor or executrix or administrator or administratrix, as the case may be, of a deceased person is\nhis or her legal representative for all purposes, and all the property of the deceased person vests in him or\nher as such.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 31','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act #U2014 Chapter 268','General','[-0.08247662,0.09420161,-0.062046144,-0.09646199,-0.030658979,0.08989678,0.098060116,-0.008043605,0.046974946,0.025771055,0.09688149,0.017172404,0.048487473,-0.03700524,-0.07034318,0.050075863,-0.020925246,-0.0056492826,-0.08695698,0.14497107,0.13456132,0.032105215,-0.029031064,0.0072384616,0.051868696,-0.031205028,-0.07455264,-0.06413981,0.06640373,0.013895416,0.034291767,0.0011091073,-0.12806296,-0.030951556,0.06515083,0.07975005,0.015411942,-0.027536208,-8.529613E-4,-0.0047837407,7.7509E-4,-0.012767263,0.0052922904,0.032683164,0.011734657,0.0024531835,-0.002777062,0.04541767,-0.01078959,-0.023854261,-0.007048813,0.0011581812,0.043180566,0.05088367,0.0042827246,-0.0051025036,0.043961503,-0.0029060955,-0.04739183,-0.03293136,-0.01943209,0.010569066,-0.02526392,-0.0869151,-0.017758429,-0.045194414,0.05421831,-0.04608826,-0.064497635,-0.02518582,0.06813815,-0.038314972,0.056218855,0.0061713066,-0.029131934,0.024223296,0.0017782849,-7.975597E-4,-0.056658633,-0.055951055,0.006913415,0.015331611,0.042571552,-0.053387664,-0.044314913,-0.022424554,-0.028702203,0.016845368,0.044746656,0.06642072,-0.045601014,0.0013645721,0.043368585,-0.02288585,-0.04244427,0.019346979,0.06373624,-0.017005485,-0.004368492,0.06567541,-0.021022728,0.017254952,-0.009043854,-0.0073216627,-0.007891779,-0.0608269,-0.11149978,-0.030464599,0.016853431,-0.012377188,-0.09119281,-0.022541381,0.038311988,0.063656725,0.014322816,0.121749744,-0.15615731,-0.026533676,0.104516886,-0.07419254,0.088742465,0.036120333,0.04918041,-0.04388066,-0.005197831,-0.018600136,0.03756119,4.7629147E-33,0.011792334,-0.028723678,-0.07