f probate or letters of administration\n(1) Probate or letters of administration shall have effect over all the property and estate, movable or\nimmovable, of the deceased, throughout Uganda, and shall be conclusive as to the representative\ntitle against all debtors of the deceased, and all persons holding property which belongs him or her.\n(2) Probate or letters of administration shall afford full indemnity all debtors paying their debts, and\nall persons delivering up such property the person to whom the probate or letters of administration\nshall have bet granted.\n239. Conclusiveness of application for probate or administration\nAn application for probate or letters of administration, if made and verifit in the manner hereafter\nprovided, shall be conclusive for the purpose (authorising the grant of probate or administration, and no\nsuch grant shall be impeached by reason that the testator or testatrix or intestate had no fixed place of\nabode, or no property within the dist','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act #U2014 Chapter 268','General','[-0.036070224,0.011659982,0.008357676,-0.11875467,-0.07315787,-0.05653686,0.017400784,0.007382615,-0.0059659705,0.11837181,0.072186805,0.010396282,0.06219009,-0.053247184,-0.032779068,0.016495714,-0.004768548,-0.040610466,-0.079238884,0.10812589,0.12374547,0.089492984,0.05980668,-0.001046117,-0.004826275,0.001955029,-0.058527257,-0.057162456,0.054395996,-0.07722626,0.047234017,0.005550752,-0.04255073,-0.008566284,0.064116284,0.075343974,-0.027650798,-1.7002589E-4,0.044922173,-0.06842681,0.05241973,0.0028817172,0.02754955,-0.09526024,0.024964975,-0.015990345,0.059548784,0.027381703,-0.06009557,-0.021122254,0.069197156,-0.08727517,0.08064346,0.13113132,-0.040404215,-0.014669241,0.014839913,-0.05697441,-0.023839233,-0.009046749,-0.016903095,0.04546302,-0.05720761,-0.05749859,-0.011371323,-0.055980902,0.10551721,-0.042249586,-0.04164212,-0.038048755,0.10336596,-0.056573994,0.0519