 administration shall be granted by the High Court or Chief Magistrate\nor Magistrate unless the certificate of an assistant estate duty commissioner is produced to the High Court\nor Chief Magistrate or Magistrate, as the case may be, to the effect that he or she is satisfied that the\nrequirements of any written law relating to estate duty in regard to the payment of duty have been or will\nbe complied with.\n249. Caveats against grant of probate or administration\nCaveats a','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act #U2014 Chapter 268','General','[-0.060859174,-0.003105396,0.014679037,-0.08512734,-0.13207464,0.0054947874,-0.029709458,-0.0056671654,0.013644298,0.12397704,0.074013025,0.0081262,0.04988652,-0.031384125,-0.0091980705,0.03970499,0.0102333175,-0.02829336,-0.07101329,0.060037185,0.114077926,0.06638242,0.008032148,-0.019939402,-0.010051276,-0.0442015,-0.1209225,-0.053331558,0.0580253,-0.0041908957,0.05557666,0.024630632,0.011255818,-0.038045727,0.04661405,0.056417808,0.011794238,0.03209988,0.06315473,-0.054807696,0.058559943,-0.011852732,0.041006107,-0.08311401,0.027530849,0.0012232609,0.042075656,-0.009546157,-0.064187095,-0.011703265,0.05471757,-0.07161499,0.06468064,0.10629377,-0.05259716,0.003381955,0.03781041,-0.05358357,0.005121791,-0.02923391,-0.081322186,0.01873557,-0.073410034,-0.054290105,-0.044474,-0.07739936,0.05508483,-0.05857685,-0.022025345,-0.06268036,0.06896369,-0.055305045,0.05939849,0.09925841,-0.07599346,0.0052575083,0.03159405,0.009681014,-0.016395895,-0.11511927,0.0289552,0.06148448,0.08237945,5.621291E-4,0.0161391,0.012562253,-0.08565219,-0.0669903,0.08614408,0.054323785,0.0527157,-0.050442338,0.107155904,-0.0019301914,0.0050679,-0.028367458,0.03483726,-0.072277814,0.038341515,0.017651705,-0.011684814,-0.072203994,-0.065452084,0.011459726,0.036602665,0.022818219,0.040246774,-0.031109333,0.02102986,0.027274631,-0.07583707,-0.033178408,-0.014298099,0.0035038702,-0.039202396,-0.0035992453,-0.058