ate, etc. should be refused in his or her court\nIn every case in which there is conte','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act #U2014 Chapter 268','General','[-0.06120994,0.05314576,0.0117637785,-0.10601629,-0.037469838,-0.024073703,-5.7400647E-4,0.014708803,4.544631E-4,0.06780745,0.087228544,-0.031661663,0.05863362,-0.06867088,0.022027401,0.030749055,-0.006001138,-0.015836246,-0.06542947,0.03549996,0.117373206,0.056441948,0.029287446,0.008664448,-0.011730389,-0.03421415,-0.06392022,-0.051848255,0.03338021,-0.020345228,0.018139582,0.04123444,-0.049321223,0.0010390605,0.09695065,0.045309145,-0.007880425,0.0063312105,0.030276343,-0.065183006,0.072035916,0.0014279373,0.020623473,-0.105032414,0.002192522,-0.016160848,0.016565088,0.042623103,-0.086466625,-0.03865644,-0.007511941,-0.109899744,0.05267804,0.10323646,-0.054422498,-0.041378554,0.02662599,-0.03461598,-0.0016981048,-0.021725638,-9.49442E-5,-0.025708677,-0.08293858,-0.07433126,-0.0062455083,-0.039719738,0.09140803,-0.053234767,-0.023443041,0.092456445,0.05227616,-0.046596263,0.01403888,0.10614511,-0.08480706,-0.0131914215,0.017314287,-0.010956555,-0.015578114,-0.1614426,0.020834582,0.0328602,0.07682056,-0.06427603,0.016728252,-0.1087555,-0.01844664,-0.01755482,0.05993897,-0.010151526,0.019654274,-0.036814667,0.11004515,0.009110175,0.018748244,-0.0067042722,0.013167846,-0.017058717,-0.008357421,0.041561853,-0.024182186,-0.012428879,-0.052866593,-0.03987254,0.06700873,0.0030294121,-0.008758977,-0.018568728,0.005973839,0.02224994,-0.05558599,-0.0031608427,0.04646143,0.012445278,-0.013466964,0.018763915,0.005096459,0.06497999,0.029686788,-0.045970134,-0.005317768,0.054420426,0.0053067226,-0.023684291,0.044834975,-0.038003977,0.02380675,1.0408343E-33,0.023292342,0.0021121737,-0.08850506,0.0099618845,-0.0148961395,0.026573412,-0.028865127,0.018601444,0.09142656,-0.032071147,0.032458633,-0.065867655,0.023245035,-0.11996938,-0.03720578,0.025492216,0.05312723,0.014028664,0.0825