ed habitation in a country which is not that\nof his or her domicile of origin, except that a person is not to be considered as having taken up his or her\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 2','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[0.003079203,0.0420963,-0.01290506,-0.08206813,0.01247663,-0.028222868,-0.0117385,-0.038927235,0.025377518,0.06920853,0.0786262,-0.004699488,0.047331356,-0.018066322,0.010779101,0.003832187,-0.056038417,0.0059515885,-0.11922441,0.102752484,0.1091281,-0.019005308,0.009477232,-0.025391657,0.04140089,-0.002394288,0.0035813462,-0.01879773,0.13161553,-0.031116394,0.05024169,-0.033353318,-0.07174971,0.0047257002,-0.03423749,0.023613414,0.0149777075,-0.011726337,-0.0060526445,-0.020353736,0.03143771,-0.0043429434,0.0564793,-0.108726375,0.0042798715,0.0061923265,-0.001470433,-0.010777306,-0.087453134,-0.025493652,-0.0166196,-0.044159867,0.021005942,0.13035658,-0.011725366,-0.018304262,0.024156125,-0.055983808,-0.006722689,-0.051771432,0.03492127,0.051532842,-0.056561325,-0.030097965,-0.036114145,-0.11480049,0.06762217,-0.04214109,9.6669147E-4,0.053654224,0.06236043,-0.060934916,0.034681775,0.09444382,-0.07002116,0.0067940946,0.052062966,0.020955766,0.033659153,-0.08504794,0.036433425,0.08936182,0.11717773,-0.061390355,0.0010699709,-0.01627139,-0.06009775,-0.00495612,0.064897545,0.016298978,-0.016565228,0.054916862,0.12709202,-0.007426377,0.004063447,-0.014910867,0.08026645,0.026559671,0.04000573,0.028440729,-0.06429541,-0.06958995,-0.04950779,0.050462972,0.05449657,-0.03850395,-0.058128856,-0.0010437457,0.059293393,0.032464672,-0.06471177,-0.006671389,-0.0168044,0.028517278,0.02915404,0.034881588,-0.09187929,-0.0031822212,0.037931815,-0.051312115,-0.04377908,0.025184046,-0.0025971718,-0.078027904,0.032352544,-0.011056239,0.0571451,5.7893718E-33,-0.0010332173,-0.09865107,-0.07760071,0.04291026,-0.007196727,-0.007640015,-0.07283168,0.063675106,0.019654462,-0.0