ary\ndisposition.\n21. Devolution of property of deceased dying intestate\nAll property in an intestate estate devolves upon the personal representative of the deceased upon trust\nfor those persons entitled to the property under this Act.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 4','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.0010917595,0.070755504,-0.07879479,-0.066873245,-0.012203085,0.0046716165,-0.022145802,0.049319644,-0.03778916,0.032175407,0.05060851,-0.06575187,0.053436954,-0.017383758,-0.010898524,-0.013346896,-0.050921768,0.044412993,-0.15869801,0.05910874,0.020893617,7.362172E-4,0.07545983,-0.05299796,0.04882961,-0.047355615,0.018428782,-0.032983497,0.07619144,0.024679461,0.059014965,-0.015102399,-0.024329664,0.044924073,-0.0010199484,-0.06703773,0.012196243,0.015683902,-0.009573601,0.01464379,0.043529175,-0.009893976,0.07515436,0.019609893,0.035781685,0.05345794,-0.033303488,0.061152916,-0.07892381,-0.0021574802,0.009958776,-0.033556927,0.00533847,0.19951986,-0.031179879,-0.0026635693,-0.018519837,-0.0020711375,-0.09619572,-0.006055553,0.045480065,0.041345015,-0.0055407984,-0.08307736,-0.008280682,-0.04735715,0.10722674,-0.017241998,-0.067722164,0.032456163,0.10586717,-0.06260438,-0.049359474,0.1176888,-0.03403218,-0.022670405,0.020748574,-0.001960782,-0.0967247,-0.050854594,-0.033926405,0.02990495,0.031623084,-0.093296185,-0.0061789155,-0.072378546,0.035217192,-0.044041917,0.07857099,0.063861124,-0.028459687,-0.06951364,0.11343494,-0.02293893,0.09065281,0.052154128,0.030679762,-0.08033922,-0.008325446,0.018010564,-0.13553108,-0.055236638,-0.06689041,0.014218806,0.010932932,0.028278142,-0.044368967,0.04244921,-0.011828802,-0.06693311,-0.04455311,-0.047882065,0.07155951,0.087775536,0.019879984,-0.03486299,0.031649645,-0.01254056,0.055758066,-0.042135738,0.008958102,0.047436386,-0.02633061,0.047017295,0.017397804,-0.028984936,0.009561058,7.968393E-34,4.5135242E-4,-0.01891275