lding, shall not form part of the property to be disposed of in the will and shall be held by his or\nher personal representative upon trust for his or her spouses and lineal descendants subject to the\nrights of occupat','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.048186067,0.025002988,0.0031125706,-0.07324479,-0.061418038,0.022448698,0.0054084007,-0.06054661,0.05143397,0.08247129,0.03517976,0.010483517,0.012602378,0.002527786,-0.018449875,0.034572434,-0.0485799,-0.019367853,-0.107879385,0.08332723,0.11438564,0.023473538,0.0639591,-0.031832878,0.021138279,-0.0032604637,-0.0019183245,-0.06800697,0.080272086,0.009531499,0.088171996,0.040019292,-0.053290945,0.037445415,-0.012052902,0.00716957,0.02792976,0.020126928,0.026313726,-0.097209185,0.038886495,-0.01764153,0.046721805,-0.081027985,-0.031376105,1.2295725E-5,-0.032648705,-0.028461149,-0.053468645,-0.056440994,-0.034200598,-0.052695446,0.10326935,0.05543364,-0.030333055,0.015797177,0.044662148,-0.06300649,-0.04776109,0.01565376,0.0040795864,6.9834996E-4,-0.0495132,-0.09553949,-0.00892484,-0.022002542,0.048034467,0.019969745,0.020904815,0.0015291944,0.010786125,-0.03550028,0.056591135,0.07340577,-0.04913789,0.026327739,0.056584444,-0.02036139,-0.020879116,-0.07843155,-0.083502635,0.08947017,0.082593024,-0.062096756,-0.030838715,-0.023427049,0.012628561,0.0012985459,0.074433655,0.05060552,-0.041261896,-0.05791788,0.067098536,0.001714383,0.064054064,0.033845693,0.0732425,-0.040222537,-0.012728858,0.0021665618,-0.04822073,-0.04186464,-0.015622529,0.007971391,0.01400571,0.00683679,-0.017482582,-0.05500969,-0.001345579,-0.008918677,-0.08149231,-0.031751752,0.01022748,0.095721155,0.06347017,0.030249385,-0.111028254,-5.9243385E-4,0.035089936,-0.060181405,0.023729589,0.03319179,0.015974825,0.012627265,0.04511915,-0.061753873,0.007858982,3.380309E-33,0.039694596,-0.055927183,-0.06739703,0.04139373,0.012241054,0.023618374,-0.02521866,0.02356161,0.029969838,