t be made\n(1) Except as provided by section 35, an application under section 31 shall not, without the\npermission of the court, be made after the end of the period of six months from the date on which\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 9','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.09237573,0.08901861,-0.026089069,-0.10967657,0.020036243,0.024193136,0.05081226,0.038917966,0.0058008316,0.020633569,-0.007833193,-0.02447989,0.02855762,-0.038754467,0.021550048,0.06103233,0.045362435,0.03558283,-0.07931149,0.10251144,0.08255246,-0.004796129,0.0054527386,-0.0020496,0.025736716,-0.020001067,0.04017436,0.008729961,0.097715445,0.002170554,0.03473409,-0.011305729,-0.07558288,0.020655572,0.025573298,0.02093042,-0.014224284,-0.039858475,-0.011759669,0.006437393,0.01423391,0.048047837,0.08619246,-0.0049151913,0.05069283,-0.045236733,0.0071674897,-0.028904742,-0.05136656,0.07122997,-0.029720217,0.0045469585,0.013433122,0.08966112,-0.04613744,0.0269839,0.031186454,0.0096528055,-0.08063106,-0.02779433,-0.05227007,-0.017986864,-0.016225504,-0.055509187,-0.038624667,-0.029120129,0.08364061,-0.0054075397,-0.012456303,0.0013250129,0.010620563,0.003898617,-0.050757572,0.01673222,-0.1417638,-0.018804193,0.048645165,0.008397787,-0.12707071,-0.11720633,-0.018554088,0.038769383,-0.0014655886,-0.04139929,-0.062898,-0.015256848,-0.037806604,-0.021299405,0.069418736,0.09690738,0.022855766,-0.053434506,0.06382104,-0.0074549154,0.033874866,0.049175892,0.06274736,-0.034831565,-0.006251243,0.024539242,-0.03406598,-0.04265364,0.0037406872,0.057542536,0.029544841,0.019967588,-0.092592955,-0.02322931,0.0054691206,-0.023949886,-0.0613358,-0.0375038,-0.034874283,0.047785934,0.003976218,0.0232783,-0.036293186,0.02239933,0.029164331,-0.11024852,-0.014344317,0.050143525,-0.030882293,0.02788868,0.028777214,-0.069607995,-0.028601706,5.1764444E-33,-0.021872936,-0.021157628,0.0014538174,0.046429053,-0.0050298944,-0.0206