glected to act as guardian;\n(b) the guardian has neglected his or her responsibilities as a guardian;\n(c) the guardian has not complied with the conditions of the guardianship order;\n(d) the guardianship order was obtained by fraud or misrepresentation; or\n(e) it is in the best interest of the minor to remove the guardian.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 12','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.065285556,0.08783966,0.018493239,-0.04733994,0.034799624,-0.009723572,-0.025797475,-0.033290908,0.070382506,0.053827938,0.077823974,0.10088798,0.060544774,-0.013009478,0.04326512,0.025236784,0.0101323435,0.07561786,-0.081044145,0.029290566,0.068669245,-0.040225822,-0.04374821,-0.013318493,0.040242556,-0.013202632,-0.074930616,-0.026378637,0.023714526,-0.027205931,-0.020395245,-0.018977797,-0.07184671,0.00537434,-0.04086642,0.0594854,0.049832407,-0.04038399,-0.03811191,-0.050752133,0.034177214,0.057649642,0.017212847,-0.07316415,-0.0018509926,0.010491462,-0.09680608,-0.02384529,-0.08238998,-0.03819702,-0.066433445,-0.018414075,0.016001413,0.14084561,-0.008998833,-0.005504363,-0.00546637,-0.06805699,0.03159581,0.005184966,-0.06658421,0.021779925,-0.026820036,-0.020692708,0.028829124,-0.116144,0.09521562,-0.10473642,0.024182934,0.044996396,3.1918107E-4,-0.023090059,-0.004617709,0.017880492,-0.05588886,0.03009372,0.02507337,-0.009641715,0.009228719,-0.07873035,0.024348516,0.061481673,0.02799452,-0.021979092,-0.005673595,-0.04083685,-0.026402516,-0.036539312,0.027180681,0.055453118,-0.009085789,-0.03710118,0.062192533,0.011740854,0.078529015,-0.018458357,0.036268044,-0.059523404,-0.0062107593,0.014502446,0.0012665456,0.008553894,0.006752986,0.046983574,-0.018243905,-0.058560107,-0.09615436,-0.028325303,-0.0029408445,0.054718073,-0.020212397,-0.029199028,-0.009436959,0.018600011,-0.013437919,0.09184775,0.02608624,0.096005715,0.018257767,-0.07969214,-0.013696956,0.058723472,-0.0020