places, a\nbequest to the same person of the same quantity or amount of anything, he or she shall be\nentitled to one such legacy only;\n(c) where two legacies of unequal amount are given to the same person in the same will or in the\nsame codicil, the legatee is entitled to both such legacies;\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 19','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.09497303,0.060266383,-0.08283309,-0.07182453,-0.11733315,-0.025836721,-0.0021698237,-0.03819504,0.062749654,0.029810533,0.023752995,-0.049476568,-0.005190981,-0.015602465,0.014902406,0.021614226,-0.040139467,0.013551305,-0.091687046,0.058946237,0.07088816,-0.109806,0.034075882,0.01575704,-0.00480558,-0.044666067,0.0061241123,-0.018199846,0.077922635,0.029274575,0.08766192,0.015050792,-0.08720853,0.032307263,0.008546146,0.0030186074,0.0092591625,0.036180917,0.0062188455,-0.037327576,-0.0016223164,0.018097267,-0.0011306796,-0.02153118,-0.010597931,-0.015603069,-0.009528786,0.047963403,-0.02859029,-0.028705034,-0.078444645,-0.049227294,-0.003084751,0.073648944,0.02380512,0.03701586,-0.04569662,-0.040864524,-0.0246469,-0.029056521,-0.09315302,-0.022827275,-0.01026054,-0.02763635,0.026801594,-0.050883524,0.029828044,-0.026344502,-0.024625828,-0.0013641312,0.024836084,0.008399464,0.016850613,0.112979025,-0.03601042,0.060273618,0.022729952,0.0016088221,-0.057587307,-0.09185918,-0.051798087,0.020834131,0.009284698,-0.037128035,-0.022835717,-0.007331858,-0.007054416,-0.0011875682,-0.007465979,0.0353382,-0.034865346,-0.06758422,0.05949125,0.027296763,0.06509565,0.08452861,0.0439121,-0.032469895,-0.012289918,0.014993905,-0.042542852,-0.029979954,0.012717403,0.073283255,-0.050450098,-0.007109553,-0.15298918,-0.05648279,0.04195336,-0.043269522,-0.03205711,-0.09824487,0.06569089,0.041431326,-0.03886387,0.058016356,0.002574639,0.04533929,0.054833893,-0.06001429,-0.010949589,0.02127556,-0.0068068956,0.009903923,0.07090459,