 or account which is untrue in a material respect; or\n(f) that the person to whom the grant was made has mismanaged the estate.\n(3) Where a grant of probate or letters of administration is revoked under subsection (2)(b) or (f), the\nexecutor, executrix or person to whom letters of administ','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.07957553,0.08119488,0.08637724,-0.06634832,-0.087965325,0.006570331,-0.03652489,-0.022845853,0.063627765,0.1103253,0.07361712,0.048836656,0.023528093,-0.056367874,-0.06523761,-0.014492882,-0.042943444,0.033400025,-0.09622878,0.07443529,0.08679943,0.050001908,-0.04013956,0.004764381,0.044486146,-0.0053898627,-0.065387964,-0.013455304,0.07087892,-0.09270225,0.06133958,0.07022208,-0.06953479,-0.038234655,0.019950649,0.031141907,0.009319901,0.03284178,0.03745332,-0.057762202,0.07391601,-0.04907731,0.043463875,-0.03707561,0.032417998,-0.008961594,0.010127121,0.020655485,-0.044786114,0.026506409,0.043456905,-0.090923905,0.04369084,0.08039229,-0.043845102,-0.037119295,0.038762234,-0.0046893214,-0.035744384,-0.0033631704,0.00808797,0.05089973,-0.059373103,-0.060057543,-0.055215716,-0.08759233,0.073068865,-0.08951156,0.0145917395,0.024805075,0.11579408,-0.05589183,0.06581128,0.042099055,-0.052090775,0.011441261,-0.006972304,0.054964643,-0.016417,-0.11142106,0.052610207,0.07079931,0.0889374,-0.035166454,0.05586426,-0.04801898,-0.016214453,-0.091235034,0.12205972,0.040954906,-0.014453243,-0.043353304,0.126511,0.0018145676,-0.0072797826,-0.018304506,0.030904358,-0.086778484,0.041161075,0.03643696,-0.032300178,-0.039781187,-0.07190908,-0.044136006,0.04520708,-0.021451136,-0.05465577,-0.010674645,0.021461204,-0.019436996,-0.03888063,-0.021193843,0.026431305,-0.012377735,0.048860587,0.05617713,-0.05160772,0.055552296,0.009569219,-0.09006893,-0.057066508,0.034673743,-0.003037466,-0.033163697,-0.020121934,-0.061257575,0.0070028743,6.649133E-34,0.005701269,-0.0035786862,-0.074346095,