ocation of probate or letters of administration, grant probate or letters of\nadministration to another person where court determines that such a person is a fit and proper\nperson to be granted probate or letters of administration under this Act.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 39','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.07575018,0.057824843,-0.038476598,-0.030752026,-0.07428198,0.012725263,0.0084153265,-0.02580464,0.019741002,0.13288184,0.11405741,-0.0028843523,0.07204448,-0.042374972,-0.019001383,-0.022986675,0.010617513,0.008049787,-0.10251815,0.02034362,0.12100131,0.052893244,0.017720096,0.015571875,-0.017515799,-0.045068555,-0.07559588,-0.010571609,0.0047199843,-0.044838063,0.028625166,-0.022299424,-0.031970978,-0.021792771,0.0058799367,0.025312545,-0.020680102,0.038092934,0.011233188,-0.062184244,0.101896875,0.016228389,0.0026546486,-0.05400282,0.0393985,-0.04007145,0.044176735,0.018240534,-0.09655821,-0.0072539835,0.021582253,-0.010156221,0.0075507914,0.09898629,-0.09766973,-0.051637556,0.0014958445,0.02908848,-0.035747383,-0.052710168,-0.042288635,-0.0016270207,-0.019401098,-0.06157688,-0.0022587534,-0.04442904,0.034691658,-0.07366493,-0.026471145,-0.0049060476,0.08875713,-0.11768191,0.031396814,0.057373196,-0.073373675,0.010696334,0.022543598,0.008551524,-0.0455434,-0.105782345,0.041225668,0.03077216,0.05643359,-0.05263193,7.3392864E-4,-0.043892864,-0.0077612535,-0.06166843,0.08879339,0.02277429,0.114357926,-0.040732935,0.18650962,-0.02121015,0.0045685903,-0.05553392,-0.0051439693,-0.06890736,-0.025137717,0.03751306,-0.08487261,-0.05241411,-0.05163547,-0.030058386,0.01652049,0.041724354,0.031132083,0.049755644,-0.01878218,-0.013440108,-0.08440123,0.040946607,0.010207769,-0.009509029,0.009943411,0.052328497,-0.06437593,0.0025484415,0.042584553,-0.039403617,-0.013002561,0.012905583,-0.0074310047,-0.0013815914,-0.031021198,-0.031358153,0.027500842,1.082119E-33,0.04