ation for probate or administration\nAn application for probate or letters of administration, if made and verifit in the manner hereafter\nprovided, shall be conclusive for the purpose (authorising the grant of probate or administration, and no\nsuch grant shall be impeached by reason that the testator or testatrix or intestate had no fixed place of\nabode, or no property within the dist','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.036070224,0.011659982,0.008357676,-0.11875467,-0.07315787,-0.05653686,0.017400784,0.007382615,-0.0059659705,0.11837181,0.072186805,0.010396282,0.06219009,-0.053247184,-0.032779068,0.016495714,-0.004768548,-0.040610466,-0.079238884,0.10812589,0.12374547,0.089492984,0.05980668,-0.001046117,-0.004826275,0.001955029,-0.058527257,-0.057162456,0.054395996,-0.07722626,0.047234017,0.005550752,-0.04255073,-0.008566284,0.064116284,0.075343974,-0.027650798,-1.7002589E-4,0.044922173,-0.06842681,0.05241973,0.0028817172,0.02754955,-0.09526024,0.024964975,-0.015990345,0.059548784,0.027381703,-0.06009557,-0.021122254,0.069197156,-0.08727517,0.08064346,0.13113132,-0.040404215,-0.014669241,0.014839913,-0.05697441,-0.023839233,-0.009046749,-0.016903095,0.04546302,-0.05720761,-0.05749859,-0.011371323,-0.055980902,0.10551721,-0.042249586,-0.04164212,-0.038048755,0.10336596,-0.056573994,0.05191346,0.07549342,-0.08135842,-0.025941644,0.043725874,-1.2556734E-4,-0.033730708,-0.07156398,0.028275372,0.041795254,0.10438246,-0.034028746,-0.0064843968,-0.04960326,-0.042522836,-0.06290352,0.07369699,0.017242275,0.06162793,-0.025314191,0.10262179,-0.010270367,-0.014727664,-0.009753572,0.048245262,0.010201216,3.7352185E-4,0.034139764,-0.042546842,-0.064294375,-0.07754054,-0.015590957,0.045852832,0.018719928,0.0150433965,-0.030720005,0.035146255,0.0125790555,-0.08942777,-0.037713043,-0.056300372,0.041050944,0.0278318,4.4894594E-4,-0.041209172,0.02416648,0.01115694,-0.09178414,-0.04400901,0.035452534,-0.0