ion and belief”.\n244. Verification of petition for probate by one witness to will\nWhere the application is for probate, the petition shall also be verified by at least one of the witnesses to\nthe will, when procura','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.03158331,0.041880958,0.015606615,-0.15476029,-0.08152635,-0.0015894287,0.046759583,0.018223573,0.05266987,0.05461255,0.04260209,0.014680218,0.052897975,-0.04762874,-0.015614342,0.020236539,-0.022297835,0.028818807,-0.08751817,0.029134769,0.11814573,0.081559055,0.040534522,0.0038963808,0.036999144,0.0076732137,-0.07463489,-0.06321646,0.061022762,-0.018315453,0.029957192,0.041673508,-0.03082787,-0.015820272,0.048498735,0.06270768,-0.0194699,-0.07948861,0.02756644,-0.040464286,0.031129332,-0.03833002,0.059230793,-0.07942253,0.042911638,0.046803936,0.010307848,0.07011017,-0.03870889,0.010254752,-0.009816011,-0.10944054,0.064008586,0.05689379,-0.030794086,-0.009552307,0.044136334,-0.06719994,-0.01941979,-0.03741386,-0.031163469,0.04883472,-0.0672888,0.008145739,-0.018235378,-0.07156082,0.08755907,-0.047637437,-0.03436228,-0.0038655275,0.012153532,-0.040041674,0.061229803,0.12215046,-0.12158733,-0.046593636,0.060074378,-0.018204017,-0.073774345,-0.094645135,0.025376119,0.014751534,0.1021146,-0.0075601707,0.028016444,-0.010316344,-0.06268049,-0.033011608,0.110401765,0.043970075,0.02509932,-0.031137358,0.10381022,0.035498075,0.0126615325,0.020759143,0.036666095,0.03772793,0.021453628,0.038356293,-0.041256975,-0.08772591,-0.010550511,-0.020675363,0.02681427,-0.012222745,-0.039579444,-0.052680373,0.03461346,-0.0075963237,-0.0723915,-0.05203381,-0.06444705,0.056572556,0.004593735,-0.004745793,-0.032189857,0.006818004,0.011086909,-0.05802733,-0.0662327,0.03711928,-0.047916587,-0.07721047,-0.005766517,-0.032308336,0.06716498,-4.2847544E-33,-0.0035155343,0.013356336,-0.05242831,0.023674702,-0.022324884,-0.053026143,-0.056173164,0.046718523,0.05604488,-0.