all suspend the proceedings in the matter until\nthe caveat has been withdrawn or has lapsed or a suit for the removal of the caveat has been filed\nand determined by court.\n252. Caveat and petition to lapse\n(1) A petitioner for probate or letters of administration in respect of which a caveat has been lodged\nshall, within six months from the date the caveat was lodged, file a suit for removal of the caveat.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 43','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.08214037,0.089423105,-0.0065347105,-0.120056145,-0.029660547,0.0293379,0.022096299,-0.008343322,-0.09087226,0.07465414,0.0834505,-0.08482261,0.02425713,-0.03536386,0.040083013,0.0010791195,0.01970287,0.049147017,-0.08730597,0.05830857,0.10871005,0.03739462,-0.018133534,-0.0013918107,0.02096608,-0.0847609,-0.041975245,-0.042989947,-0.0044493116,-0.003324749,0.0036482168,0.05076031,-0.036383357,-0.04487417,0.06294538,0.024747077,0.045380913,-0.025277322,-0.022195244,-0.013160958,-0.0021323622,0.07426797,0.01475577,0.009975687,0.016048951,-0.03185918,-0.01856935,-0.008111504,-0.08930866,-0.02740066,-0.038857073,-0.017633302,-0.024446143,0.063798286,-0.07509284,-0.06753903,0.042803552,-0.052570537,-0.013047799,-0.042352363,-0.0704453,-0.015415519,-0.022622505,-0.042499207,-0.028551215,-0.02627477,2.8557424E-4,-0.123554185,-0.02291484,0.043984033,-0.03321227,-0.06444839,-5.22159E-4,0.04253089,-0.09689044,-0.007904491,0.0035749075,-0.013216831,-0.03359898,-0.1773802,-0.0042620352,-0.011014268,0.0066071805,-0.03815208,-0.05011602,-0.113092065,-0.031006359,0.007672437,0.08075361,0.0036216562,0.03990757,-0.04345956,0.009095354,-0.0068699936,0.05037759,0.026805427,0.03567824,-0.02403503,-0.042537723,0.036564436,0.0026685651,4.3828192E-4,-0.048978407,-0.024603695,0.020263925,0.067215666,-0.027772577,0.023311235,-0.016788965,-0.008319425,-0.03763501,0.0037586559,0.06009223,-0.011936924,-0.007694817,0.1