executrix’s assent to legacy\n288. Assent necessary to complete legatee’s title\nThe assent of the executor or executrix is necessary to complete a legatee’s title to his or her legacy.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 51','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.0640487,0.0892695,-0.071559854,-0.0573515,-0.041396327,-0.029690778,0.046001796,0.029274454,0.06075398,-0.006924634,0.03157836,-0.07305368,-0.016653491,-0.013511562,-0.065716386,-0.034976933,-0.019098742,0.07182173,-0.10622527,0.1307654,0.10673191,0.006695529,-0.0149303265,0.029092848,0.010250792,-0.010005331,-0.036155302,-0.020320289,0.073356315,-0.067601964,0.07289551,0.040357072,0.006334511,-0.05262102,0.054081343,0.043934636,-4.9655314E-4,0.032234885,-0.008435301,0.0023922874,-0.0048555215,-0.023680743,-0.032231186,-0.056497697,0.028842898,-0.014954531,0.01323686,-0.022930438,-0.08106619,0.061562277,0.051716074,-0.017235247,-0.036092985,0.07975506,-0.020990338,-0.026450444,0.045929864,-0.04528206,-0.043278426,-0.046263445,-0.021051586,0.00850478,-0.059174538,-0.022337923,0.0044404813,-0.029273458,0.08098212,-0.05539228,-0.07952299,0.06826269,-0.015291539,-0.059032105,-0.06210701,0.027561432,-0.06475142,0.061487447,0.006306824,0.020291368,-0.04981475,-0.08483093,0.01854526,0.0074577224,0.08868112,-0.06715887,0.0077611264,-0.042339202,0.034619883,-0.01876509,0.10079673,0.06825334,-0.0032162843,-0.0031919442,0.10580345,-0.08659528,0.023273718,0.022931546,0.008913643,-0.06757402,0.024408765,0.020292897,-0.02550071,0.015720678,-0.01943598,0.045085464,0.022468498,0.009304771,-0.0352937,0.0078001837,0.046500713,-0.045927983,-0.030367468,-0.060961183,0.02773129,-0.044892468,0.020860681,0.052409198,-0.08054307,-0.017072674,0.08725309,-0.024099879,0.04768544,0.08263655,-0.002134472,0.040996335,0.034701493,-0.046501916,-0.023915775,2.5199076E-33,-0.028980996,-0.024453454,-0.012684228,-0.041478697,-0.036751993,0.012111882,