of the minor, every year to the surviving parent if any,\ncourt or any other person as court may direct.\n(3) Except where there is an order of court to the contrary, the guardian shall within six months of\nthe minor attaining the age of eighteen years, transfer all the property in his or her custody to the\nminor.\n(4) Notwithstanding subsection (3), a guardian or any other person who considers that a person to\nwhom property is to be transferred under the subsection is not fit to administer his or her property,\nthe guardian or such other person may apply to court to determine the suitability of the person to\nmanage his or her property.\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 54','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.014339343,0.10055764,-0.046682168,-0.09712924,-0.024340136,-0.018414138,0.027635392,0.026399389,0.0061966465,0.09339677,0.0841935,-0.03316777,0.040848933,-0.021181641,-0.012058947,0.022584211,0.043472197,0.088697985,-0.105479896,-0.017773688,0.030100368,-0.024421703,-0.016352583,-0.005267471,0.08168505,-0.012798247,-0.080019936,-0.022517402,0.036682297,-0.008550259,0.074029565,-0.051623844,-0.050389588,-0.06442785,-0.012228046,0.048132204,-0.010833314,0.002495803,0.0060545187,-0.04782144,0.008379459,0.060162023,0.027924359,-0.04528778,-0.035006095,0.0066836826,-0.03008474,0.040650617,-0.022993209,-0.03570968,0.027930478,-0.07000594,0.04372389,0.16203167,-0.08398101,0.0024334614,0.03943868,-0.07863505,-0.0012401531,-0.046685595,-0.11224251,0.018993927,0.013600532,-0.05987766,-0.019857774,-0.11782333,0.116081834,0.012565784,-0.019699102,-0.04052449,0.036662564,-0.006330807,0.005875992,0.020350162,-0.06393056,0.0029864523,0.026612429,0.03347152,-0.026253339,-0.09362786,-0.015432357,0.078871295,0.064156525,-0.074892506,-0.0035276797,0.012229461,0.027454551,0.0031940734,0.07191918,0.08464022,0.014459414,-0.026060984,0.061808586,-0.030410497,0.028142713,0.0113108335,