d41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.0410367,0.049288753,-0.13822673,-0.04225494,-0.0027452747,-0.06916442,-0.002236174,0.023110539,0.028203908,0.10989937,0.06865001,0.019527154,0.014308909,0.03298193,-0.028991489,0.033856295,-0.073480755,0.007503422,-4.4764736E-4,0.07534528,0.017176853,-0.06869798,-0.018459314,-0.04321028,0.10672853,-0.036123954,0.06959989,-0.005167534,-0.0152157275,0.0045038033,0.0093509,0.10108958,-0.026789311,-0.081976086,-0.013622362,0.006436948,-0.013404976,0.07771618,-0.048477422,0.093881555,0.05305894,0.021784397,0.03926503,-0.043205015,0.019588374,-0.02624219,0.011464098,0.01471505,-0.07354641,0.099847876,-0.062486053,-0.03415543,0.027542906,-0.0014198249,-0.031947218,-0.075513884,0.010039305,-0.026212756,-0.050737634,-0.03232856,0.028603649,-0.056266766,0.032263972,-0.08656428,-0.0422523,-0.03569436,0.037063196,-0.015913611,-0.016707277,-0.041190922,-0.030889606,-0.031390116,-0.08530554,-0.074749485,-0.086506486,0.043094717,0.028555855,0.01903415,0.06459028,-0.116811864,0.039043363,-0.0029510497,0.030445747,-0.08211289,0.039740745,0.021991124,0.05423028,0.018192228,0.10484203,0.041358422,0.02108209,0.024877388,0.024656147,-0.09863255,0.042101823,0.010138635,-0.018282073,-0.0074374136,-0.007354447,0.04559404,0.08331938,-0.021187777,-0.06737972,0.08982285,-0.01875625,0.032308422,0.0045029917,0.019343097,0.033474747,-0.003611453,-0.038926125,0.010548881,0.07476715,-0.011183803,-0.026777294,0.012955063,-0.083718285,0.015569417,0.14302342,0.012145429,0.12788865,0.060601637,-0.055432975,0.04433048,0.08009429,0.0028041916,-0.025129246,4.7549595E-33,0.012075638,-0.0067283507,0.008615509,-0.014730408,-0.100114524,-0.0068918695,0.027307475,0.11693715,0.029997658,-0.064616874,0.0539482,-0.030129382,-0.020014158,-0.019374559,-0.023067737,0.047767993,-0.024556,0.028741246,0.053265676,-0.027341451,-0.025832688,0.009644711,0.03333513,-0.030043736,-0.0075329198,-0.047034997,-0.0012928098,-0.089979194,-0.12407027,-0.015859526,0.099009104,0.