944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.017565442,0.0074313586,-0.0024700314,-0.07146856,-0.034717757,0.041441444,-5.806254E-4,-0.050433014,0.035529483,0.08982798,0.04418329,0.039749548,-0.0029818797,-0.01916649,0.0027477783,0.033402573,0.0015531083,0.04696973,-0.05276443,0.08778022,0.13791429,0.0057263696,-0.022784326,-0.0026621174,0.021530574,-0.07424675,-0.020975372,-0.049578015,0.023134625,0.002485892,0.03978274,-0.008363732,-0.09844168,-0.03869879,0.07386679,0.038341936,-0.017639257,-0.007150628,0.012796035,-0.04265063,0.011964263,-0.01598343,0.047821917,0.019262759,0.0012816674,-0.004201606,-0.043039348,0.0019310422,-0.04817142,0.016447822,0.01230241,-0.055539306,0.017233653,0.03984663,-0.066263445,0.00370564,0.08166609,0.040650446,-0.004243313,-0.069097236,-0.057945456,-0.033624873,-0.042333964,-0.045568865,-0.07240562,-0.005387404,0.03976243,-0.042430855,0.021616098,-0.0587661,-0.029772777,-0.04015944,0.0264034,-0.020172102,-0.07844114,-0.0014153819,0.017992089,0.106636204,-0.046780873,-0.105985306,-0.021416647,-0.0054354565,0.07457682,-0.045632657,-0.030433401,-0.0371464,-0.07143426,0.031039456,0.14081374,0.073519774,0.08545612,0.02346686,0.04850079,-0.029389637,0.0037751987,0.0020740454,0.057136167,-0.048734143,0.011215239,0.054034654,0.025845915,0.018674681,-0.085650876,-0.05724527,0.05426293,0.018596234,-0.060765382,-0.038241986,0.031445425,-0.08896972,-0.044929147,-0.054677058,0.064013205,-0.018692456,-0.015949676,0.08517276,-0.030429851,0.048758253,0.046126135,-0.09623367,0.057819765,0.074115,-0.034465954,-0.11237218,0.0026754995,0.030249286,-0.016838523,1.00045305E-33,-0.031696305,-0.030772932,-0.044875436,0.061915178,-0.008964128,-0.06449428,0.032943808,0.022736577,0.052636832,-0.07635502,0.05339289,-0.044943277,4.569735E-4,-0.05355312,-0.07334794,-0.032885127,0.047174063,0.037969902,0.13035029,0.021821836,0.09597519,-0.026668856,0.028179768,-0.0013612685,-0.004281567,0.003227337,0.0022966675,-0.006041828,-0.016166223,0.024544612,0.0