d dependent on the occupant who would suffer no hardship by occupying the\nalternative accommodation instead of the residential holding;\n(c) that no hardship would be occasioned to the occupant or any person resident with and\ndependent upon the occupant if the occupant is paid a sum of money to be assessed by the\ncourt instead of being permitt','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.03894397,0.0970868,0.038307764,2.422778E-4,-0.018482413,0.059058134,0.0338631,0.02707295,0.039654188,-0.0052900286,0.12846221,0.021899506,0.011175997,-0.07660544,-0.03343976,0.07174109,-0.004445537,0.04075966,0.012987674,0.09438905,0.08078244,0.043086212,-0.03586935,0.027300324,0.025138581,0.025682833,-0.034075223,0.021146085,0.10408116,0.03409235,0.033812277,0.025486376,0.018529825,-0.016966818,0.048354056,0.033400837,-0.0033476977,-0.037767183,-0.0048913877,-0.04146745,0.0012234796,-0.0125461705,0.0045738025,-0.074732244,0.0015699207,-0.026798455,-0.03302826,-0.029853536,-0.0839788,0.011861719,-0.016972443,-0.005010307,-0.009657483,0.17377284,-0.019574156,-0.015508311,0.014667485,-0.06039322,-0.06043072,0.025214264,0.0066855466,0.04490963,-0.065073274,-0.031256232,0.03575974,-0.042465687,0.0706147,-0.087578095,0.04453488,0.03628387,-0.002323306,-0.059112117,-0.054433055,0.101447254,4.8662542E-4,0.022005621,-0.002218636,0.025858406,0.093577966,-0.13759126,-0.041615672,-0.004101881,-0.035105057,-0.010696485,-0.07397314,-0.029806964,-0.0050017824,-0.015990077,0.05077305,-0.016978651,0.03020849,-0.013507336,0.07805471,-0.05179302,0.01372342,-0.108183965,0.0392218,-0.06557444,-0.022614604,0.013257724,-0.046729766,0.013332039,-0.027190875,0.039888017,-0.037111808,-0.05940547,-0.059752997,-0.055489607,-0.02628686,-0.0018870594,-0.008389295,-0.087345496,0.0061244043,0.037743106,0.022144416,0.04639466,-0.036517274,0.0011729544,0.11000285,-0.04188848,0.03530711,0.040218234,-0.06805072,0.030229822,-0.013464874,-0.0208683