erm not\nexceeding three years, or both.\nSchedule 4 (Section 38)\nStatutory Will Form\nThe Succession Act\nName1. Name of person making\nwill\nAddress\n2. Names of executors or\nexecutrixes\n3. Appointment of heir or\nheiress\n4. Name of guardian or\nguardian of young\nchildren\nNames Property given5. Names of persons who\nare given specific gifts\nin this will (which can\nbe money, land or other\nproperty)\nBy Ulii.org and Laws.Africa. Share widely and freely. 64','627b160233ed70167530ad169ea5a5028257e7feaf909cd0722428b944bd41dc','Succession Act — Chapter 268','General','[-0.037835266,0.08979878,0.04260339,-0.07549875,-0.01078128,-0.033597026,0.0062922593,9.368287E-4,0.034462914,0.07308778,0.08271212,-0.012618296,0.051116183,-0.05815726,-0.04709044,0.020418843,-0.045433503,0.0032435427,-0.064891934,0.0931412,0.08462822,0.029162467,0.040006362,-0.0014938372,0.023835927,-0.03056317,-0.06319356,0.0027058327,0.08917105,-0.045972373,0.06621082,-0.01051803,0.041476563,0.001891783,-0.009175861,-1.4663799E-4,0.061897382,-0.03766696,-0.0014059121,-0.04110815,0.11427488,-0.014280346,0.031910524,-0.11808269,0.0037471135,-0.0021994305,0.0018731512,-0.072790936,-0.06776604,-0.005374558,-0.053281065,-0.07167791,0.028983327,0.12800221,-0.06333855,-0.038293004,0.012112963,-0.05720969,0.012076583,-0.018460833,0.031122362,0.0643353,-0.056829967,-0.01908191,-0.010505978,-0.11508298,0.07716021,-0.0567947,-9.273412E-4,0.07429592,0.08703138,-0.079137206,0.014245803,0.07412152,-0.058913026,0.01422776,0.05078364,0.0023211986,-0.014018836,-0.11197991,0.021406658,0.013566633,0.07107541,-0.05766411,-0.0037568791,-0.07420658,-0.047268625,-0.037335996,0.07125402,0.001022616,0.030960409,-0.019274173,0.1016942,0.014775616,0.12873422,-0.04241646,0.04945469,-0.040435586,0.015480292,0.0059248735,-0.088574216,-0.015117297,-0.074773595,0.013451786,0.030257544,-0.02630484,-0.03585775,-0.025494713,0.043725222,-0.02425762,-0.042146422,-0.053102404,-0.007918543,0.04415383,0.07660657,0.08015498,-0.051541