und in Uganda,\nwhose parents are not known, shall be presumed to be a citizen of Uganda by\nbirth.\n(2) A child under the age of eighteen years neither of whose parents\nis a citizen of Uganda, who is adopted by a citizen of Uganda shall, on\napplication, be registered as a citizen of Uganda.\n12. Citizenship by registration.\n(1) Every person born in Uganda—\n(a) at the time of whose birth—\n(i) neither of his or her parents and none of his or her\ngrandparents had diplomatic status in Uganda; and\n(ii) neither of his or her parents and none of his or her\ngrandparents was a refugee in Uganda; and\n(b) who has lived continuously in Uganda since the ninth day of\nOctober, 1962, \nshall, on application, be entitled to be registered as a citizen of Uganda.','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[-0.060317893,0.034624238,-0.027516656,-0.055953994,0.00203423,-0.03470861,0.018358177,0.01807887,-0.04371212,0.058835696,0.0778253,-0.030615,0.009987597,-0.07507896,0.07249701,0.0020529572,-0.07410837,-0.018104492,-0.059020318,0.013385548,0.03784232,-0.016320406,0.031889286,-0.008571999,0.045562487,0.07881143,0.025837295,-0.043588087,0.052819535,0.014159561,0.05485052,0.026334748,-0.026483761,0.040898427,-0.0021434643,-0.013758013,0.061229844,0.055048592,0.032954067,-0.074878685,0.03877801,-0.07529213,-0.008309936,-0.11523418,0.07986259,9.2819927E-4,0.02199535,0.017572898,-0.03448017,0.009768553,-0.021802794,-0.030038223,0.007631701,0.04593753,0.03489342,0.014161252,-0.031300027,-0.113023825,0.034431633,-0.008352881,-0.0014669601,0.038449157,-0.08303933,-0.04867707,-0.029201053,-0.06364331,0.059914913,-0.11916651,0.02663158,-0.044086035,0.045540195,0.03392853,0.053646244,0.11648469,-0.008946983,-0.050795004,0.037985425,0.076588966,-0.0381045,-0.05916507,6.379658E-5,0.091151826,0.08821438,-0.06530168,-0.015111027,-0.023271875,-0.04190129,0.03370964,-0.011335833,-0.013634653,-0.02426746,-1.0900754E-4,0.0784448,0