s of a census of the population of Uganda and may as a\nresult redemarcate the constituencies.\n(6) Where the boundary of a constituency established under this\narticle is altered as a result of a review, the alteration shall come into effect\nupon the next dissolution of Parliament.\n(7) For the purposes of this article, “population quota” means the\nnumber obtained by d','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[0.046559002,-0.010667246,0.016033523,-0.020821339,-0.04829993,0.009180757,0.017434172,-0.008781188,2.1623247E-4,0.02299625,-0.0017175152,-0.096162714,0.058057897,-0.06722687,0.025756152,-0.0039238576,-0.013247788,-0.015027098,-0.06336868,0.08728208,0.09928009,0.012082607,-0.01772498,0.030303646,0.026511123,-0.046005305,0.0039999033,0.0039957464,0.028890377,-0.05350683,0.0517668,-0.028106896,0.023359627,0.060710415,0.03714369,-0.049650926,0.024279064,-0.02019323,0.05068276,0.009123518,0.04714183,-0.018817093,-0.04534776,-0.094099656,0.003052899,0.05795555,0.033505045,0.052299604,-0.0939387,0.0020009743,-0.0037565199,-0.021669716,-0.030198319,0.009931129,0.0039381944,-0.081058346,-0.08287185,-0.026711527,0.0073498557,0.057289984,-0.020529458,0.009518697,-0.06169756,-0.008009262,0.04744716,-0.10611335,0.009223347,-0.0285082,-0.01789317,0.019728202,0.023406608,-0.021976314,-0.029598825,0.020675555,-0.05233789,-0.04635417,-0.008384523,0.082389526,0.066080496,-0.04954689,-0.0062968424,0.04112282,0.024044214,-0.017035367,0.07574771,-0.10094215,-0.017162034,-0.014694811,-0.009981162,-0.05000597,-0.01345289,0.09225834,0.10927314,0.06320156,0.072772495,-0.0018518136,0.019380048,0.01947731,0.09977747,0.055505756,-0.058314152,-0.06202252,-0.078497,0.013141673,-0.09895583,-0.03484939,-0.00361067,0.0049997326,0.024553265,-0.017789723,0.0038283695,-0.025736123,-0.034644645,0.07084052,0.03954666,-0.02673406,0.020920126,0.016798383,0.019939262,0.08313543,-0.114070855,-0.032421447,3.9229827E-4,-0.049580578,0.05