efined in article 246(6) of\nthis Constitution;\n(d) has been adjudged or otherwise declared bankrupt under any law\nin force in Uganda and has not been discharged; or\n(e) is under a sentence of death or a sentence of imprisonment\nexceeding nine months imposed by any competent court without\nthe option of a fine.\n(3) A person elected to Parliament when he or she is a member of a','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[-0.023011636,0.02931774,0.032086562,-0.06506174,-0.06814138,-0.0067502325,0.02205373,-0.0405781,-0.037063066,0.0785454,-0.024829065,-0.043553945,0.034860384,-0.055731222,0.052766316,-0.014961768,-0.043483227,-0.024655852,-0.0678673,0.12396001,0.09481496,0.009241816,-0.026974311,0.014885835,-0.016108435,-0.07105668,-0.040505297,0.0049082683,0.03835811,-0.026833931,0.050600257,-0.07106578,0.0068282993,0.06599297,-0.02427738,0.0021967122,0.09741348,-0.055181038,0.016737675,-0.08328037,0.0030577,-0.04963938,-0.07241842,-0.14031756,0.02040545,0.060160983,0.07134884,-0.00283372,-0.11990247,-0.06880122,-0.07213715,-0.0011253982,-0.023088649,0.020210758,0.084482044,-0.07846544,-0.051401984,-0.06340382,0.044166308,-0.023616867,-0.038481094,0.01929352,-0.10073011,0.022038063,0.023522345,-0.071465276,-0.018313834,-0.008637702,0.012334937,0.028691262,0.02140427,-0.020918505,0.065430336,0.038408317,-0.043560386,-0.05912623,0.016383078,0.03811007,0.03998876,0.031847212,0.022497281,0.105570145,0.053107888,-0.014064161,0.053793877,-0.057567134,-0.0396544,0.013194233,-0.018179905,-0.04861422,-0.008578467,0.06637654,0.13892654,0.043272678,0.06241202,-0.024368607,0.10724855,-0.006843697,0.07793761,0.069631554,-0.04969714,-0.0054543116,-0.048184153,-0.008446645,-0.015300265,0.038574185,0.017072333,-0.0017774525,0.029344635,0.016933177,-0.015237551,-0.031429596,-0.04600449,0.046304803,0.045608412,0.012609777,-0.0242976,0.02924569,-0.04185051,0.055395003,-0.05953196,6.108101E-4,0.05891167,-0.11668287,0.06