the High Court; and\n(e) two members of the public, who shall not be lawyers, nominated\nby the President.\n(3) The Attorney General shall be an ex officio member of the\ncommission.\n(4) The Chief Justice, the Deputy Chief Justice and Principal Judge\nshall not be appointed to be chairperson, deputy chairperson or a member of','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[-0.045133326,0.019276297,-0.029543767,-0.07325163,-0.12399245,-0.0011316891,0.010587678,0.010283385,0.022512373,0.05446183,-0.013356067,0.008576612,0.01424894,-0.04907099,0.035951894,0.01712749,0.043206103,-0.00826417,-0.048023824,0.011391392,0.032423165,0.03285169,-0.03783076,-0.01680114,-0.05237362,-0.06589268,-0.10946493,-0.036709353,-0.033529304,-0.07370423,0.01766821,-0.045454133,0.010611725,0.04348219,0.0062531345,0.021388633,0.05909347,0.049036693,0.03306046,-0.03641278,0.07333629,-0.02610935,-0.058257047,-0.11303167,0.037454918,0.042447504,0.004222833,-0.014105107,-0.11705363,-0.015700575,-0.04774319,-0.09220495,0.025764931,0.05093546,-0.05799096,-0.029421646,-0.06953905,-0.040725797,0.030823069,0.022966221,-0.055178914,0.029748818,-0.059102736,0.028741194,0.045634143,-0.12069716,0.053983048,-0.09780549,0.05013423,-0.046135295,-0.0039816853,0.019139975,0.052241676,0.048620414,-0.08976791,0.018893693,0.063593246,0.073971815,0.09297335,-0.070680626,0.115672044,0.016506042,0.045983393,-0.001941248,0.027331404,-0.03849396,-0.04988549,-0.028085647,0.002957794,-0.05446641,0.1056119,0.0021195167,0.0817322,-0.0050358884,0.0021683937,0.010778273,0.025810698,0.006765246,0.009355145,0.0699344,0.024745476,-0.019333594,0.004790812,0.03527112,-0.029105889,0.012887739,-0.049674153,0.02677215,0.021291794,-0.018922037,-0.019813899,-0.0029743023,-0.027416334,0.012608628,0.0135105,0.05446111,0.026456773,0.07703264,0.00644509,0.017875543,-0.07809164,0.06035491,-0.06450061,-0.08005409,0.03605016,0.036967345,0.047958624,-7.4241082E-34,-0.036139857,0.07