ervice commission or any other authority or officer.\n(4) The commission shall make a report to Parliament in respect of\neach year, on the performance of its functions.\n(5) Subject to the provisions of this article, Parliament shall by law\nregulate the functions of the commission and prescribe the categories of\npublic officers to constitute the education service.\nHealth Service Commission.\n169. Health Service Commission.\n(1) There shall be a Health Service Commission.\n(2) The commission shall consist of a chairperson and six other\nmembers at least three of whom shall be persons who have substantial\nexperience in health science, all o','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[-0.03678736,0.03655109,-0.03205861,0.007092826,-0.091620855,0.06748244,0.015243458,-0.033310443,0.008009435,0.04712585,0.052039627,0.038327683,-0.0031709464,0.015390604,-0.006767651,0.0043438333,0.047727656,0.05729719,-0.061186038,0.010357594,0.097640984,0.031156387,-0.0755203,0.031906422,-0.11054473,-0.045827042,-0.043774795,-0.12787603,-0.09034891,-0.07526928,0.0069868835,-0.12703338,-0.017020361,0.04153452,0.0025050777,0.047178354,0.07373797,0.0033475861,0.043813173,-0.02174773,-0.04389028,-0.009715915,-0.06503064,-0.015542249,0.03426343,0.04070936,0.037207235,-0.023166675,-0.10287051,0.02536313,-0.019187111,-0.023744734,-0.018015455,0.0037015406,-0.033122517,0.005699696,-0.022531409,-0.078919195,-0.03992797,0.012874435,-0.10737249,0.010953919,-0.043528784,0.031616718,0.05274682,-0.07964246,-0.014924859,-0.052827142,0.014954992,-0.019036867,-0.04309783,0.00221452,-0.0022424678,0.0038878804,-0.016375938,0.009743098,-0.03578201,0.06470753,0.06128783,-0.17474197,0.12379355,0.08097688,0.07010407,-0.009589201,0.042652197,2.805268E-4,-0.030397594,-0.021505365,0.04633059,0.026485145,0.025386374,0.025908617,0.015235543,-0.025990916,0.043021552,-0.04210547,-0.010777956,-0.06011095,0.037279774,0.015357983,-0.041333936,-0.0131984