ume the\nadministration of the district then—\n(i) where the unexpired term of the council is longer than\ntwelve months, the President shall cause elections to be\nheld for a new district council within sixty days; or\n(ii) where the unexpired term of the council is less than twelve\nmonths, the Presiden','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[-0.042043984,0.024008442,0.07937472,-0.07403272,-0.09974976,-0.044854127,-0.026910435,-0.017576706,-0.04017129,0.11347298,0.062078442,-0.007465356,0.011652712,-0.06842936,0.05389522,-0.019094035,-0.02161047,-0.058404967,-0.104049794,0.09411614,0.123783395,0.02074823,-0.018366175,0.006764833,-0.011463206,-0.01925868,-0.036388256,-0.053807545,-0.0056949644,-0.036971856,0.060443643,-0.044055145,0.02565487,0.008462419,-0.0031817337,0.07818323,0.04041856,-0.009821301,0.074062586,-0.08041547,0.022063913,-0.06583363,0.0065639447,-0.1187348,0.0059549827,0.0317337,0.01521323,-0.0030196838,-0.09611047,-0.05191874,0.055204522,0.022777839,-0.015905464,0.06054541,0.015113454,-0.046238422,0.016810002,-0.07553903,0.0028955245,0.043496627,-0.019609263,0.032777306,-0.05345292,-0.016434014,0.019540261,-0.1477288,0.058869597,-0.11035292,-0.009385105,0.00716599,0.047713537,-0.07237449,0.030117895,-0.0036839412,-0.03758093,-0.008780874,-0.00970334,0.0814334,0.03884437,-0.10039393,0.07741687,0.03960871,0.10541166,-0.05489282,0.030655663,0.00888519,-0.06025746,-0.019586869,0.06342654,0.0015791757,-0.022176102,0.028235015,0.07504071,0.027716061,0.021987496,-0.05174797,0.03443133,-0.051844418,-0.017178776,0.067589775,-0.06849184,0.020044185,-0.007469169,-0.081276715,-0.04109195,-0.03119372,0.015999792,-0.0021847414,0.0030606696,-0.00404666,-0.04811215,-0.097830296,0.054610565,-0.010523937,0.009035938,-0.008941863,0.014407516,0.010182852,-0.023915278,0.019526895,0.004217725,-0.0025934756,0.0025990456,-0.04344596,0.012406001,0.026916295,0.04030353,2.5019288E-34,0.014257173,-0.05903202,-