ians; and\n(d) to engage in productive activities for the development of Uganda.\n210. Parliament to regulate the Uganda Peoples’ Defence Forces.\nParliament shall make laws regulating the Uganda Peoples’ Defence Forces\nand, in particular, providing for—\n(a) the organs and structures of the Uganda Peoples’ Defence Forces;\n(b) recruitment, appointment, promotion, discipline and removal of\nmembers of the Uganda Peoples’ Defence Forces and ensuring\nthat members of the Uganda Peoples’ Defence Forces are\nrecruited from every district of Uganda;\n(c) terms and conditions of service of members of the Uganda','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[-0.027343929,0.025243815,-0.010307066,-0.08432513,-0.027222158,0.022587193,0.026947042,-0.05503936,-0.019796932,0.06348033,0.040143434,-0.058450833,0.03312525,-0.0053232955,0.051676165,-0.03276824,-0.050444245,-0.06443915,-0.081742704,0.09796754,0.012447362,0.072578296,0.0548708,0.0048506605,-0.08237053,-0.019983118,-0.018105643,-0.05657907,-0.007850419,-0.0541492,0.046607878,-0.010975839,0.04422662,0.06805729,-0.080085926,0.08822098,0.08219708,-0.0046270033,0.015094729,-0.04952955,0.0067198533,-0.055132154,-0.007878675,-0.098276936,0.03560727,0.056044612,0.09063808,-0.024637217,-0.0035363713,-0.0386803,0.067988686,-0.0017394292,-0.015510375,0.0032191514,0.06374062,-0.081877075,-0.037511293,-0.10280338,0.015983908,0.021106293,-0.014515884,0.029464958,-0.07858754,0.0022477265,0.059828393,-0.13959022,0.038519163,0.030202197,-0.07489707,0.01916338,0.024531685,-0.01260836,0.09890352,-0.0015412978,-0.034779146,-0.008882997,0.06332678,0.03838204,0.0021369113,-0.12780155,0.08344698,0.10771403,0.12317728,0.005304354,0.040294897,0.003158519,0.012667444,-0.010999658,0.047371186,0.01868177,-0.055935897,-0.008421656,0.13078095,0.059355732,0.05656021,0.009876805,0.08545316,-0.040347602,-0.010834219,0.015420023,0.010506985,-0.036189016,-0.041424748,-0.03556358,-0.045209255