milar purposes.\nEnvironment.\n245. Protection and preservation of the environment.\nParliament shall, by law, provide for measures intended—\n(a) to protect and preserve the environment from abuse, pollution and\ndegradation;\n(b) to manage the environment for sustainable development; and\n(c) to promote environmental awareness.','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[0.019903393,0.11501883,0.10673625,0.005396922,0.08270888,0.0071952255,0.03565363,-0.09782882,-0.13422304,0.039564796,-0.044047132,-0.091897815,0.049608275,-0.00972604,-0.031075796,0.086259134,0.025959196,0.058492213,-0.031627327,0.124942474,0.07600365,0.0489331,-0.020290574,-0.003146495,-0.054826498,0.06572119,-0.051602527,0.014670816,0.060691006,-0.008615737,0.014978071,0.034407087,0.061552055,-0.008543772,-0.017204713,0.09771941,-0.029689355,-0.0664738,-0.0096123135,0.014270976,-0.07943185,-0.040389728,-0.054640062,-0.04401141,-0.045760144,-0.020842502,0.102815665,-0.097567864,-0.041195888,-0.030626327,0.022500277,0.045721516,-0.09718144,-0.072089665,-0.012131469,-0.10575543,-0.008842896,-0.016656084,0.011790652,-0.037640136,0.07910377,-0.001572345,-0.0287646,0.0074439533,0.085927054,0.023779366,-0.020841828,0.050695278,-0.053279098,-0.027092604,0.012020791,-0.018050263,0.054500975,-0.02568723,-0.09829643,0.019670881,0.0016249256,9.606991E-4,-0.036102604,-0.047364216,-0.03687525,0.017599842,0.046049867,-0.08138381,0.052088793,0.051968325,-0.035751957,0.0017032311,0.08354349,-0.044993944,0.018972034,0.007019559,0.029504528,0.060402922,0.074559316,0.033950523,0.0013852862,-0.015527052,0.0033517757,0.036351558,0.03903052,0.055506367,-0.047481794,-0.04244927,-0.059102304,-0.046334866,-0.07588218,0.004566234,-0.0019430936,0.08632666,-0.032240033,-0.017273696,-0.03746916,0.008040166,0.0012648765,0.055031043,0.031594098,-0.035899185,0.05015953,0.0012217363,0.04892014,-0.05471795,0.022381362,-0.018919596,0.04812833,-0.064066164,-0.0032282763