ns” includes powers and duties;\n(k) “Gazette” means The Uganda Gazette and includes any\nsupplement of that Gazette;\n(l) “Government” means the Government of Uganda;\n(m) “health service” means any part of the public service established\nas the health service by Parliament by law in conformity with this\nConstitution;\n(n) “High Court” means the High Court of Uganda;\n(o) “judgment” includes a decision, an order or decree of the court;\n(p) “judicial power” means the power to dispense justice among\npersons and between persons and th','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[-0.031153679,0.0721368,0.03021308,-0.07963707,-0.07189827,-0.0025254576,0.00576263,0.011647481,0.018949436,0.08491436,0.019777646,-0.0018540293,-0.0059827026,-0.057904635,0.052275587,-0.020633182,-0.029713798,-0.044932134,-0.03895209,0.08585491,0.14947422,0.0633114,-0.044962637,0.030848756,-0.017065657,0.002754582,-0.036737155,-0.047627673,0.0264554,-0.034483228,0.058188785,0.03164334,0.021217667,0.011344598,-0.009977229,0.03419846,0.075430095,-0.034886826,0.02269438,-0.08296574,0.012373496,-0.06308609,-0.050205246,-0.11617685,0.028998153,0.033800654,0.03100519,8.0432976E-4,-0.07495855,0.014513095,-0.07795628,-0.058810275,-0.008804073,0.04025733,-0.012512572,-0.057494793,-0.061132446,-0.04508275,0.044779122,-0.011392435,-0.048539363,0.03983755,-0.094365604,0.030608466,0.0030570107,-0.09656007,0.059930667,-0.073798,0.02269647,-0.041409366,0.031788833,-0.029836506,0.07961956,0.030166985,-0.12706561,-0.05329355,-0.0037168122,0.06561249,0.07042281,-0.07847678,0.0023671826,0.050062824,0.070077285,-0.04990463,0.025185598,-0.06268189,-0.025213547,-0.005741071,0.02727674,-0.021323837,0.038512826,0.024198795,0.07134992,0.05574567,0.033151075,-0.06800446,0.07473422,-0.043453082,0.050361358,0.06588347,-0.028939333,0.042722505,-0.06800684,-0.010844086,0.019313144,-0.017268458,-0.01522435,-0.023631668,-0.012194162,-0.02408435,-0.045944553,-0.