ctions and other matters connected with\nelections to any office under this Constitution;\n(c) ensure that the tribunal for determination of disputes in respect of\ndemarcation of electoral areas is appointed;\n(d) make laws for the expeditious disposal of appeals referred to in\narticle 64 of this Constitution;\n(e) ensure that adequate resources and facilities are provided to the\nInterim Electoral Commission in accordance with article 66 of\nthis Constitution.\n266. Existing courts of judicature.\nThe Supreme Court and the High Court in existence immediately bef','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[-0.08765767,-0.008018015,0.016615478,-0.01387068,-0.014002583,0.066587925,-0.0048966017,-0.015452724,-0.012941473,0.012668061,0.03490997,0.01474933,0.025619505,-0.044605132,0.07344593,1.9953508E-4,-0.0049066683,0.056319218,-0.025578592,0.053167485,0.06854478,0.015275356,-0.08210783,-0.026742004,-0.02743182,-0.05783442,-0.03733249,-0.0010138676,0.04597332,-0.054465096,0.014398239,-0.04241599,-0.0783736,0.041393563,0.039064772,-0.011474805,0.026562056,-0.07983727,0.009009631,-0.048943434,0.026318941,-0.014304859,-0.051788405,-0.034062956,0.005746106,0.04982037,-0.004742349,-0.012927122,-0.12213983,-0.010777894,-0.0136375455,0.0028371566,-0.02818956,0.077117264,0.039939843,-0.05847531,-0.042407654,-0.08274631,-0.016066002,-0.07677874,0.0021432766,-0.017513568,-0.06298841,-0.026407624,-0.014110198,-0.008769825,0.034124617,-0.06926042,0.029007388,-0.0038085335,-0.06213977,-0.062324658,0.014251352,-0.005900451,-0.08898408,-0.08155679,0.0040737255,0.1291872,0.046488415,-0.06752411,0.04777834,0.10954661,0.02942436,-0.045278393,0.003282618,-0.0050722463,-0.027083743,0.004206762,-0.039859425,0.050663274,0.005955097,0.06663167,0.06921474,-0.028408136,0.032649282,-0.052557647,0.054165415,-0.021798564,0.1829531,0.061649468,-0.024588313,0.04943949,-0.025821272,0.01674268,-0.05913456,-0.006059174,-0.06546075,-0.013