oming into\nforce of this Constitution; and Uganda or the Government, as the case may\nbe, shall continue to be a party to it.\n288. Repeal of 1967 Constitution and Legal Notice No. 1 of 1986.\n(1) Subject to articles 264 and 265 of this Constitution, the\nConstitution of Uganda of 1967 and Legal Notice No. 1 of 1986 as amended,\nshall, upon the coming into force of this Constitution, stand repealed.\n(2) For the avoidance of doubt, the enactments repealed by clause (1)\nof this article, shall, notwithstanding the repeal, continue in force for the\npurposes only of the exercise by the NRM Government of its functions under\narticles 264 and 265 of this Constitution.\n_____','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[-0.016697744,0.07773165,0.08138061,-0.04366269,-0.036963448,0.0039473996,-0.068015076,-0.023426736,-0.036405783,0.09719048,0.013114341,0.10189702,-0.0150141865,-0.05126326,0.044805013,0.015478612,-0.09166172,-0.0131737925,-0.05828524,0.099049255,0.033966128,0.116008885,-0.0057693697,0.044461515,-0.006245705,0.027440166,-0.029230054,-0.019094247,0.033374928,-0.058605604,-0.009822879,0.057963237,-0.10296665,0.026198613,0.005082766,-0.05172056,0.07358455,-0.043149672,0.09165825,-0.07691238,0.034004364,-0.045841012,-0.026195273,-0.120555595,0.0057270215,0.06406517,-0.014349939,-1.2289103E-4,-0.083942585,0.06264378,0.024862587,-0.07745278,-0.033176173,0.03903935,0.07846455,-0.037602667,-0.091136634,-0.045981523,0.038580913,0.066931635,0.034071732,0.018881688,-0.08628669,0.011631316,0.008130151,-0.0807787,0.07664399,-0.06815916,-0.0513352,0.019297486,-0.012656714,-0.0458564,0.0693173,-0.018543884,0.0051276116,0.0050826217,-0.013173959,0.0378628,0.026930474,-0.101745486,0.035435375,0.020958083,0.09276113,-0.07856561,0.07746266,-0.074859805,-0.003915717,0.0032456275,0.122075334,-0.031327393,-0.02244581,-0.0067253234,0.10507247,-0.037755866,-0.017986462,-0.010416715,0.035335265,-0.034896664,0.019021135