 the Almighty God/solemnly affirm that I will not directly or\nindirectly reveal such matters as shall be debated by the Cabinet and\ncommitted to my secrecy. [So help me God.]\n_____\nFifth Schedule.\narticle 178.\nAreas of cooperation among districts.\n1. Culture.\n2. Cultural and traditional lands.\n3. Promotion of local languages, crafts and antiquities.\n4. Education.\n5. Inter- and intra-district roads.\n6. Health.','5b61e676e218c67447284dbefc988bf1aeaf087d564b594fc8271fc20061ebe8','Uganda Constitution 1995','General','[-0.04996252,0.078960255,0.06564111,-0.10045396,-0.017230347,0.024882333,0.09250646,-0.020272257,0.012496179,0.014821446,-0.028196225,-0.05545102,-0.0058732284,-0.02684839,0.029416937,0.06260885,-0.08761427,-0.014277402,-0.08662565,0.05494679,0.0664444,0.06658204,-0.003748399,0.039269585,-0.007501712,0.0022750567,-0.0046845926,-0.0316756,0.0010296918,-0.061387677,-0.024348743,-0.0029696834,0.029035553,0.011941108,-0.004024191,0.03657648,0.06344393,0.058727127,0.06866485,-0.04366808,0.015473404,-0.021469906,-0.041493982,-0.071365364,-0.0121448245,-0.008216787,0.032968394,0.074765295,-0.053435866,-0.05081832,-0.06991624,-0.08511031,-0.052755363,-5.515217E-4,0.017617496,-0.061474755,-0.024479141,-0.080819644,0.012443038,-0.028416285,-0.043258987,0.033765014,-0.019798195,0.0433742,-0.019187126,-0.0819968,0.03191905,-0.014018023,-0.08744323,0.030961415,0.009913343,-0.010740212,0.078105904,0.013730567,-0.1589573,-0.045385286,-0.019479629,0.018681813,0.035695706,-0.028647853,-0.012320956,0.056334224,0.10017153,0.020557748,0.0016283673,-0.07425912,-0.051126745,-0.08365116,0.0071809664,-0.021934934,0.004983832,-0.004193543,0.11820128,0.032109052,0.050241094,3.072748E-4,0.031124799,-0.039653875,-0.02788488,0.111325376,-0.03137591,0.04192646,-0.09304205,-0.02177579,0.027942328,0.049728118,-0.080937795,-0.09848526,-0.02074283,0.015247056,0.048887823,0.0028060512,-0.08688387,-0.062370684,-5.731389E-4,0.039628398,-0.105825104,0.025228607,0.011759608,0.0226196